 and emergencies", "imageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816204131-9321bc958398416c9ba24a3444c7178a.webp", "position": 6, "solutionSlug": "travel"}], "eyebrow": "Insurance Solutions", "heading": "Coverage for individuals, families and businesses"}, "visible": true, "position": 1, "settings": {"layoutGroup": "", "sectionType": "solution-cards", "layoutColumn": 1}}, {"id": "218c2551-71e6-41f2-9186-246da486e462", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Calculate your medical or motor insurance quote instantly through our transparent online price calculator.", "heading": "Instant Insurance Quotes", "buttonHref": "/en/quote", "buttonLabel": "Get an Instant Quote"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "11000000-0001-0003-0000-000000000003", "type": "section", "styles": {"size": "base", "tone": "default", "preset": "default", "bordered": true}, "content": {"intro": "We assess your needs, compare suitable insurers, arrange your cover and stay involved through renewals and claims after purchase.", "items": [{"body": "We start with your priorities, risks and budget so we can identify the cover that genuinely fits.", "title": "1) Understand what you need"}, {"body": "We compare coverage, terms, exclusions and price across suitable insurers and explain the differences clearly.", "title": "2) Compare suitable insurers"}, {"body": "We handle placement and documentation, then review your cover as your needs change and at renewal.", "title": "3) Arrange and maintain your cover"}, {"body": "When something happens, we help prepare the claim, deal with the insurer and follow it through to settlement.", "title": "4) Support you at claim time"}], "layout": "split", "eyebrow": "How we work", "heading": "From advice to claims, we stay with you"}, "visible": true, "position": 2, "settings": {"layoutGroup": "", "sectionType": "steps", "layoutColumn": 2}}, {"id": "57856411-6c40-4191-8038-3938aaa373b4", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Independent advice, clear comparisons and dedicated support — from choosing your cover to handling a claim.", "items": [{"text": "Licensed Broker Company — Ministry of Economy & Trade · License No. 581"}, {"text": "Independent comparison across suitable insurers"}, {"text": "Clear guidance on coverage, limits and exclusions"}, {"text": "Dedicated support when you need to make a claim"}], "heading": "Why choose Triple H?"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "3a098838-ccfb-4ae7-bc22-3ca9e66bb2a5", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "e3071e2b-be41-4d50-a11c-5d701cd82438", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "3a2c3714-0ee0-47e0-a032-a736e1cab03b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Ready to find the right cover?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "b8d1b38a-50d0-4633-ac3a-f7be857df19d", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Get an instant quote or request tailored guidance from our insurance advisors."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "4deb43ea-07d4-4e43-8660-06d8334ead40", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/quote", "label": "Get an Instant Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "229e2608-0dfe-4beb-bef7-7afe5bac7813", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request Tailored Advice", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings