ch, we will provide a secure way to share them.", "items": [{"name": "name", "step": "", "type": "text", "label": "Full name", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "email", "step": "", "type": "email", "label": "Email address", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "phone", "step": "", "type": "tel", "label": "Telephone", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "enquiry_type", "step": "", "type": "select", "label": "How can we help?", "source": "", "options": "Insurance quote, Existing policy, Renewal, Claims, Careers, General enquiry", "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "message", "step": "", "type": "textarea", "label": "Message", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}], "columns": 2, "heading": "Send a message", "recipient": "h.hamed@triplehbroker.com", "appearance": "underline", "submitLabel": "Send Message", "optionalLabel": "Optional", "successMessage": "Thank you — your message has been recorded and an advisor will reply shortly."}, "visible": true, "position": 4, "settings": {"layoutGroup": "contact-main", "sectionType": "form", "layoutColumn": 2, "presentationVersion": 2}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "contact", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('e42fe11a-b213-4261-a1d4-a62caa5ff668', 'Cargo Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/cargo-insurance', '2026-09-23 17:17:11.410496+00', '{"Title": "Cargo Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Cargo Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Protect goods in transit by sea, air or road with cargo insurance arranged by Triple H Insurance Broker in Lebanon."}, "Description": "Cargo insurance in Lebanon for goods in transit by sea, air or road. Compare insurers and arrange suitable cover with Triple H Insurance Broker.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://www.triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/cargo-insurance"}', '2026-09-20 18:25:37.91445+00', false, false, 'en', 'd7d49dba-adc5-4b7a-9807-41045ced2962', 'builder', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "27ed1503-85d9-4385-b251-91692d24b34a", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Protect your goods against physical loss or damage while in transit by sea, air or road, with cover arranged around the cargo, route and value of each shipment.", "items": [{"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "BUSINESS & EMPLOYEE INSURANCE", "heading": "Cargo Insurance", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "2fd7d292-2f3d-4749-9df5-beda720509c6", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Cargo insurance protects goods against physical loss or damage while they are being transported by sea, air or road. Triple H compares suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and arranges cover around the goods, shipment value, route, mode of transport and required level of protection.", "eyebrow": "CARGO INSURANCE", "heading": "What is cargo insurance?", "audience": "Importers, exporters, manufacturers, traders and distributors that need to protect goods, raw materials or finished products while in transit.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a Quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "d5463ea5-5657-4653-b99f-ced62fef139c", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "0608f609-3ba4-456e-9fec-57f38945aaa0", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "0f8e72b2-790e-4371-a29c-833f5a5e3b61", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "How can cargo insurance cover be structured?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "5bedd978-502a-43cf-9e40-64075f49706f", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cargo cover can be structured around how often you ship, the level of protection required, the transport methods used and any additional risks that need to be insured."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "592c22bb-3c15-4283-90ea-cc7e0965cfa4", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "eeb927e7-6d29-41f3-863a-39fa6fb8cf9e", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "29c7974b-8c20-4cfd-a2fe-783b4183c9a3", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Single-Shipment Cover", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "134d03a3-58d1-4522-a5d4-15a9c9041daf", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover can be arranged for an individual shipment when goods are transported occasionally, with the policy based on the cargo, insured value, route and mode of transport."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "c19a751b-3919-4284-bdc5-a10c7d77e713", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "e997aa2c-a467-4678-83bb-ee0b434cc931", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Open Cargo Cover", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "0dee23ce-e18b-409f-85b7-4dd2d5d7806e", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Businesses that ship regularly can arrange open cover for qualifying shipments during an agreed period, with shipments declared in line with the arrangement rather than placing each shipment separately."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "264e1b81-9a06-4ea9-885c-0cf6765c59df", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "0cd88171-c04d-409b-b797-6622804278a2", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Institute Cargo Clauses", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "54826180-c5ba-437c-8c25-d51d3fa97c90", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover can be arranged under Institute Cargo Clauses A, B or C, with each clause providing a different level of protection against loss or damage during transit."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "87fb574b-bcf5-47fc-865c-bd2d0b85c7df", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "a6636a95-2fdf-42ed-a754-bb56e529ee0a", "type": "heading", "content": {"text": "Additional Transit Risks", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "22765c04-d2d5-49d4-b9eb-01e7eba31129", "type": "text", "content": {"text": "Additional protection can be arranged for risks such as war and strikes where required and available, depending on the route, transport method and policy terms."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "26fae2ae-de69-4bd1-9e78-ac6ad94602d4", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare insurers, Institute Cargo Clauses, insured values, routes, transport methods, deductibles, extensions and exclusions, arrange suitable cover for your shipments, and handle claims with the insurer from notification through assessment and settlement.", "intro": "Depending on the policy and level of protection selected, cargo insurance can cover physical loss or damage to goods during transit, together with certain handling risks, transit expenses and additional risks where specifically included.", "items": [{"text": "Physical Loss or Damage in Transit"}, {"text": "Theft, Pilferage & Non-Delivery, Where Covered"}, {"text": "Breakage, Leakage & Contamination, Where Covered"}, {"text": "Loading, Unloading & Handling Risks, Where Covered"}, {"text": "General Average & Salvage Contributions"}, {"text": "Storage in Transit & Transshipment, Subject to Policy Terms"}, {"text": "Survey & Loss-Minimization Expenses, Where Covered"}, {"text": "War & Strikes Risks, Where Added"}, {"text": "Sea, Air & Road Transit"}], "heading": "What can cargo insurance cover?", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "996f44dc-956c-4131-b11c-341440fe53e1", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right cargo policy depends on more than premium. The level of cover, insured value, transit terms, shipment frequency, exclusions and claims conditions can all make a significant difference to the protection provided.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer reputation, cargo experience, financial strength and claims handling record"}, {"text": "Institute Cargo Clauses and level of protection selected"}, {"text": "Basis of insured value and maximum value per shipment"}, {"text": "Single-shipment cover or annual open cover and declaration requirements"}, {"text": "Origins, destinations, routes and modes of transport covered"}, {"text": "Transit start and end points, storage and transshipment conditions"}, {"text": "Cargo type, packing requirements and commodity-specific restrictions"}, {"text": "Deductibles, excesses, sublimit and other policy conditions"}, {"text": "War, strikes, piracy and other special-risk terms or extensions"}, {"text": "Claims settlement basis, survey requirements and insurer assessment process"}], "heading": "What to compare before choosing cargo insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "c1dec613-7c1b-45b7-a815-88b73fa53732", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We review what you ship and how it moves, compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and cargo terms, then arrange the selected cover and keep it aligned with your shipments.", "items": [{"body": "We review the type of goods, shipment values, packing, origins and destinations, transport methods and how frequently you ship.", "title": "Review Your Cargo & Transit"}, {"body": "We compare insurers in Lebanon by Institute Cargo Clauses, insured values, deductibles, transit conditions, extensions, exclusions and premium.", "title": "Compare Suitable Insurers"}, {"body": "We place the selected cover, confirm the insured cargo and transit terms, and arrange the required policy or shipment documentation.", "title": "Arrange the Selected Cover"}, {"body": "For regular shippers, we handle relevant declarations, policy changes and renewals as shipment values, routes, goods or transport arrangements change.", "title": "Manage Ongoing Shipments"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange cargo insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "66c4b920-7c08-4143-a26b-206b74152c31", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact Triple H as soon as you become aware of loss or damage. We manage the claim with the insurer from notification through assessment and settlement and coordinate the process on your behalf.", "items": [{"text": "We notify the insurer, confirm the documents required and help you provide photographs, transport documents, invoices and other supporting evidence."}, {"text": "We coordinate with the insurer, surveyor and carrier where required, and follow the assessment while the cause and extent of the loss are established."}, {"text": "We review the proposed settlement against the policy terms and continue following the claim until the insurer concludes the process and any covered amount is settled."}], "heading": "What to do when your cargo is lost or damaged in transit?"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "8b44bf44-804e-404a-997e-78bf0a48356f", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Practical answers about cargo cover, Institute Cargo Clauses, open cover, transit terms, shipment values, claims and the information needed to arrange insurance.", "items": [{"answer": "Cargo insurance covers the goods being transported. Marine insurance can cover the vessel, machinery and related marine liabilities. They protect different risks.", "question": "Q1 – What is the difference between cargo insurance and marine insurance?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Cover can be arranged for sea, air and road transit, including inland transit where required, subject to the agreed route and policy terms.", "question": "Q2 – Can cargo insurance cover goods transported by sea, air and road?"}, {"answer": "They provide different levels of cargo protection. Clause A offers the broadest cover, while Clauses B and C cover specified risks, with Clause C providing the narrower protection.", "question": "Q3 – What are Institute Cargo Clauses A, B and C?"}, {"answer": "Open cover is designed for businesses that ship regularly. Instead of arranging a separate policy for every shipment, qualifying shipments are declared under an agreed policy arrangement.", "question": "Q4 – What is open cargo cover?"}, {"answer": "Transit cover can extend from the point the goods leave the agreed place of origin until delivery at the agreed destination, subject to the transit clause, time limits and policy conditions.", "question": "Q5 – When does cargo insurance cover start and end?"}, {"answer": "No. A carrier’s liability is separate and can be subject to contractual or legal limits and defenses. Cargo insurance protects the insured goods according to the cover arranged.", "question": "Q6 – Does the carrier’s liability replace cargo insurance?"}, {"answer": "That depends on the sales contract and when responsibility for the goods transfers between the parties. We review the shipment terms and confirm who has the insurable interest before arranging cover.", "question": "Q7 – Who should insure the cargo — the buyer or the seller?"}, {"answer": "Not necessarily. War and strikes are commonly subject to separate clauses, terms or extensions, so they should be specifically checked when the cover is arranged.", "question": "Q8 –  Are war and strikes automatically covered?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Cargo should be packed appropriately for the goods and the journey. We help you understand any relevant insurer requirements before cover is arranged so the shipment is insured on the correct basis.", "question": "Q9 – Does the way the goods are packed matter?"}, {"answer": "Preserve the goods and packaging where possible, document the damage and contact Triple H promptly. We notify the insurer, coordinate any required survey and handle the claim process on your behalf.", "question": "Q10 – What should we do if cargo arrives damaged or part of the shipment is missing?"}, {"answer": "The insurer may require the policy or certificate, transport document, commercial invoice, packing list, delivery records, photographs, correspondence with the carrier and any survey report. We coordinate the required documents.", "question": "Q11 – What documents may be required for a cargo claim?"}, {"answer": "We usually need the type of goods, shipment value, packing method, origin and destination, mode of transport, shipment frequency and any additional cover or special risks you want to consider.", "question": "Q12 – What information do we need for a cargo insurance quote?"}], "heading": "Cargo Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "b890d5ce-4653-4c4c-a715-6e303f7ae67b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other cover that can protect your vessels, property and business operations alongside cargo insurance.", "heading": "Other Business Insurance", "buttonHref": "/en/solutions/business", "buttonLabel": "Explore Business Insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "6e60e064-c0be-4aa9-b73f-6ff7dfccaddd", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "5ffd3373-5d6b-4a4e-b066-914d98553d2e", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "cd7e2dc8-1a5a-4735-8629-d49d56681eee", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Get a cargo insurance quote", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "d8eb45ee-58df-488f-ac26-1b28ac50c157", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us about your goods, shipment value, origin, destination and transport method. We’ll compare suitable insurers and come back with clear written options."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "4c14f5d7-db1f-424f-b131-a8d061000a43", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "021445d1-996f-4962-b5a0-76ee72b67df6", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005', 'Request a quote', 'en/quote', '2026-09-25 15:57:06.209662+00', '{"Title": "Get an Insurance Quote in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Get an Insurance Quote in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Request an insurance quote from Triple H and receive a tailored comparison based on your personal or business insurance needs."}, "Description": "Request an insurance quote in Lebanon from Triple H. Tell us what you need to protect and our advisors will provide a tailored insurance comparison.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/quote"}', '2026-08-08 09:47:55.658896+00', false, true, 'en', '3705bf5c-a664-bcfa-6086-7fa43204dd71', 'quote', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "11000000-0005-0001-0000-000000000001", "type": "section", "styles": {"size": "base", "tone": "default", "preset": "cinematic-tall", "bordered": false}, "content": {"intro": "Three short steps. An advisor reviews every submission personally and replies within one working day.", "items": [], "eyebrow": "Quote request", "heading": "Request a quote", "mobileImageUrl": "/uploads/20260925155651-b040f57765234beab6e87ed803d19d5c.webp", "desktopImageUrl": "/uploads/20260925155344-fa2b7c96a32047e39f07eb9eaf3a41f6.webp"}, "visible": true, "position": 0, "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "9bf437c8-506b-44a6-b770-538a1767ad6b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "", "items": [{"name": "covers", "step": "Cover", "type": "checkbox-group", "label": "What would you like to insure?", "source": "solution-pages", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "coverFor", "step": "Details", "type": "select", "label": "Insured party", "source": "", "options": ["Myself or my family", "My company"], "required": false, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "existing", "step": "Details", "type": "select", "label": "Do you hold cover today?", "source": "", "options": ["Yes, renewing", "No, first time", "Not sure"], "required": false, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "budget", "step": "Details", "type": "text", "label": "Approximate annual budget", "source": "", "options": [], "required": false, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "notes", "step": "Details", "type": "textarea", "label": "Anything we should know", "source": "", "options": [], "required": false, "placeholder": "Current insurer, sums insured, specific concerns…"}, {"name": "name", "step": "Contact", "type": "text", "label": "Full name", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "email", "step": "Contact", "type": "email", "label": "Email address", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "phone", "step": "Contact", "type": "tel", "label": "Telephone", "source": "", "options": [], "required": true, "placeholder": ""}, {"name": "preferred", "step": "Contact", "type": "select", "label": "Preferred contact method", "source": "", "options": ["Email", "Telephone", "WhatsApp"], "required": false, "placeholder": ""}], "heading": "A little more detail", "backLabel": "Back", "nextLabel": "Continue", "recipient": "", "submitLabel": "Submit request", "successMessage": "Thank you. An advisor will review your request and reply within one working day."}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "multi-step-form"}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "quote", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('50670160-db80-4b4e-a2f2-5f15ba35d9d1', 'Health Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/health', '2026-09-24 11:52:22.324356+00', '{"Title": "Individual & Family Health Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Individual & Family Health Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816184252-b4559109afd8488f964382ca0980acda.webp", "Description": "Explore individual and family health insurance in Lebanon with clear comparisons of networks, benefits, limits and terms."}, "Description": "Compare individual and family health insurance in Lebanon. Triple H compares suitable insurers, networks, benefits, limits and terms and arranges your cover.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/health"}', '2026-08-19 12:29:08.133055+00', false, false, 'en', 'ad93bac6-696d-443e-96cc-f7c66962edf5', 'solution-detail', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "1d5bfbc3-817c-4775-8c80-9462c185b998", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Health insurance for individuals and families, arranged around the medical care, provider network and geographic cover you need. We compare suitable insurers, explain the important differences clearly and arrange the policy around your needs.", "eyebrow": "PERSONAL & FAMILY INSURANCE", "heading": "Individual & Family Health Insurance", "audience": "Individuals and families looking for private medical insurance in Lebanon or suitable international health cover.", "buttonHref": "/en/quote", "buttonLabel": "Get an instant quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "41fb4ef0-e1da-491e-a7fe-7f79a3ef9205", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We approach suitable insurers, compare medical networks, benefits, limits, exclusions, and premiums, explain the differences clearly and arrange the cover that fits your needs.", "intro": "Health insurance can include a range of medical benefits, with cover, limits and conditions depending on the selected plan and insurer.", "items": [{"text": "In-patient: Hospitalisation and surgery"}, {"text": "In-patient: Emergency medical treatment"}, {"text": "Out-patient: Diagnostic tests, scans and physiotherapy"}, {"text": "Cancer and other major medical treatment"}, {"text": "Maternity and newborn care"}, {"text": "International emergency medical treatment"}], "heading": "What it covers", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "2815b4a0-3089-4b30-93c5-9fa63df5de92", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right health insurance depends on more than the premium. These are some of the main points to compare before choosing a plan.", "items": [{"text": "Hospital and medical provider network"}, {"text": "Overall annual cover and individual benefit limits"}, {"text": "In-patient and out-patient benefits"}, {"text": "Deductibles and co-payments"}, {"text": "Pre-existing condition terms"}, {"text": "Waiting periods"}, {"text": "Geographic area of cover"}, {"text": "Exclusions and policy conditions"}], "heading": "What to compare"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "0ea6e293-6455-40e0-8a6e-7ea78e591efe", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "From understanding your needs to arranging the policy, we manage each step and stay involved afterwards.", "items": [{"body": "We understand what you need and identify the plans that best match the cover, benefits and budget you are looking for.", "title": "Understand your needs"}, {"body": "We approach suitable insurers and compare networks, benefits, limits, exclusions, and premiums.", "title": "Compare suitable options"}, {"body": "We explain the differences clearly, help you choose the option that best suits your needs and arrange the policy for you.", "title": "Explain and arrange"}, {"body": "We handle insurer communication and stay involved with policy changes, renewals and claims throughout the life of your policy.", "title": "Stay involved"}], "layout": "grid", "eyebrow": "", "heading": "How we arrange your health insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "6dacc283-0dcc-4764-bc33-7501a1f84986", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact our 24/7 hotline whenever you need support using your health insurance, and we coordinate the necessary arrangements and approvals on your behalf.", "items": [{"text": "If you need hospital admission and any issue arises, you or a family member can contact us directly. We coordinate with the hospital admissions team, the TPA and the insurer to secure the required approval, so your treatment can proceed without unnecessary delay."}, {"text": "For tests, scans, physiotherapy and other out-patient services that require approval, tell us the day and time that suit you. You can choose the medical provider, or we can recommend a suitable one. We arrange the appointment and secure the required pre-approval in advance, so when you arrive, you only need to present your medical card and ID or passport and proceed with the approved treatment."}], "heading": "What to do when you need medical care"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "6d5add99-a872-4c24-8d68-2723eea4eb9f", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Answers to common questions about individual and family health insurance, including premiums, medical conditions, hospital networks, family cover and policy terms.", "items": [{"answer": "The premium can vary according to age, hospital network, in-patient and out-patient benefits, geographic area of cover, policy limits, deductibles or co-payments, medical underwriting and the insurer’s pricing. A lower premium does not necessarily provide the same protection, so we compare the policy terms as well as the price.", "question": "Q1 – What affects the cost of individual and family health insurance?"}, {"answer": "It depends on the condition, the insurer and the medical underwriting. Cover may be offered with specific terms, waiting periods, limitations or exclusions, so we compare the available options and explain the differences before you choose.", "question": "Q2 – Can I get health insurance if I have a pre-existing or chronic condition?"}, {"answer": "The hospital network determines which hospitals and medical providers are available under the policy and can also affect the premium. We compare the available networks against the level of access and hospitals that matter to you.", "question": "Q3 – How does the hospital network affect my health insurance?"}, {"answer": "Health insurance can be arranged for individuals and families. Eligibility for spouses, children and parents can depend on age, dependency rules, medical underwriting and the insurer’s plan structure.", "question": "Q4 – Can I include my spouse, children or parents in my health insurance?"}, {"answer": "Maternity and newborn care can form part of health insurance, with limits, waiting periods and other conditions varying by insurer and plan. We compare these terms carefully so you understand how the cover applies before choosing a policy.", "question": "Q5 – Is maternity and newborn care covered by health insurance?"}, {"answer": "Some benefits or medical conditions may be subject to waiting periods, while others may apply from the policy’s effective date. The applicable waiting periods depend on the insurer, plan and medical underwriting.", "question": "Q6 – Do waiting periods apply to health insurance?"}, {"answer": "Health insurance can include international emergency medical treatment within specified territories, with some plans providing worldwide emergency cover. The geographic scope, financial limits and applicable conditions depend on the selected plan and insurer.", "question": "Q7 – Does health insurance include international emergency medical treatment?"}, {"answer": "The information usually includes the number of people to insure, their ages and the type of cover required. Additional medical information may be requested when needed for underwriting.", "question": "Q8 – What information is needed to get a health insurance quote?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Different options can be considered at renewal, but changing plan or insurer may affect medical underwriting, waiting periods, continuity of cover or the treatment of existing conditions. We compare the alternatives and explain the differences before a change is made.", "question": "Q9 – Can I change my health insurance plan or insurer at renewal?"}], "heading": "Health Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "496a706f-84b8-40c5-bcdb-aa83d9890207", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other insurance solutions we arrange for individuals, families and businesses.", "heading": "Other insurance solutions"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "related-links"}}, {"id": "6066b54a-f52b-4734-84a5-54a1ad9a7f23", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "1be99a97-739e-4821-b776-5b79ef952beb", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "70767a6f-940e-409f-9061-1efcf27c4bb3", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Find the health insurance plan that fits your needs.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "846ccd88-d17c-4e37-bc6d-b5ba339d8960", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Get a quote based on the cover, hospital network and budget you are looking for."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "75678b31-fda9-4b99-b1c3-4072b5ce7298", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/quote", "label": "Get an Instant Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "5d5f311e-4170-4bf3-8bda-17790b39c422", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "solid", "footerVisible": true, "catalogPosition": 0}, "template": "solution-detail", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('3f42fe32-60b0-4178-8d0c-17f6c98b36a4', 'Motor Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/motor', '2026-09-26 21:24:15.03983+00', '{"Title": "Motor Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Private Motor Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816191450-59bd0a59f5a94794bfe58cd9137d769c.webp", "Description": "Explore compulsory, third-party, total loss and all risks motor insurance, compare the available options and get an instant quote."}, "Description": "Compare motor insurance in Lebanon, including compulsory, third-party, total loss and all risks cover. Get an instant quote with Triple H.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/motor"}', '2026-08-19 12:29:08.132784+00', false, false, 'en', '07cb890c-1b1b-49a5-91d9-941d9d3cb90c', 'solution-detail', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "2cc61133-560b-4a6c-b456-23219743e2af", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Motor insurance can protect you, your vehicle and your liability on the road. We compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, explain the differences between the available plans and arrange the cover that fits your vehicle and needs.", "eyebrow": "PERSONAL & FAMILY INSURANCE", "heading": "Individual Motor Insurance", "audience": "Private vehicle owners looking for compulsory, third-party, total loss, all-risks or cross-border motor protection.", "buttonHref": "/en/quote", "buttonLabel": "Get an Instant Quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "f64a45ef-9076-40e5-b4ff-1ef51ecd4b4f", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Compare the available levels of protection and get an instant quote directly for the option that suits you.", "items": [{"href": "/en/quote", "title": "Compulsory Bodily Injury Insurance", "summary": "Mandatory motor insurance in Lebanon covering legal liability for bodily injury or death caused to third parties in a road accident, with cover up to USD 500,000.", "imageAlt": "", "imageUrl": "/uploads/20260926203255-d27dabab93b946efbe1f5de20f8e8e2d.webp", "linkLabel": "Get an Instant Quote"}, {"href": "/en/quote", "title": "Third-Party Material Damage Insurance", "summary": "Now required in Lebanon, covering damage you cause to another person’s vehicle or property, with limits from USD 500,000 to USD 1.5 million and towing after accidents. Selected plans also include towing for mechanical or electrical breakdowns.", "imageAlt": "", "imageUrl": "/uploads/20260926204931-6263e81bdf014f5cb3645641c90f603b.webp", "linkLabel": "Get an Instant Quote"}, {"href": "/en/quote", "title": "Motor Total Loss Insurance", "summary": "Protects your vehicle if it is declared a total loss after an accident, stolen or damaged by fire, with third-party liability, passenger benefits and towing available depending on the selected plan.", "imageAlt": "", "imageUrl": "/uploads/20260926205745-60f0e9ef52af4fb7a61f2edfb9265469.webp", "linkLabel": "Get an Instant Quote"}, {"href": "/en/quote", "title": "Motor All Risks Insurance", "summary": "Provides broad protection for your vehicle against accident damage, fire and theft, with third-party liability, passenger protection, natural events and weather-related damage, roadside assistance and replacement car benefits depending on the selected plan.", "imageAlt": "", "imageUrl": "/uploads/20260926211159-80c63b244e714c8f92eaa74cb8bc89e8.webp", "linkLabel": "Get an Instant Quote"}, {"href": "/en/contact", "title": "Orange Card Insurance", "summary": "Provides compulsory third-party liability protection when driving between participating Arab countries, covering bodily injury or material damage caused to others according to the insurance requirements of the country visited.", "imageAlt": "", "imageUrl": "/uploads/20260926212256-214febf471f1410586645e9b24a5916b.webp", "linkLabel": "Get a Quote"}], "heading": "Motor insurance options"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solutions-catalog"}}, {"id": "71d455e1-0dad-463b-b000-9b5421369d7e", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare the details behind each offer — including cover, limits, repair conditions and assistance benefits — and help you choose the option that best fits your vehicle and needs.", "intro": "Motor insurance can cover liability to others, damage or loss of your vehicle, passenger protection and assistance services, depending on the selected product and plan.", "items": [{"text": "Third-party bodily injury"}, {"text": "Third-party material damage"}, {"text": "Accident damage to your vehicle"}, {"text": "Fire and theft"}, {"text": "Total loss of your vehicle"}, {"text": "Driver and passenger death or disability benefits"}, {"text": "Medical expenses following a covered accident"}, {"text": "Weather and natural event damage"}, {"text": "Strikes, riots, civil commotion and terrorism"}, {"text": "Roadside assistance and towing"}, {"text": "Replacement or rental car after a covered accident"}, {"text": "Theft of vehicle parts where included"}], "heading": "What it covers", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "46302277-0fa2-43da-8f6c-185f8f414c70", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Price and the plan name are only part of the comparison. The insurer, policy terms, limits, repair and settlement conditions, roadside assistance provider and claims service can all make a difference when you need to use the cover.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer and claims service"}, {"text": "Policy terms, conditions, and exclusions"}, {"text": "Third-party liability limits"}, {"text": "Vehicle insured value and total-loss settlement"}, {"text": "When the vehicle is considered a total loss"}, {"text": "Franchise — the amount you pay when a claim occurs"}, {"text": "Official dealer, approved garage and repair quality"}, {"text": "Spare-parts depreciation — your share of replacement-part costs"}, {"text": "Theft settlement and theft of parts"}, {"text": "Minor scratches and dents cover"}, {"text": "Weather and natural event limits"}, {"text": "SRCC and terrorism limits"}, {"text": "Driver and passenger medical benefit limits after an accident"}, {"text": "Driver and passenger death and permanent disability benefit limits"}, {"text": "Roadside assistance provider and towing conditions"}, {"text": "Replacement or rental car benefits"}], "heading": "What to compare"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "76ceb6fb-33f2-426e-a5f8-e3a9aad010d3", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We manage the process from understanding the cover you need to approaching suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, comparing their offers, arranging the policy and supporting you throughout the policy period.", "items": [{"body": "We understand the protection you need based on your vehicle, how it is used and the type of motor cover you are looking for.", "title": "Understand your needs"}, {"body": "We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and compare their offers based on the cover, terms and service that matter to you.", "title": "Compare suitable options"}, {"body": "We explain the differences clearly, help you choose the option that best suits your vehicle and needs, and arrange the policy for you.", "title": "Explain and arrange"}, {"body": "We handle insurer communication and remain involved through policy changes and renewals throughout the policy period.", "title": "Stay involved"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange your motor insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "43434605-1fe9-46da-96b1-b3d4722e3f2b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Call our 24/7 hotline and we take it from there.", "items": [{"text": "When required, we arrange for a motor claims expert to attend the accident location, guide the next steps and coordinate the necessary documentation. We then communicate with the insurer on your behalf, follow the claim and coordinate third-party liabilities according to the policy."}, {"text": "For All Risks claims, we coordinate the vehicle’s repair with the appropriate garage or official dealer and follow the work through completion, helping ensure the agreed repairs are carried out properly."}], "heading": "What to do after an accident"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "4b9a1029-fd1f-4114-869e-94f749273829", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Answers to common questions about motor insurance in Lebanon, from compulsory cover and policy types to total loss, repairs and roadside assistance.", "items": [{"answer": "Motorists in Lebanon are required to carry compulsory insurance for third-party bodily injury and material damage. Bodily injury cover protects against legal liability for injury or death caused to others, while material damage cover protects against damage caused to another person’s vehicle or property.", "question": "Q1 – What motor insurance is required in Lebanon?"}, {"answer": "Third-Party insurance mainly protects against damage caused to others. Total Loss adds protection for major losses such as the vehicle being written off, stolen or damaged by fire. All Risks provides broader protection, including accidental damage to your own vehicle, subject to the selected policy terms.", "question": "Q2 – What is the difference between Third-Party, Total Loss and All Risks insurance?"}, {"answer": "The premium can vary according to the vehicle’s make, model and market value, the type of cover selected, policy limits, repair options and the insurer’s rating criteria. Two similar offers can therefore have different prices and terms.", "question": "Q3 – What affects the cost of motor insurance?"}, {"answer": "In the current plans we compare, a vehicle is generally considered a total loss when repair costs reach or exceed 60 to 65% of its market value at the time of the accident, subject to the selected policy terms and settlement basis.", "question": "Q4 – When is a vehicle considered a total loss?"}, {"answer": "No. All Risks provides broad protection, but limits, exclusions and conditions still apply. Minor damage, theft of parts, natural events, dealer repairs and other benefits can differ between plans.", "question": "Q5 – Does All Risks insurance cover every type of damage?"}, {"answer": "It depends on the selected plan and the vehicle’s age. Some policies include official dealer repairs for eligible vehicles, while others use approved garages. The repair arrangement and quality should be compared before choosing.", "question": "Q6 – Can my vehicle be repaired at the official dealer?"}, {"answer": "The difference can be in the insurer, policy wording, limits, repair network, claims service, roadside assistance provider, settlement conditions and exclusions. We compare these details so you understand how each option actually works.", "question": "Q7 – Why can two All Risks offers that look similar still be different?"}, {"answer": "Orange Card Insurance provides compulsory third-party liability protection when driving in participating Arab countries, according to the requirements of the country visited. It can cover bodily injury and material damage caused to others while driving outside Lebanon.", "question": "Q8 – What is Orange Card Insurance?"}, {"answer": "It depends on the plan. Accident towing is commonly included, while towing following a mechanical or electrical breakdown can vary by policy, including the number of services, distance and assistance provider.", "question": "Q9 – Does motor insurance include towing after a breakdown?"}, {"answer": "Yes. You can get an instant quote for the available Motor Insurance options by entering the required vehicle and cover details, then compare the options available to you.", "question": "Q10 – Can I get an instant quote for motor insurance?"}], "heading": "Motor Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "247cf475-67d5-46df-b95c-4cbba0f5d8cb", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other insurance solutions we arrange for individuals, families and businesses.", "heading": "Other insurance solutions"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "related-links"}}, {"id": "61e3827a-894a-44d6-9da1-9c3a177645d4", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "59896d51-fa50-45cc-9025-fcfa4157d553", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "bec32f5a-3a78-4c71-bb45-3916608fc1fa", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Find the motor insurance plan that fits your vehicle and needs.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "7b719d10-078f-4749-aaf9-639745296316", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Get an instant quote and compare the available motor insurance options for your vehicle."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "fa52a84f-77cb-4034-bfcd-3e64679f78e1", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/quote", "label": "Get an Instant Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "eb871128-572c-4556-9901-511279178f98", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "solid", "footerVisible": true, "catalogPosition": 2}, "template": "solution-detail", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('0a0685cd-1ff4-46f7-82ac-6df6f0c9689b', 'Home Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/home', '2026-09-24 15:24:50.439858+00', '{"Title": "Home Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Home Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816200834-1cb8ffe33d9c4b3986804a0ccbc706a6.webp", "Description": "Protect your home, belongings and liabilities with home insurance arranged around your needs by Triple H Insurance Broker Company."}, "Description": "Compare home insurance in Lebanon for your property, belongings, theft, water damage, natural events and liability. Triple H arranges suitable cover.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/home"}', '2026-08-19 12:29:08.133704+00', false, false, 'en', '1c4feafa-4fe0-4737-9d93-6b9e71fd07cb', 'solution-detail', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "ddcf2a6a-b1ef-45e3-979e-cb7dfc5ced7a", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Home insurance helps protect your home and belongings against risks such as fire, water damage, theft and other covered events. We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, compare the available cover and terms, and arrange the policy around your property and needs.", "eyebrow": "PERSONAL & FAMILY INSURANCE", "heading": "Home Insurance", "audience": "Homeowners, landlords and tenants looking to protect the building, their belongings or both, with cover that can also include liability to others, temporary accommodation and loss of rent.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "254622b5-d292-49bf-9b38-780c0f66edd4", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "fcf0738a-7114-4819-adc9-1db693b4a4f3", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "84a62f1a-3070-46cb-b742-707cbe6f9581", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "What home insurance can protect", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "b6004faf-59c5-4aba-a450-722f0928bcf4", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Home insurance can protect the building, your belongings and certain costs or liabilities caused by damage or loss."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "10fb7635-02cb-4ccd-b895-bceb1eb0b83e", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "a4bb7ba7-705b-408d-94fc-bf8c028f55d1", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "c050466a-8b36-4052-9eca-d1f0e31ceb1b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Building & Fixtures", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "e81cbeed-75c6-46a4-91be-16d12564af7b", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Protection for the physical structure of the home and its permanent parts, such as doors, locks, windows, built-in fixtures and other fixed elements of the property."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "9fadfda4-3013-4286-94d9-cb673ca9fcb9", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "fe7b3116-8809-4b28-976b-1efdb02c8aef", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Contents & Belongings", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "1c15c1a7-6db5-4753-8f24-0c421afdabc6", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Protection for your belongings, such as furniture, appliances, electronics and other personal possessions, depending on the selected policy."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "26a80cf4-f467-461d-9b85-0e0dc3cc2354", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "3ac4cb20-f248-48fc-90b4-0c6f2470614b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Liability to Others & Additional Costs", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "0931148d-19a3-47db-8ea5-192189d892e5", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Protection that can include damage caused to neighbors or other people, legal liability, temporary accommodation and loss of rent after a covered event."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "bfd483cb-e6c5-438c-a553-908e523fdc44", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare suitable home insurance options, explain the important differences clearly and arrange the cover around your property, belongings and needs.", "intro": "Home insurance can protect against damage, loss and liability caused by a range of events, with benefits, limits and conditions depending on the selected policy and insurer.", "items": [{"text": "Fire, explosion and lightning"}, {"text": "Water damage from burst pipes or leaking tanks"}, {"text": "Rain damage and sewer or drain backup"}, {"text": "Theft following forcible entry"}, {"text": "Damage to doors and locks following a break-in"}, {"text": "Storms, floods, hail and other natural events"}, {"text": "Earthquake and tsunami"}, {"text": "Smoke damage"}, {"text": "Electrical fluctuation and related electrical damage"}, {"text": "Plate glass breakage"}, {"text": "Strikes, riots, civil commotion and malicious damage"}, {"text": "Damage caused by vehicle impact or aircraft"}, {"text": "Liability for damage caused to neighbors or other people"}, {"text": "Temporary accommodation or loss of rent after a covered event"}, {"text": "Debris removal and certain professional costs after major damage"}], "heading": "What it covers", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "f0c860d4-7924-4930-9c3f-348877070185", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Two home insurance policies can look similar but differ significantly in what they protect, how much they pay and the conditions that apply. These are the main points to compare before choosing a policy.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer, policy quality and claims service"}, {"text": "Building insured value — the amount used to insure the structure"}, {"text": "Contents insured value and limits"}, {"text": "Limits that apply to individual types of damage or loss"}, {"text": "Deductibles — the amount you pay when a claim occurs"}, {"text": "Water damage and leaking-pipe conditions"}, {"text": "Theft and forcible-entry conditions"}, {"text": "Earthquake, flood and other natural-event cover"}, {"text": "Liability for damage caused to neighbors or other people"}, {"text": "Temporary accommodation and loss-of-rent benefits"}, {"text": "Electrical fluctuation and electrical damage cover"}, {"text": "Limits for cash, valuables and other special belongings"}, {"text": "Exclusions and policy conditions"}], "heading": "What to compare"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "d43533a4-238c-4b06-ab20-8e4836b4b945", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We manage the process from understanding what you need to protect to comparing suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, arranging the policy and supporting you afterwards.", "items": [{"body": "We identify what you want to insure, the type of protection you need and the level of cover that suits you.", "title": "Understand your needs"}, {"body": "We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and compare their offers based on the cover, limits, terms, insurer and claims service.", "title": "Compare suitable options"}, {"body": "We explain the differences clearly, help you choose the option that best fits your home and needs, and arrange the policy for you.", "title": "Explain and arrange"}, {"body": "We handle insurer communication and stay involved through policy changes and renewals throughout the policy period.", "title": "Stay involved"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange your home insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "9be4d41f-29b2-4dfd-a906-103a7c0f6a55", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Call our 24/7 hotline and we manage your claim through every stage until settlement.", "items": [{"text": "When needed, we send a claims expert to the property as quickly as possible to inspect the damage and record what happened. We manage the claim from the beginning, coordinate the expert’s work and make sure the damage and supporting information are properly documented so the claim can move forward correctly."}, {"text": "We then deal with the insurer on your behalf, follow the claim closely and work to secure the settlement and covered benefits due to you under the policy. If the incident also causes damage to neighbors or other third parties, we coordinate the covered liability as well. We handle the communication, documents and follow-up until the claim is concluded, while keeping you informed throughout."}], "heading": "What to do when your home is damaged"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "166ddd3b-966d-4b4a-b43a-4568983708a1", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Answers to common questions about home insurance, including insured values, building and contents cover, theft, valuables, landlords and tenants.", "items": [{"answer": "The premium can vary according to the property, the value of the building and contents being insured, the cover selected, policy limits, deductibles and the insurer’s pricing. We compare the protection and terms as well as the premium.", "question": "Q1 – How is the cost of home insurance calculated?"}, {"answer": "The building and contents should be insured at appropriate values so the policy reflects what you actually need to protect. We help you determine suitable amounts for the property and belongings before comparing the available options.", "question": "Q2 – How much should I insure my home for?"}, {"answer": "Home insurance can be arranged for the building, the contents or both, depending on what you need to protect. Homeowners often protect both, while tenants can insure their belongings and landlords can focus on the property and rental-related risks. We arrange the cover around your situation.", "question": "Q3 – Do I need to insure both the building and the contents?"}, {"answer": "Yes. A building policy may not protect all of your individual needs, such as your belongings, personal liability or other risks linked specifically to your home. We check what is already insured and arrange the additional protection you need without unnecessary duplication.", "question": "Q4 – Can I still arrange home insurance if the building already has insurance?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Home insurance can include protection for stolen belongings and damage caused during a break-in. We compare the theft conditions and limits between insurers and can arrange additional protection for valuable belongings where needed.", "question": "Q5 – Does home insurance cover theft?"}, {"answer": "Home insurance can include protection for damage caused to a neighbor following an insured water leak or other covered event. We compare the available liability limits and arrange the protection around the level of cover you need.", "question": "Q6 – What happens if water from my home damages a neighbor''s property?"}, {"answer": "Home insurance can include temporary accommodation costs while your home cannot be occupied after a covered event. For a rented property, loss of rent can also be included. We compare the available benefits, limits and conditions when arranging the policy.", "question": "Q7 – What if I cannot stay in my home after serious covered damage?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Valuable belongings can be protected, but they may have specific limits or need to be declared or insured separately. We identify what you want to protect and work on arranging suitable limits or additional cover where available so the protection better matches your needs.", "question": "Q8 – Can jewelry, cash and other valuable belongings be insured?"}, {"answer": "We usually need basic details about the property, whether you own or rent it, what you want to insure and the approximate values of the building and contents. Additional information may be requested depending on the property and cover required.", "question": "Q9 – What information is needed for a home insurance quote?"}], "heading": "Home Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "377f1905-288f-475f-bfa1-a5d7fcdccb3f", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other insurance solutions we arrange for individuals, families and businesses.", "heading": "Other insurance solutions"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "related-links"}}, {"id": "81bdd4ed-9a32-4233-9b3a-0c57aceb0db8", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "a4b20baa-409f-4bcb-87f9-56086e3d7d04", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "0018af57-746f-4c88-9da1-199f46d6c7d6", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Protect your home with the right cover.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "9660c25d-49fc-461b-9db7-09630db1400f", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us what you want to protect, and we’ll compare suitable home insurance options and arrange the cover around your needs."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "5a0e60a5-86b7-4402-8ed9-baff4f7a395f", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "7598309a-e7d0-4af6-8acc-2ee7e04d5e7f", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "solid", "footerVisible": true, "catalogPosition": 3}, "template": "solution-detail", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('7d9ee70e-95db-438b-a2fb-307176925240', 'Travel Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/travel', '2026-09-24 12:00:16.122301+00', '{"Title": "Travel Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Travel Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816204131-9321bc958398416c9ba24a3444c7178a.webp", "Description": "Explore travel insurance for single-trip, frequent travel and long stays, with protection around your destination and needs, including visa requirements."}, "Description": "Compare travel insurance in Lebanon for medical emergencies, trip cancellation, baggage, long stays and visa requirements. Triple H arranges suitable cover.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/travel"}', '2026-08-19 12:29:08.133242+00', false, false, 'en', '933c3578-eb28-43fd-b777-8958167721e2', 'solution-detail', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "b3cb6051-1884-4bcf-ac70-113ee360627c", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Travel insurance helps protect you against medical emergencies and unexpected events that can affect your trip before departure or while travelling. We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, compare the available cover and terms, and arrange the policy around your destination, trip and needs.", "eyebrow": "PERSONAL & FAMILY INSURANCE", "heading": "Travel Insurance", "audience": "Individuals and families travelling abroad for holidays, business or other personal trips, including travelers who need insurance for a visa application.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Get a Quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "84778ba9-33e2-45d4-b116-9bc8a948d500", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "66ed3c54-88a0-4d28-ac29-9a24c76f10d1", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "455b45d1-4b3b-4282-bccd-03e9b93adcc9", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Travel insurance options", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "e3428afd-00bf-4ab8-899e-11eb6b327b87", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Travel insurance can be arranged for one trip, several trips during the year or an extended stay, depending on how and where you travel."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "f6f8d7f6-1881-4315-a607-191ef78dd00f", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "33d61e8f-8302-4385-8d48-4a5c2b969458", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "94b3cf29-3b58-4a05-abc3-d3e7266721e4", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Single Trip Insurance", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "1170bb20-0a5d-42e0-82cb-da8a4bbef077", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover for one trip, arranged around your destination, travel dates and the level of protection you need."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "7648187f-2bc4-444e-a482-47d05d11db00", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "e38d59b1-0b52-445f-bd21-0a7293cf29cf", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Annual Multi-Trip Insurance", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "7cf4f07f-9977-4046-b419-7faebfb3a932", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover for several trips during the policy year, giving frequent travelers ongoing protection without arranging a separate policy for every journey."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "afa8d701-1da3-4575-871d-cf31e044a6c0", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "c0992f18-dbbd-455f-80d3-380b7ebf183b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Long-Stay Travel Insurance", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "e3979e06-17e9-41b2-969d-2019eba9a119", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover for one extended trip, arranged around the destination, length of stay and level of protection you need."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "76227548-cb83-4455-af84-b8a5a0f0b2fe", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare suitable travel insurance plans in the Lebanese market, explain the important differences clearly and arrange the cover around your destination, length of stay and travel needs.", "intro": "Travel insurance can protect you against medical emergencies, trip disruption and other unexpected events before departure or while travelling, with benefits and limits depending on the selected policy.", "items": [{"text": "Emergency medical treatment and hospitalization"}, {"text": "Medical evacuation and return home when medically necessary"}, {"text": "Repatriation in the event of death"}, {"text": "Emergency dental treatment"}, {"text": "Trip cancellation or interruption for covered reasons"}, {"text": "Flight or travel delays where included"}, {"text": "Lost, stolen or delayed baggage"}, {"text": "Loss of passport or other travel documents"}, {"text": "Sea and mountain rescue where included"}, {"text": "Personal liability while travelling"}, {"text": "Accidental death or permanent disability benefits"}, {"text": "Travel support for family members following a serious medical emergency"}], "heading": "What it covers", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "df94100f-463f-4158-beab-fb5abd70cb77", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right travel insurance depends on more than the premium. The insurer, medical protection, destination, trip duration, assistance service and policy terms can all affect the level of protection and support you receive.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer and claims service"}, {"text": "Emergency medical limit"}, {"text": "Countries and territories covered"}, {"text": "Length of each trip"}, {"text": "Single-trip, annual multi-trip or long-stay cover"}, {"text": "Medical evacuation and repatriation"}, {"text": "Deductibles — the amount you pay when a medical claim occurs"}, {"text": "Age eligibility and conditions"}, {"text": "Trip cancellation and interruption benefits"}, {"text": "Baggage loss and delay limits"}, {"text": "Flight and travel delay benefits"}, {"text": "Sports and activity cover where needed"}, {"text": "Personal liability limits"}, {"text": "24/7 medical and travel assistance service"}, {"text": "Exclusions and policy conditions"}], "heading": "What to compare"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "91cc9fa0-f62d-4c5f-b55b-671b4e97d3c3", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We manage the process from identifying the cover you need to comparing suitable insurers in Lebanon, arranging the policy and supporting you throughout the policy period.", "items": [{"body": "We determine the level of protection your trip requires, including the geographic area, medical cover, trip duration and any visa or activity requirements.", "title": "Understand your needs"}, {"body": "We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and compare their offers based on the protection, limits, assistance service and terms that matter for your trip.", "title": "Compare suitable options"}, {"body": "We explain the differences clearly, help you choose the option that best fits your needs, and arrange the policy for you.", "title": "Explain and arrange"}, {"body": "We handle insurer communication and remain available for policy changes, extensions and support throughout the policy period.", "title": "Stay involved"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange your travel insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "dce4fe97-3c81-476d-a4f3-a426956dde44", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Call our 24/7 hotline and we coordinate the assistance you need and manage your claim through every stage until settlement.", "items": [{"text": "If you need urgent medical care or other assistance while travelling, we coordinate directly with the insurer and its assistance team to arrange the support available under your policy, including hospital admission, medical referrals, evacuation and other covered services."}, {"text": "For claims, we handle the insurer communication on your behalf, prepare and submit the required documents, follow the case closely and work to secure the settlement and covered benefits due to you under the policy. We manage the process until the claim is concluded and keep you informed throughout."}], "heading": "What to do if you need assistance or make a claim"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "b6efc541-ffe4-4f28-879f-353db57e5d95", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Answers to common questions about travel insurance, including Schengen visas, family cover, frequent travel, long stays, age and policy requirements.", "items": [{"answer": "Yes. Travel medical insurance is required for Schengen visa applications and must meet the applicable visa requirements. We arrange suitable policies and provide the insurance certificate needed for your application.", "question": "Q1 – Do I need travel insurance for a Schengen visa?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Travel insurance can be arranged for individuals, couples and families travelling together. We compare the available family options and arrange the cover according to who is travelling, the destination and the length of the trip.", "question": "Q2 – Can travel insurance be arranged for my family?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Travel insurance can be arranged for older travelers, with the available plans, premiums and conditions depending on age, destination and trip duration. We compare the suitable options and explain the differences clearly before arranging the policy.", "question": "Q3 – Can older travelers get travel insurance?"}, {"answer": "An annual multi-trip policy can cover several journeys during the policy year, avoiding the need to arrange a new policy before every trip. We compare this with single-trip cover and arrange the option that best matches how often you travel.", "question": "Q4 – What if I travel several times during the year?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Long-stay travel insurance can be arranged for extended periods abroad. We compare suitable options based on the length of your stay, destination and the protection you need.", "question": "Q5 – Can I get travel insurance for a long stay abroad?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Travel insurance can include protection for certain sports and activities, including skiing under suitable plans. Tell us what activities you are planning so we can arrange the appropriate cover where available.", "question": "Q6 – Can sports such as skiing be covered?"}, {"answer": "It is best to arrange the policy before your trip begins, and before any visa application where insurance is required. Arranging it early also ensures that any available pre-departure benefits, such as trip cancellation, can apply according to the selected policy terms.", "question": "Q7 – When should I arrange my travel insurance?"}, {"answer": "We usually need the traveler''s age, destination, travel dates, number of travelers, the type of trip and a copy of passport. We also ask about any specific requirements, such as a long stay or activities that need additional protection.", "question": "Q8 – What information is needed for a travel insurance quote?"}, {"answer": "Contact us as soon as your travel dates, destination or trip duration change. Where the policy allows, we can coordinate the required amendment or extension with the insurer so the cover continues to match your trip.", "question": "Q9 – What if my travel plans change after the policy is issued?"}], "heading": "Travel Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "f2b4ee7a-0ff5-44a3-be52-9b4aa20cd7f5", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other insurance solutions we arrange for individuals, families and businesses.", "heading": "Other insurance solutions"}, "visible": true, "settings": {"sectionType": "related-links"}}, {"id": "9e8bb514-3bd2-4487-8bd6-e2ee9a6a0fa1", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "d89e96d7-f811-4234-9a0a-19147dd94bbb", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "07502439-08a3-42e5-8804-9e16d2169d35", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Find the travel insurance plan that fits your trip.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ea5ff64e-1b35-4b39-844c-ea4f7f2dd45f", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us your destination and travel dates. We’ll compare suitable options and arrange the cover you need."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ae9233ba-487d-43b2-9bfb-258c7fd9b73c", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/quote", "label": "Get a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "37df058d-772f-47ad-a897-871e21c71697", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "solid", "footerVisible": true, "catalogPosition": 5}, "template": "solution-detail", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('8ef1da17-34d6-44c8-b11b-fdc9dd20c6f1', 'Commercial Motor & Fleet Insurance', 'en/solutions/commercial-motor-fleet', '2026-09-23 17:20:20.005049+00', '{"Title": "Commercial Motor & Fleet Insurance Lebanon | Triple H", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Commercial Motor & Fleet Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Protect your company vehicles with commercial motor and fleet insurance arranged by Triple H Insurance Broker in Lebanon."}, "Description": "Commercial motor and fleet insurance in Lebanon for company vehicles. Compare insurers and arrange suitable cover with Triple H Insurance Broker.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://www.triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/commercial-motor-fleet"}', '2026-09-18 17:46:48.441417+00', false, false, 'en', '00b25096-3cfa-4cd0-a037-96ac0b9aa8d4', 'builder', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "85e804dd-03c4-4385-a642-1fc9dbf74637", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Cover for your company vehicles and related third-party liabilities, arranged around how your business uses them.", "items": [{"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "BUSINESS & EMPLOYEE INSURANCE", "heading": "Commercial Motor & Fleet Insurance", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "1c0f8a56-6007-479b-8352-db44edec88ba", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Commercial motor and fleet insurance helps protect company vehicles against covered damage or loss and provides liability protection for claims involving third parties. Triple H helps you compare suitable insurers and arrange cover based on your vehicles, drivers and business use.", "eyebrow": "COMMERCIAL MOTOR & FLEET INSURANCE", "heading": "What is commercial motor & fleet insurance?", "audience": "Companies, SMEs and other businesses that own or operate cars, vans, pickups, trucks or other vehicles for business use.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a Quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "0b262db5-ca08-4057-b383-245155e70813", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "4f9f8147-ed33-48a7-97d6-cf747d4a0ca4", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "a563b45b-0d37-4077-96ec-f3bc3ea4581a", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "How can commercial motor cover be structured?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "33bd9056-01fb-4c4e-9124-961ced88f78c", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover can be arranged around your vehicles, how they are used and the level of protection your business needs."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "3f77b8e4-5411-4914-8da3-b77eb9f79643", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "eaa21aab-beca-4688-91a5-4f4d94dcd8a9", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "83c06d45-ce99-4664-a62c-e1714298864c", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Company Vehicles", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "c22d6b9b-7602-4091-81e0-f5d02c5fa036", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover for cars, vans and other eligible vehicles owned or operated by your business."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "df1c1e45-5b58-4ae9-9a4c-1e6f1ae5bc3e", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "3060b694-5886-4c4d-b344-6c0286ddfea7", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Fleet Arrangements", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "3793591f-05f2-4462-a80b-66c15f4fc24b", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Multiple business vehicles can be managed under a coordinated insurance arrangement."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "10ecb4b9-eb1c-4f23-8d26-b5057ca5089d", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "1bb05812-3ca4-4080-8acc-b689efc9e323", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Different Vehicle Uses", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "0afb4dd5-90e5-415b-a215-450f05ee0ff9", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover can reflect how vehicles are used across sales, deliveries, transport or other business activities."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "7492d60b-1d30-4a32-96a3-ecf00995f28c", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "a53e4068-1ac3-41ad-a63f-784cf302f064", "type": "heading", "content": {"text": "Flexible Cover Levels", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "f8f6350a-d127-43cd-89e8-829f2eff0e36", "type": "text", "content": {"text": "Protection can be structured with suitable liability, own-damage and optional benefits according to your business needs."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "a97834e4-1112-49ff-a858-ae297a7b399b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare insurers in the Lebanese market, cover, limits, deductibles, repair terms and policy conditions, arrange the suitable protection for your business, and handle claims from notification through assessment and settlement.", "intro": "Commercial motor insurance combines compulsory third-party liability with broader cover for your vehicles, third-party liabilities and selected additional risks. The exact benefits, limits and conditions depend on the policy arranged.", "items": [{"text": "Compulsory Third-Party Liability — Bodily Injury & Material Damage"}, {"text": "Motor All Risks / Comprehensive Cover"}, {"text": "Accidental Damage to Insured Vehicles"}, {"text": "Total Loss Cover"}, {"text": "Fire & Explosion"}, {"text": "Theft & Attempted Theft"}, {"text": "Natural Perils & Weather Damage"}, {"text": "Strikes, Riots, Civil Commotion & Terrorism Cover"}, {"text": "Windscreen & Glass Damage"}, {"text": "Driver & Passenger Personal Accident"}, {"text": "Driver & Passenger Medical Expenses"}, {"text": "Roadside Assistance & Towing"}, {"text": "Replacement / Rental Vehicle subject to the terms of policy"}, {"text": "Orange Card — Cross-Border Third-Party Liability"}], "heading": "What can commercial motor & fleet insurance cover?", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "6ec00e26-5367-4ebf-aedf-01be3805b787", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right cover depends on more than premium. Liability limits, vehicle values, deductibles, repair terms, driver conditions, assistance, settlement terms and fleet administration all affect how the policy performs in practice.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer reputation, repair network and claims settlement terms"}, {"text": "Premiums and overall cost across the fleet"}, {"text": "Third-party liability limits and the scope of Total Loss or All Risks cover"}, {"text": "Vehicle values and total-loss settlement basis"}, {"text": "Deductibles, excesses and applicable driver excesses"}, {"text": "Repair terms, approved garages, agency repairs and spare-parts depreciation"}, {"text": "Driver eligibility, restrictions and declared business use"}, {"text": "Territorial limits and cross-border / Orange Card requirements"}, {"text": "Roadside assistance, towing and replacement / rental vehicle terms"}, {"text": "Fleet schedule administration, vehicle additions or removals and claims history at renewal"}], "heading": "What to compare before choosing commercial motor & fleet insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "9e39f6d6-8dc1-41e0-b1ea-b1e7405b7113", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We review your fleet and how it is used, compare suitable insurers in Lebanon and policy terms, then arrange and maintain the selected cover as your vehicles change.", "items": [{"body": "We review your vehicles, values, business use, drivers and claims history to understand the risks that need to be insured.", "title": "Understand your fleet"}, {"body": "We compare suitable insurers by cover, liability limits, deductibles, repair terms, extensions, claims settlement terms and premium.", "title": "Compare suitable insurers"}, {"body": "We place the selected policy, confirm the insured vehicles and agreed terms, and make sure the required documents and schedules are correctly issued.", "title": "Arrange the selected cover"}, {"body": "We handle insurance claims, vehicle additions and removals, update policy details when your fleet changes and prepare the information required for renewal.", "title": "Keep your fleet current"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange commercial motor & fleet insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "f2c0b508-5c0f-410c-bdb8-37e91f33322d", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact Triple H as soon as possible. We handle the claim from notification through assessment, repair or settlement, and follow up with the insurer on your behalf.", "items": [{"text": "We register the claim with the insurer, confirm the required documents and coordinate the initial assessment of the vehicle and accident circumstances."}, {"text": "We follow the repair or loss assessment, communicate with the insurer, garage and other parties involved, and help resolve issues that may delay the claim."}, {"text": "We review the proposed settlement against the policy terms and continue following the file until the claim is settled and the process is completed."}], "heading": "What happens when one of your company vehicles has an accident?"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "f5393b75-d35b-44b4-ae86-a7867e72ee60", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Practical answers about cover, drivers, fleet changes, claims and how commercial motor insurance works for your business.", "items": [{"answer": "Each company vehicle must meet the compulsory insurance requirements in Lebanon. Beyond that, your business can choose Third-Party, Total Loss or All Risks cover depending on the vehicle and the level of protection needed.", "question": "Q1 – What motor insurance does our business need for its vehicles?"}, {"answer": "No. Different vehicles can have different levels of cover depending on their value, age, use and your business needs. For example, one vehicle may require All Risks protection while another may be better suited to Total Loss or Third-Party cover, subject to insurer terms.", "question": "Q2 – Do all vehicles in our fleet need the same level of cover?"}, {"answer": "Your company provides the details of the drivers who will use the insured vehicles. Each driver must hold a valid driving license, meet the insurer’s applicable age requirements and use the vehicle for the declared business purpose.", "question": "Q3 – Who can drive our insured company vehicles?"}, {"answer": "Pricing can depend on the number and type of vehicles, their values and ages, how they are used, the drivers, claims history, the level of cover selected, deductibles, repair terms and the insurer’s rating criteria. We compare both the premium and the terms behind it.", "question": "Q4 – What affects the cost of commercial motor and fleet insurance?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Contact Triple H whenever your fleet changes. We coordinate additions, removals and vehicle replacements with the insurer and update the policy schedule so the insured fleet remains current.", "question": "Q5 – Can we add, remove or replace vehicles during the policy period?"}, {"answer": "Contact Triple H through our 24/7 hotline as soon as it is safe. We arrange the required claims expert where needed, coordinate the documents and assessment, deal with the insurer, garage and relevant third parties, and follow the claim through repair or settlement.", "question": "Q6 – What should our company do after an accident?"}, {"answer": "The settlement depends on the policy terms, the vehicle’s value at the time of the loss, the applicable total-loss threshold, settlement basis and deductible. We review the assessment and settlement with the insurer and handle the claim on your company’s behalf.", "question": "Q7 – What happens if one of our vehicles is declared a total loss?"}, {"answer": "It depends on the selected policy, vehicle and insurer. Some plans provide official-dealer repairs for eligible vehicles, while others use approved garages. We compare the repair arrangement, spare-parts terms and applicable conditions before the policy is placed.", "question": "Q8 – Can our company vehicles be repaired at the official dealer?"}, {"answer": "These benefits depend on the selected plan. Roadside assistance can include accident towing and, on some policies, assistance following a mechanical or electrical breakdown. Replacement or rental vehicle benefits can also be included subject to the policy’s limits, duration and conditions.", "question": "Q9 – Does commercial motor insurance include towing and a replacement vehicle?"}, {"answer": "Yes, where the required territorial cover is available. For travel to countries participating in the Orange Card system, we can arrange the required cross-border third-party liability documentation before the vehicle travels.", "question": "Q10 – Can our company vehicles be covered when travelling outside Lebanon?"}, {"answer": "We usually need your vehicles documents, values, how they are used, and driver details. Additional information may be required depending on the vehicles and cover requested.", "question": "Q11 – What information do we need for a commercial motor or fleet insurance quote?"}], "heading": "Commercial Motor & Fleet Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "b90c2222-7e58-4ee1-b4af-a8b72c432a9e", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other cover that can protect your business, property and employees alongside your commercial motor insurance.", "heading": "Other Business Insurance", "buttonHref": "/en/solutions/business", "buttonLabel": "Explore Business Insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "48b3c39f-796a-4123-a9d1-48ec250676b7", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "3f9dfa32-9c4c-4392-ba5d-433a2114be69", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "49036d98-1503-4e8c-8be2-ee083a6e714e", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Get a commercial motor & fleet insurance quote", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ebe1f5f8-cf74-4076-bf5f-9148ebf782c2", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us about your company vehicles and how they are used. We’ll compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, cover options and provide clear written quotations."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "2cc6177d-85df-4776-8c2e-719d9547a104", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "c4b9ae81-a084-460f-9b0c-da4a921db052", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007', 'FAQ | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/faq', '2026-09-24 11:48:05.859475+00', '{"Title": "Insurance FAQs in Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Insurance FAQs | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": "", "Description": "Clear answers to common questions about Triple H, insurance quotes, choosing cover, policies and renewals in Lebanon."}, "Description": "Clear answers about insurance in Lebanon, including brokers, quotes, cover, policy terms and renewals, from Triple H Insurance Broker.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/faq"}', '2026-08-08 09:52:01.915542+00', false, true, 'en', 'f20c50e1-6b91-6a2b-e56b-1c8ab4936a58', 'faq', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "11000000-0007-0001-0000-000000000001", "type": "section", "styles": {"size": "base", "tone": "default", "preset": "cinematic-tall", "bordered": false}, "content": {"intro": "Find clear answers about choosing cover, working with an insurance broker, quotations, policies, renewals and everyday insurance questions in Lebanon.", "items": [], "eyebrow": "Insurance FAQs", "heading": "Insurance questions, clearly answered.", "imageAlt": "Insurance advisor answering a client’s questions", "mobileImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260808072307-4ac8a712be4844c99ac105214f21d358.webp", "desktopImageUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260808072307-4ac8a712be4844c99ac105214f21d358.webp"}, "visible": true, "position": 0, "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "11000000-0007-0002-0000-000000000002", "type": "section", "styles": {"size": "base", "tone": "default", "preset": "accordion-groups", "bordered": true}, "content": {"intro": "Browse clear answers about working with Triple H, choosing insurance, getting a quote, policies and renewals.", "items": [{"group": "About Triple H", "answer": "No. Triple H is a licensed insurance broker. Insurance companies underwrite the risk and issue the policies; we assess your needs, compare suitable insurers, arrange your cover and manage the relationship on your behalf.", "question": "Q1 – Are you an insurance company?"}, {"group": "About Triple H", "answer": "A broker works with you rather than representing one insurance company. We help you compare suitable options, understand the terms, limits and exclusions, arrange your cover and remain involved through renewals and claims.", "question": "Q2 – Why use an insurance broker instead of going directly to an insurer?"}, {"group": "About Triple H", "answer": "No. For the same policy and terms, arranging your insurance through Triple H does not increase the insurer’s quoted price. Our remuneration is arranged separately through agreements with insurance companies, while you benefit from independent advice, comparison and ongoing broker support.", "question": "Q3 – Will I pay more with Triple H?"}, {"group": "About Triple H", "answer": "Triple H Insurance Broker S.A.R.L. holds Broker License No. 581 from the Ministry of Economy & Trade, Lebanon, and Commercial Registration No. 2077214.", "question": "Q4 – How can I verify Triple H’s license?"}, {"group": "About Triple H", "answer": "We assist clients in Arabic, English and French.", "question": "Q5 – What languages do you work in?"}, {"group": "Quotes & Choosing Cover", "answer": "Medical and motor insurance quotes can be calculated through our online instant quote service. For other personal, business and specialist risks, contact us and we will assess your requirements and arrange suitable quotations.", "question": "Q1 – How can I get an insurance quote?"}, {"group": "Quotes & Choosing Cover", "answer": "The information depends on the type of insurance. We may ask for details about you, your vehicle, property, business, employees or other risks being insured. Complete and accurate information helps insurers provide the correct terms and price.", "question": "Q2 – What information do you need for a quote?"}, {"group": "Quotes & Choosing Cover", "answer": "No. A quotation is subject to the information provided, insurer underwriting and acceptance. Cover is only confirmed once the insurer has accepted the risk and the policy has been issued.", "question": "Q3 – Is an online or written quotation guaranteed?"}, {"group": "Quotes & Choosing Cover", "answer": "We start with your needs and the risks you want to protect, then compare suitable insurers across cover, terms, conditions, limits, exclusions and price. We present the most suitable options clearly, explain the differences and guide you towards the cover that best fits your needs, so you can make an informed decision with greater confidence.", "question": "Q4 – How does Triple H help me choose the right insurance?"}, {"group": "Policies & Renewals", "answer": "Cover begins according to the effective date confirmed after the insurer has accepted the risk and the policy has been issued. A quotation by itself does not mean that cover is in place.", "question": "Q1 – When does my insurance cover begin?"}, {"group": "Policies & Renewals", "answer": "You should understand what is covered, the policy limits, important exclusions and conditions, and any excess or deductible that applies. We explain the relevant terms before you accept the policy so you can make an informed decision.", "question": "Q2 – What should I understand before accepting a policy?"}, {"group": "Policies & Renewals", "answer": "Tell Triple H as soon as possible if there is a significant change to the risk being insured. We will check whether the insurer needs to be notified and arrange any necessary adjustment to your policy.", "question": "Q3 – What should I do if something changes during my policy?"}, {"group": "Policies & Renewals", "answer": "You do not need to wait until your policy is about to expire or contact us first. We review your cover in advance, consider any changes in your needs or circumstances, assess the insurer’s renewal terms and premium, and where appropriate compare suitable alternatives. We then contact you in good time, explain the options and help you make an informed renewal decision.", "question": "Q4 – What happens when my insurance policy is due for renewal?"}], "heading": "Frequently asked questions", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "position": 1, "settings": {"sectionType": "faq-groups"}}, {"id": "876c5afe-9cc5-49fb-8ba0-0e3f6d3cca9e", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "02cee0d0-0802-4371-9e1a-631cc6ccd0d6", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "39d9239d-b2e6-4c80-9528-5b3fb0d90696", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Still have a question?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "3e66bdda-a02e-4727-b6a0-df9e593e742b", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Contact our team for clear, tailored guidance on your insurance needs, policy or cover."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ee4b6100-ddf9-4eb4-92bb-7aa973ae92ba", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Contact Us", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "faq", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('568ff1e3-e99d-488e-bf33-0ee9f67771d1', 'Careers | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/careers', '2026-09-27 16:37:21.377758+00', '{"Title": "Careers at Triple H | Insurance Broker in Lebanon", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Careers at Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Explore career opportunities with Triple H and learn more about our professional approach to insurance and client service in Lebanon."}, "Description": "Explore career opportunities at Triple H Insurance Broker in Lebanon and discover our professional approach to client service and insurance advice.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/careers"}', '2026-08-19 12:09:10.179389+00', false, false, 'en', 'b602dd3c-009e-4516-b869-58349b01c42a', 'career', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "20baeba4-0c83-4b93-ab7e-b73bc0d6a0b9", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Join a professional insurance broker company where clear advice, client service and long-term relationships are at the heart of how we work.", "items": [{"href": "/contact", "label": "Learn more", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "Careers", "heading": "Build your career with Triple H.", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "/uploads/20260927163655-2d0e830a4ad94355b73420cdf06d75d0.webp", "desktopImageUrl": "/uploads/20260927162433-3b1a96fa432341f8983541df256244bc.webp"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "57d3b736-6a3f-4fb9-a85b-e942dca7a6d1", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "0ddf7a8e-159e-4cba-aadc-50378decc5ca", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "b5ec68b3-87c3-4bb9-acef-7a4907b28798", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Work with purpose and professionalism.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "faa59e40-28e1-4f20-abe8-36176e0d8c88", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Our work is built around understanding clients, explaining insurance clearly and staying involved when support matters. We look for people who value accuracy, responsibility, clear communication and long-term relationships, with a commitment to delivering a high standard of insurance service."}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "text"}}, {"id": "6b87c1c6-c8f3-4d16-900e-def9958d70ab", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "7b6ab4a1-d7ae-4f53-949e-07a5b1ee1dcf", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "58bb6baf-32b0-4801-b639-5e45b05e91c0", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Interested in joining Triple H?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "fff74609-cc64-4085-a871-d503b65a481a", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "If you are interested in building your career with Triple H, send us your CV and a brief cover letter. Applications are reviewed against current and future opportunities within the company."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ecf72502-9e6e-4c2d-a9e5-41fa6c46ef29", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "mailto:c.haddad@triplehbroker.com", "label": "Email Your CV", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('0774329f-1872-4eec-8156-02db496e6a79', 'Commercial Liability Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker', 'en/solutions/commercial-liability-insurance', '2026-09-23 17:19:05.472661+00', '{"Title": "Commercial Liability Insurance Lebanon | Triple H Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Commercial Liability Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Commercial liability insurance for third-party injury and property damage, arranged around your business activities by Triple H Insurance Broker."}, "Description": "Commercial liability insurance in Lebanon for third-party injury and property damage. Compare insurers, limits and terms with Triple H Insurance Broker.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://www.triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/commercial-liability-insurance"}', '2026-09-21 12:00:41.587797+00', false, false, 'en', 'ffe00e81-8c41-4737-92b3-d5bbfd1a5658', 'builder', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "15d5e7f9-abb7-4780-935c-a18f2707cbb4", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Protect your business against claims for third-party bodily injury or property damage arising from your premises, operations or products, with cover arranged around your activities and liability exposure.", "items": [{"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "BUSINESS & EMPLOYEE INSURANCE", "heading": "Commercial Liability Insurance", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "243d3ec6-5954-4e1d-be59-3e7e360ac790", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Commercial liability insurance can protect your business against legal liability for third-party bodily injury or property damage arising from your premises, operations or products. Triple H compares suitable insurers and arranges cover around your activities, locations, products and required liability limits.", "eyebrow": "COMMERCIAL LIABILITY INSURANCE", "heading": "What is commercial liability insurance?", "audience": "Contractors, cleaning and maintenance companies, restaurants, retailers, manufacturers, distributors, event organizers, and advertising or signage companies working at client or public locations.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "5bd62796-6d67-4499-9143-94cf82e39876", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "2cc6da65-755b-447e-8cbe-9887198e6b7e", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "88e280e1-4eda-49d8-9d3e-cedc7e2b92d7", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "How can commercial liability cover be structured?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "3d3040fa-1481-4626-b679-01f75de97964", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Commercial liability cover can be structured around where your business operates, the work you carry out and whether your products can create liability after they are supplied."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "6712b6e1-3385-4815-b26d-c1275a131928", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "ea2c3d79-3bc1-4b00-896b-eeaa800e9e14", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "3bdad94c-906f-41f5-a962-5436c9c4aa82", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Public Liability", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "21c5b05f-a7dc-4f35-b17d-5a9794160596", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover for legal liability arising from third-party bodily injury or property damage connected with your premises or business activities."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "8f0558d3-739a-4f30-84df-476c927bfb2d", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "c5dc78ed-c120-47da-87aa-5ea79df5505b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Off-Site & Contract Work", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "0958eeee-388e-4370-8761-e9022df7c833", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover can be arranged for businesses carrying out work at client sites or other locations, such as contractors, cleaners, maintenance providers and installation companies."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "a6162dae-a059-4f1d-bd83-f7ee6102dd8f", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "5b1e5074-e39c-4150-bf4b-9fb8328a892b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Product Liability", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "bd58d008-0fdf-4b13-a1e0-8fd5ddd9bc32", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "For businesses that manufacture, distribute or supply products, covering legal liability for third-party injury or property damage caused by those products."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "2565f51d-5b9a-4472-8f57-7a51f92ca16c", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "1efcc12b-0855-4da3-96d4-320ccf07c875", "type": "heading", "content": {"text": "Combined Liability Cover", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "2c2cef6b-4c1f-49fc-9a49-4960d3c82f29", "type": "text", "content": {"text": "Businesses exposed to both operational and product risks can arrange public and product liability together, with limits and terms structured around their activities."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "22a70580-3a52-4e15-8b35-8ac8f50bf9e1", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare insurers, liability limits, deductibles, insured activities, locations, extensions and exclusions, arrange suitable cover for your business, and handle claims with the insurer from notification through assessment and settlement.", "intro": "Depending on the policy and your business activities, commercial liability insurance can cover legal liability for accidental third-party bodily injury or property damage arising from your premises, operations or products, together with certain legal costs and extensions where included.", "items": [{"text": "Third-Party Bodily Injury"}, {"text": "Third-Party Property Damage"}, {"text": "Liability Arising from Your Business Premises"}, {"text": "Liability from Off-Site Work & Operations, Where Covered"}, {"text": "Product Liability, Where Included"}, {"text": "Legal Defense Costs & Expenses, Where Covered"}, {"text": "Food & Drink Poisoning Liability, Where Added"}, {"text": "Signboard Liability, Where Added"}, {"text": "Product Recall Cover, Where Specifically Arranged"}], "heading": "What can commercial liability insurance cover?", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "eab95d79-188b-48d5-a6b5-68481e1d6471", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right liability policy depends on more than premium. Limits, insured activities, legal costs, territorial scope and exclusions can all make a significant difference when a claim occurs.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer reputation, liability experience and claims settlement record"}, {"text": "Public, product and combined liability cover required"}, {"text": "Limit per occurrence and annual aggregate, where applicable"}, {"text": "Legal defense costs and whether they reduce the liability limit"}, {"text": "Business activities, premises and off-site operations covered"}, {"text": "Territorial limits and legal jurisdictions covered"}, {"text": "Deductibles, excesses and policy sub-limits"}, {"text": "Subcontractor and contractor liability conditions"}, {"text": "Key exclusions affecting your activities, products or work at client sites"}, {"text": "Client, landlord or tender requirements for liability limits and policy terms"}], "heading": "What to compare before choosing commercial liability insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "496c5d3e-3a66-4613-bfc6-d797f34d3e28", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We review where your business could face third-party claims, compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and liability terms, then arrange cover around your actual activities.", "items": [{"body": "We review your business activities, premises, off-site work, products, turnover, contracts and previous claims.", "title": "Review Your Liability Exposure"}, {"body": "We compare liability limits, legal costs, deductibles, territorial scope, extensions, exclusions and premium.", "title": "Compare Suitable Insurers"}, {"body": "We place the selected policy, confirm the insured activities and limits, and arrange any required liability certificates or endorsements.", "title": "Arrange the Selected Cover"}, {"body": "We handle claims, changes and renewals as your activities, contracts, locations, products or liability requirements change.", "title": "Keep the Cover Up to Date"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange commercial liability insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "2ddaa6c6-4f01-4f4b-a910-0d134cbaaa11", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact Triple H as soon as an incident occurs or a claim is made. We notify the insurer, coordinate the claim on your behalf and follow it through assessment, defense and settlement.", "items": [{"text": "We confirm the information required and help you provide incident reports, photographs, witness details, correspondence and other supporting documents."}, {"text": "We coordinate with the insurer, loss adjuster and lawyers where required, and follow the assessment while liability and the extent of the claim are established."}, {"text": "We review the insurer’s response and any proposed settlement against the policy terms, and continue following the claim until the process is concluded."}], "heading": "What to do when a third party makes a claim against your business?"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "f66c1c10-2a30-4ff4-89ca-3c0eeb22f59e", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Practical answers about third-party claims, public and product liability, business activities, liability limits and what to do when an incident occurs.", "items": [{"answer": "Public liability covers claims arising from your premises or business activities, while product liability covers claims caused by products you manufacture, supply or sell.", "question": "Q1 – What is the difference between public liability and product liability?"}, {"answer": "A third party is generally someone outside your business, such as a customer, visitor, client, supplier or member of the public who suffers injury or property damage connected with your activities.", "question": "Q2 – Who is considered a third-party?"}, {"answer": "Employee injuries are generally handled under Workmen Compensation or Employers’ Liability rather than public liability. We review both exposures so the appropriate policies work alongside each other.", "question": "Q3 – Does commercial liability cover injuries to our employees?"}, {"answer": "Yes, where this activity is declared and included. This is particularly important for contractors, cleaners, maintenance companies, installers and other businesses that regularly work away from their own premises. Public liability can extend to incidents arising where business operations are carried out.", "question": "Q4 – Can the policy cover work carried out at a client’s premises?"}, {"answer": "The policy may respond depending on how the damage occurred and the exact wording. We check whether your work activities and the property you work around are properly addressed before arranging cover.", "question": "Q5 – What if we accidentally damage a client’s property while working there?"}, {"answer": "If your business uses subcontractors, let us know when arranging the policy. We check how they should be treated under the cover and make sure the policy is structured correctly for your operations.", "question": "Q6 – Are subcontractors covered?"}, {"answer": "Legal defense costs are commonly included in commercial liability policies. What differs between insurers is how those costs are treated — particularly whether they are paid within the liability limit or in addition to it. We check this before arranging the policy.", "question": "Q7 – Are legal defense costs covered?"}, {"answer": "Not automatically. Product recall can require specific cover, so businesses with this exposure should have it considered separately when the policy is arranged.", "question": "Q8 – Does product liability also cover the cost of recalling a product?"}, {"answer": "The appropriate limit depends on your activities, locations, products, potential claim size and any limits required by clients, landlords or tenders. We compare suitable limits rather than using the same amount for every business.", "question": "Q9 – How much liability cover does our business need?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Commercial contracts and tenders can specify minimum liability limits or particular policy requirements, so we review these before arranging the cover.", "question": "Q10 – Can a client or tender require a specific liability limit?"}, {"answer": "Document what happened and contact Triple H promptly before responding to any demand or agreeing liability. We notify the insurer, confirm what information is required and manage the claim through assessment and settlement.", "question": "Q11 – What should we do if an accident or third-party claim occurs?"}, {"answer": "We usually need your business activity, turnover, premises and locations, work carried out at client sites, products where relevant, required liability limits and any specific contract or tender requirements.", "question": "Q12 – What information do we need for a commercial liability quote?"}], "heading": "Commercial Liability Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "acbf4f54-a098-40f4-9da4-bae3447a4274", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other cover that can protect your employees, property and company vehicles alongside commercial liability insurance.", "heading": "Other Business Insurance", "buttonHref": "/en/solutions/business", "buttonLabel": "Explore Business Insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "e281de7f-684d-42c3-8e4e-a029af8194f7", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "bfde7f0f-9041-427e-be1b-5f95838a5fcb", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "85a1e72a-98d0-4006-aec2-fc842cbd1f63", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Get a commercial liability insurance quote", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "d1360848-3b08-44a6-8fa9-7d4593556f28", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us about your business activities, where you operate, any off-site work or products, and the liability limits you need. We’ll compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and come back with clear written options."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "7906e6c9-6981-425e-a46a-f250a76568bb", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "2c73cb3a-c424-425e-bda9-7dabbd9ffcbc", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('e7824fdc-938d-4a8f-962f-503b3925476b', 'Commercial Property Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H', 'en/solutions/commercial-property', '2026-09-24 15:25:25.68346+00', '{"Title": "Commercial Property Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Commercial Property Insurance in Lebanon | Triple H", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Protect business premises, stock, machinery and equipment with commercial property insurance arranged by Triple H around your business needs."}, "Description": "Commercial property insurance in Lebanon for business premises, stock, equipment and interruption risks. Triple H compares insurers and arranges suitable cover.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/commercial-property"}', '2026-09-11 08:56:14.093635+00', false, false, 'en', '33ef3a14-7b56-4b11-8b82-b56aeca20ac1', 'builder', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "e918aed6-0d0e-4f41-9818-1e4892c33555", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Protect your business premises, stock, equipment and other physical assets against covered damage or loss, with insurance arranged around your needs.", "items": [{"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "BUSINESS & EMPLOYEE INSURANCE", "heading": "Commercial Property Insurance in Lebanon", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "7033775e-33d9-49db-8a42-4154fcc118ab", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Commercial property insurance protects your business premises and physical assets against covered loss or damage. We assess what needs protection, approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market, compare the available cover and terms, and arrange the policy around your business.", "eyebrow": "COMMERCIAL PROPERTY INSURANCE", "heading": "What is commercial property insurance?", "audience": "Businesses that own or occupy commercial premises and need to protect buildings, fit-out, stock, machinery, equipment or other physical assets.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "72b587d3-3620-4c4c-9a2f-38d1d324d209", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "c77ae1c0-985a-4a67-8590-a231f1f77888", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "4d17dce3-4ed3-413d-812a-e23fd1e2f992", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "What can be protected?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "8f478af7-a952-4887-9c9a-6f4a732fb0df", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Commercial property insurance can protect the main physical assets your business depends on, whether you own or occupy the premises."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "36432055-bafe-4406-9b55-7f01678ddc8b", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "b72637cf-2f1a-44d0-aeda-82224f098436", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "74e6e900-bf02-4ebb-9d7d-becbdc50d8d7", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Buildings & Premises", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "671ff998-aede-4ccf-806a-cad5b5463158", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Buildings and commercial premises used for your operations, including offices, shops, warehouses and other business locations."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "e46903f2-8103-42a1-8747-9e88579f3bff", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "29aac278-a65b-48f5-9774-d25fcd75d32f", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Fit-Out, Furniture & Contents", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "d25e8500-c1c2-4e4b-a1fb-cfccd4223558", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Interior fit-out, fixtures, furniture, office contents and other property used inside the insured premises."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "cd549a32-e1e2-4215-bd75-9ba4c996e742", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "7a81a464-ecfd-4bf6-b682-76356dbf17b7", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Stock & Inventory", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "48294611-dd06-414c-86b4-13cbbdc8917c", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Raw materials, finished goods, merchandise and other stock kept at the insured location, including changing inventory levels where applicable."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "fa13d4ee-d0f6-4e66-89b3-d2b02edd6413", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "041c3524-453a-4bef-b7de-3e51ee61b6f8", "type": "heading", "content": {"text": "Machinery & Equipment", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "09b1c31f-33ce-46fe-96c5-1115b0fda227", "type": "text", "content": {"text": "Machinery, production equipment, computers and other business equipment that would be costly to repair or replace after covered damage."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "e7126221-cc39-4f89-9135-32358fde1580", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We identify the risks your business needs to protect, approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and compare the available cover, limits, deductibles, exclusions and extensions before arranging the selected policy.", "intro": "Cover can be arranged for a wide range of events that may damage your premises or business assets. The exact protection, limits and conditions depend on the insurer and policy selected.", "items": [{"text": "Fire, explosion, lightning and smoke damage"}, {"text": "Storm, flood, hail, earthquake and other natural perils"}, {"text": "Water damage from burst pipes, tanks, rain or drainage problems"}, {"text": "Burglary or theft following forcible entry"}, {"text": "Impact damage caused by vehicles or other external events"}, {"text": "Plate glass breakage"}, {"text": "Electrical damage or fluctuation"}, {"text": "Strikes, riots, civil commotion and malicious damage"}, {"text": "Debris removal and professional fees following a covered loss"}, {"text": "Loss of rent or business interruption following property damage"}, {"text": "Property-related liability or recourse to neighbors or co-owners"}], "heading": "What can commercial property insurance cover?", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "28511107-4f84-43ef-b1d8-39ce154ea964", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right policy depends on more than price. The insured values, deductibles, exclusions, extensions and claims handling can all affect how well your business is protected.", "items": [{"text": "The insurer’s reputation, financial strength and reliability"}, {"text": "Insured values for buildings, stock, machinery and equipment"}, {"text": "Limits and sublimits that apply to specific types of loss"}, {"text": "Deductibles your business must bear when a claim occurs"}, {"text": "Natural peril protection, including flood and earthquake"}, {"text": "Burglary conditions and security requirements"}, {"text": "Electrical, machinery damage and engineering cover"}, {"text": "Business interruption protection and the period it can respond"}, {"text": "Exclusions, warranties and other policy conditions"}], "heading": "What to compare before choosing commercial property insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "492981a7-4553-4cf6-88a2-4ed548ba7de4", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We assess what needs protection, compare suitable insurers in Lebanon and arrange the cover around your business.", "items": [{"body": "We review the premises, business activity, stock, machinery, equipment and other assets that need protection.", "title": "Assess the risk"}, {"body": "We assess the declared values, required limits and the protection needed for your property and operations.", "title": "Structure the cover"}, {"body": "We approach suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and compare their cover, terms, deductibles, exclusions, reputation and price.", "title": "Compare suitable insurers"}, {"body": "We explain the differences, negotiate with insurers where appropriate and arrange the selected cover for your business.", "title": "Arrange the policy"}], "layout": "grid", "heading": "How we arrange your commercial property insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "c7a87a32-652b-4cf2-ad15-e0ec30feee5b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact us as soon as possible. We coordinate the claim, the assessment and the insurer communication on your behalf.", "items": [{"text": "When needed, we send a claims expert to inspect the damage and document the loss. We then notify the insurer and coordinate the required reports, quotations and supporting documents."}, {"text": "We follow the claim closely, handle insurer questions and work to secure the covered settlement due under the policy."}, {"text": "If business interruption cover applies, we coordinate that part of the claim as well and remain involved until the claim is concluded."}], "heading": "What to do when your business property is damaged"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "a0785b8c-d44d-458b-96c6-3687d2934e6b", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Answers to common questions about insuring business premises and assets.", "items": [{"answer": "Yes. The cover is arranged around the property and assets each party is responsible for.", "question": "Q1 – Can both owners and tenants arrange commercial property insurance?"}, {"answer": "Yes. Multiple offices, shops, warehouses or other locations can be included, depending on the business and insurer requirements.", "question": "Q2 – Can several business locations be insured?"}, {"answer": "Yes. The insured stock value can be arranged around normal and peak inventory levels, depending on the business and policy terms.", "question": "Q3 – Can businesses with seasonal or changing stock values be insured?"}, {"answer": "Yes. We can review the current cover, values, limits, deductibles and exclusions and compare suitable alternatives in the market.", "question": "Q4 – Can you review my existing property insurance?"}, {"answer": "We usually need the business activity, property location, construction, occupancy, insured assets and values, security and fire-protection measures, claims history and the cover required.", "question": "Q5 – What information do you need for a quotation?"}, {"answer": "Yes. We can arrange changes when you add locations, stock, equipment or other assets during the policy period.", "question": "Q6 – Can the policy be updated during the year?"}, {"answer": "If the declared values are too low, the amount recoverable after a claim may be reduced under the policy terms. We help review the insured values before placement and renewal.", "question": "Q7 – What happens if a business property is underinsured?"}], "heading": "Commercial Property Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "836db7cc-179e-4ba2-af0e-2e9cb4cc192d", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Protect your employees, vehicles, goods, liabilities and other business risks with insurance arranged around your operations.", "heading": "Explore more business insurance", "buttonHref": "/en/solutions/business", "buttonLabel": "Explore Business Insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "12404649-1bd8-415d-a9b9-0b1e80f3a1c7", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "ce202b62-bf1e-4d6e-8fbd-1680f4d7e835", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "331e1875-d3c6-404e-b0bc-29ffbb520fae", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Protect your business property with the right cover.", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "c65868cd-8ed2-4450-b4cf-3e38d3dbf928", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Tell us what you need to insure. We’ll compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and arrange the protection your business requires."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "e165f02f-9190-4a4f-9acc-144fbb4e1d94", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "72239028-a71b-4d62-81a1-79bdbdffdcb1", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", seo_data, "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('bb249053-5ed8-4e5c-a746-1054065cfc3a', 'Workmen Compensation Insurance', 'en/solutions/workmen-compensation', '2026-09-24 12:01:35.914921+00', '{"Title": "Workmen Compensation Insurance Lebanon | Triple H Insurance Broker", "Robots": {"Index": true, "Follow": true}, "OpenGraph": {"Title": "Workmen Compensation Insurance | Triple H Insurance Broker", "ImageUrl": null, "Description": "Protect your employees and business against work-related accidents with workmen compensation insurance arranged by Triple H Insurance Broker in Lebanon."}, "Description": "Workmen compensation insurance in Lebanon for employers. Compare insurers and arrange suitable employee accident cover with Triple H Insurance Broker.", "CanonicalUrl": "https://www.triplehbroker.com/en/solutions/workmen-compensation"}', '2026-09-20 13:51:00.075766+00', false, false, 'en', '2ca1cb21-1292-4573-ad69-929808220d36', 'builder', '{"type": "page", "children": [{"id": "95f8dba6-43c9-4c65-b1e7-52c9b16366eb", "type": "section", "styles": {"preset": "cinematic-tall"}, "content": {"intro": "Protect your business and employees against the financial consequences of work-related accidents, with cover arranged around your workforce and operations.", "items": [{"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}], "eyebrow": "BUSINESS & EMPLOYEE INSURANCE", "heading": "Workmen Compensation Insurance", "imageAlt": "", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "hero-banner"}}, {"id": "7720b037-f926-4a9f-bccc-e6b706101896", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Workmen compensation insurance helps protect your business against its liability when an employee is injured in a work-related accident. Triple H compares suitable insurers and arranges cover around your workforce, occupations and business activities.", "eyebrow": "WORKMEN COMPENSATION INSURANCE", "heading": "What is workmen compensation insurance?", "audience": "Employers across industries that need to protect their business and employees against the financial consequences of workplace accidents.", "buttonHref": "/en/contact", "buttonLabel": "Request a quote", "audienceHeading": "Who it is for"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "solution-introduction"}}, {"id": "0602e591-823a-4dc0-a629-3fdf0060602c", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "e651bfbd-3645-4a1e-bc8f-29d58537f838", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "47f65076-576e-46ef-a3d4-409cf398d793", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "How can workmen compensation cover be structured?", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "4a52cb26-34e1-4e06-bcfa-8abcbc3e8495", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Cover is arranged around your workforce, employee duties, declared earnings, work locations and any other activities that affect your company’s workplace risk."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "c91b9e5b-a40b-44c5-b469-aa78e1a58d98", "type": "grid", "styles": {"mobile": {"gridTemplateColumns": "1fr"}, "desktop": {"gap": "24px", "gridTemplateColumns": "repeat(3, 1fr)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "c37ad563-a8e0-4a4f-b095-eb7d214d39f9", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "8c05b8d9-9ed7-4965-b741-afaed6f149e9", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Workforce & Employee Categories", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "75369132-f16f-4ff7-85ed-3b58fca640db", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Your employees can be covered under one company policy, with the workforce divided into relevant categories according to their roles and employment structure."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "828d33aa-a82c-4385-91a4-4bbfd5b92b85", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "ae384667-a4a4-47da-a484-a197d52b768b", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Job Roles & Risk Exposure", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "27b71a0a-64ab-40ec-8515-8fa644fc01c2", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "The insurer considers what employees actually do, as office work, driving, construction, manufacturing and other duties can involve very different levels of risk."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "962becc5-52cc-4da8-bf8d-e1de20a3633e", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "5c71e547-1323-4afa-a3ef-e7321141abd3", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Salaries & Wages", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "59d41bc7-d152-486c-a3e0-5b78b74de999", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Declared salaries, wages and applicable earnings are considered when arranging the cover because they can affect insured benefits, limits and the premium charged."}, "visible": true}]}, {"id": "2be80313-a426-4c50-8716-b0aed4cd5f8e", "type": "stack", "styles": {"desktop": {"gap": "12px", "border": "1px solid var(--border)", "padding": "28px"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "2f656630-45a6-4cce-a10b-37cda22ef60d", "type": "heading", "content": {"text": "Work Locations & Business Activities", "level": 3}, "visible": true}, {"id": "a57b404f-3f82-4601-8df7-17e63b1804e5", "type": "text", "content": {"text": "The insurer also considers where employees work, the activities carried out at each location and any relevant subcontractor exposure that needs to be declared."}, "visible": true}]}]}]}], "settings": {"sectionType": "cards"}}, {"id": "b5351102-72bd-4d45-8d71-b4eec5cbfbe5", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"help": "We compare insurers, benefits, limits, declared wages, employee categories and policy conditions, arrange suitable cover for your business, and handle claims from notification through assessment and settlement.", "intro": "Workmen compensation insurance can cover the financial consequences of a work-related accident and, where included, occupational illness — from medical treatment and lost income to disability or death benefits and your liability as an employer.", "items": [{"text": "Medical Expenses from a Workplace Injury"}, {"text": "Temporary Disability & Wage Replacement"}, {"text": "Permanent Total or Partial Disability Benefits "}, {"text": "Death Benefits"}, {"text": "Employer Liability"}, {"text": "Legal Defense Costs"}, {"text": "Occupational Illness, Where Included"}, {"text": "Journey to and from Work, Where Extended"}], "heading": "What can workmen compensation insurance cover?", "helpHeading": "How Triple H helps"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "coverage-details"}}, {"id": "4458bb55-f34a-44a2-8310-cb3d8a329012", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "The right policy depends on more than premium. Benefit limits, declared wages, employee categories, work activities, exclusions and claims terms all affect how your business is protected.", "items": [{"text": "Insurer reputation and claims settlement terms"}, {"text": "Medical expense limits and applicable conditions"}, {"text": "Temporary disability and wage-replacement benefits"}, {"text": "Partial permanent, total permanent and death compensation terms"}, {"text": "Declared salaries, wages and the basis used to calculate benefits"}, {"text": "Employee occupations, risk categories and declared business activities"}, {"text": "Work locations, sites and territorial scope of cover"}, {"text": "Subcontractor workers and whether any related liability is included"}, {"text": "Occupational illness cover, exclusions and policy limitations"}, {"text": "Workforce changes, wage-roll adjustments and renewal declarations"}, {"text": "Journey-to-and-from-work and other available policy extensions"}], "heading": "What to compare before choosing workmen compensation insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "feature-list"}}, {"id": "3d6f36d0-28b3-47ef-b6ae-d45b4fcdbdc3", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "We review your workforce and workplace exposures, compare suitable insurers and policy terms, then arrange and maintain the selected cover as your business changes.", "items": [{"body": "We review your employee numbers, occupations, declared wages, work locations and business activities to understand the risks that need to be covered.", "title": "Understand Your Workforce"}, {"body": "We compare suitable insurers in Lebanon by benefits, limits, exclusions, policy conditions, claims settlement terms and premium.", "title": "Compare Suitable Insurers"}, {"body": "We place the selected policy, confirm the declared workforce and insured terms, and make sure the required documents and schedules are correctly issued.", "title": "Arrange the Selected Cover"}, {"body": "We handle the claims, relevant policy changes as your workforce, wages or activities and prepare the updated information required for renewal.", "title": "Keep Your Cover Current"}], "layout": "grid", "eyebrow": "", "heading": "How we arrange workmen compensation insurance?"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "steps"}}, {"id": "370e35c2-7983-48fb-8b0e-bb54b316ddb2", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Contact Triple H as soon as possible after the employee receives the necessary medical attention. We handle the claim from notification through assessment and settlement and deal with the insurer on your company’s behalf.", "items": [{"text": "We register the claim with the insurer, confirm the documents required and help your company provide the accident details, employee information, medical reports and other supporting records."}, {"text": "We follow the medical and claims assessment, coordinate with the insurer and relevant parties, and keep the file moving while the applicable benefits are determined."}, {"text": "We review the proposed settlement against the policy terms and continue following the claim until the applicable medical, disability, death or other insured benefits are settled."}], "heading": "What to do when one of your employees is injured at work"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "editorial-story"}}, {"id": "a7bc260b-a25a-4c4a-9b82-7894bb22850f", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Practical answers about employee cover, workplace accidents, premiums, workforce changes, claims and the information needed to arrange workmen compensation insurance.", "items": [{"answer": "Workmen compensation forms part of the Lebanese framework protecting employees following work-related accidents. Employers should arrange appropriate cover for employees who fall within the applicable requirements.", "question": "Q1 – Is workmen compensation insurance required for our company in Lebanon?"}, {"answer": "Cover can include employees from diverse nationalities and across different occupations and risk categories, from office staff to employees carrying out manual, technical, driving, construction or other operational work.", "question": "Q2 – Which employees can be covered?"}, {"answer": "The premium generally depends on your declared wages, number of employees (name or unnamed), occupations, business activities and the level of risk associated with the work they perform.", "question": "Q3 – How is the premium calculated?"}, {"answer": "Not always. Cover can be arranged on a named or unnamed employee basis, depending on the policy. For unnamed employees, the required employee categories, numbers and declared wages must still be provided accurately.", "question": "Q4 – Do all employees have to be named individually on the policy?"}, {"answer": "Contact Triple H when there is a material change in your workforce, wages, occupations or activities so we can confirm whether the insurer needs the policy information updated.", "question": "Q5 – What happens if our workforce or wages change during the year?"}, {"answer": "No. Workmen compensation is not the same as NSSF. The policy responds to work-related accidents according to its terms and the applicable Lebanese framework, while NSSF is a separate social-security system.", "question": "Q6 – Is workmen compensation the same as NSSF?"}, {"answer": "Not automatically under every policy. Commuting accidents can be included by some insurers as an extension, so the territorial and journey conditions should be checked when arranging the cover.", "question": "Q7 – Are employees covered while travelling to or from work?"}, {"answer": "They may be covered where specifically included in the policy. The definition, limits and conditions should be checked carefully because cover can differ between insurers.", "question": "Q8 – Are occupational illnesses covered?"}, {"answer": "Make sure the employee receives the necessary medical attention, record the circumstances of the accident and contact Triple H promptly. We coordinate the required documents, notify the insurer and follow the claim through assessment and settlement.", "question": "Q9 – What should our company do if an employee is injured at work?"}, {"answer": "The insurer may request the accident declaration, employee details, medical reports, treatment documents and other evidence relating to the incident. We confirm what is required and manage the submission with your company.", "question": "Q10 – What documents may be needed for a work accident claim?"}, {"answer": "We usually need your employee numbers, occupations, declared salaries or wages, business activities and work locations, together with any relevant subcontractor exposure or other higher-risk duties.", "question": "Q11 – What information do we need for a workmen compensation quote?"}, {"answer": "Yes, different employee categories can be included under the same company arrangement, with occupations and exposures declared separately so the insurer can assess each category appropriately.", "question": "Q12 – Can office employees and higher-risk workers be insured under the same policy?"}], "heading": "Workmen Compensation Insurance FAQs", "showArrows": true, "smoothMotion": true}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "faq"}}, {"id": "9f58ee9d-2e81-47f2-b35a-dcf671fc89af", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px"}}, "content": {"intro": "Explore other cover that can protect your employees, property and wider business risks alongside workmen compensation insurance.", "heading": "Explore more business insurance", "buttonHref": "/en/solutions/business", "buttonLabel": "Explore Business Insurance"}, "visible": true, "children": [], "settings": {"sectionType": "callout"}}, {"id": "d4e84e12-6431-4f11-8853-e6440adf705a", "type": "section", "styles": {"mobile": {"paddingTop": "48px", "paddingBottom": "48px"}, "desktop": {"paddingTop": "80px", "paddingBottom": "80px", "backgroundColor": "var(--inverse)"}}, "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "871c8889-ae3b-44da-8863-daa8dc6fe886", "type": "container", "visible": true, "children": [{"id": "79509773-a937-4720-a514-c1c1d5e308f2", "type": "heading", "styles": {"mobile": {"fontSize": "32px"}, "desktop": {"fontSize": "44px"}}, "content": {"text": "Get a workmen compensation insurance quote", "level": 2}, "visible": true}, {"id": "d5cb99e6-fe64-4a54-90ce-63834b204f35", "type": "text", "styles": {"desktop": {"fontSize": "17px", "maxWidth": "62ch", "lineHeight": "1.7"}}, "content": {"text": "Send us your workforce details, employee categories, declared wages and work activities. Triple H will compare suitable insurers in the Lebanese market and come back with clear, written options for your business."}, "visible": true}, {"id": "f84838f1-9290-4ab3-b4ae-65d61795382f", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "/en/contact", "label": "Request a Quote", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}, {"id": "ad129fe7-bb14-419c-a0e6-9584e8d32642", "type": "button", "content": {"href": "https://wa.me/96181891959", "label": "Enquire on WhatsApp", "variant": "inverse"}, "visible": true}]}], "settings": {"imageAlt": "", "sectionType": "call-to-action", "mobileImageUrl": "", "desktopImageUrl": ""}}], "settings": {"headerMode": "media-overlay", "footerVisible": true}, "template": "builder", "schemaVersion": 1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('b8c33acd-855c-530e-b507-94917a041944', 'تأمين الأساطيل', 'ar/fleet-insurance', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":null,"Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":null,"ImageUrl":null,"Description":null},"Description":null,"CanonicalUrl":null}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', '316e0273-30ca-4cf6-a752-3e331b52d196', 'fleet-insurance', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"ed664984-a578-5b5e-a1b4-88bcdf0c6aa9","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"أضف مقدمة واضحة لهذه الصفحة.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اعرف المزيد","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"عنوان القسم","heading":"عنوان الصفحة الجديدة","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"/uploads/20260924205005-9296b40e78d14346bc47c622a6af075c.webp","desktopImageUrl":"/uploads/20260924205005-9296b40e78d14346bc47c622a6af075c.webp"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"df0ec37b-3357-594b-ac39-e8bd592ef73a","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"اختر خدمة لمعرفة المزيد عنها.","items":[{"href":"","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"","position":1,"solutionSlug":"health"}],"heading":"خدمات التأمين"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-cards"}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('07f0dded-f6f4-52d1-9d3d-89a8b241f4a9', 'تأمين خيانة الأمانة | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/solutions/fidelity-guarantee-insurance', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة للخسائر الناجمة عن سرقة الموظفين أو الاحتيال أو عدم الأمانة، تُرتّبه تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين وفق طبيعة أعمالك."},"Description":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة في لبنان لسرقة الموظفين والاحتيال وعدم الأمانة. قارن بين شركات التأمين والحدود والشروط مع تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين.","CanonicalUrl":"https://www.triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions/fidelity-guarantee-insurance"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', '18bb4eb0-d1b4-4d60-b48f-9594407ae155', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"9ac1e079-91df-5f36-a5c2-31bac1c05d75","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"احمِ أعمالك من الخسائر المالية المباشرة الناجمة عن أعمال الاحتيال أو عدم الأمانة التي يرتكبها الموظفون، بما فيها السرقة أو الاختلاس، بتغطية تُرتَّب وفق طبيعة أعمالك وحدود التغطية المطلوبة.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"تأمين الأعمال والموظفين","heading":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"7760e0c1-7656-5456-8ca8-96bec94bd134","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يحمي تأمين خيانة الأمانة المنشأة من الخسائر المالية المباشرة الناجمة عن أعمال الاحتيال أو عدم الأمانة التي يرتكبها الموظفون، بما فيها السرقة أو الاختلاس أو الاستيلاء غير المشروع على الأموال أو الممتلكات. تقارن تريبل إتش بين شركات التأمين المناسبة وترتّب التغطية وفق أدوار موظفيك وحجم تعرضك المالي وحدود التغطية المطلوبة.","eyebrow":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة","heading":"ما هو تأمين خيانة الأمانة؟","audience":"تجار التجزئة والجملة والمطاعم والفنادق والصيدليات والمصنّعون والموزّعون وغيرها من المنشآت التي يتعامل موظفوها مع النقد أو المخزون أو المدفوعات أو الحسابات أو أصول الشركة.","buttonHref":"/ar/contact","buttonLabel":"اطلب عرض سعر","audienceHeading":"لمن تُناسب هذه التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-introduction"}},{"id":"22d6bcc6-d091-5f1b-a21a-a629bbfdb837","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"0896c65c-131a-589f-841a-ca4976076363","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"572ecb8c-88c6-5747-86a0-6a83f0fca22e","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف يمكن تنظيم تغطية خيانة الأمانة؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"1f98b2cc-c50a-5f4f-b010-5c4410f059de","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن تنظيم تغطية خيانة الأمانة لتشمل موظفين محددين أو مناصب وظيفية أو مجموعات مختارة من الموظفين أو جميع العاملين، بحسب طريقة إدارة منشأتك للأموال والأصول."},"visible":true},{"id":"8a35385e-e9c9-5994-8bc6-8b54bc40b2a1","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"ac0189ae-52e6-591a-bb23-6bc44f948d8b","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"360579fb-e4b8-5ce1-81b6-0eed35754216","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية موظفين بأسمائهم","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"399f61c5-c2bd-59b2-be8a-81b0ca516684","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية موظفين محددين ترد أسماؤهم في الوثيقة، بحدّ متفق عليه لكل شخص أو للمجموعة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"60be3475-6031-54ce-aeb8-e76e70e406b8","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"d39baa20-464d-5fea-920e-529148c5db87","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية بحسب المنصب الوظيفي","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"31cb3a97-dd81-50e8-a5a0-02ed1cb33c90","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية تُرتَّب بحسب الدور الوظيفي بدلاً من اسم الموظف، مثل أمين الصندوق أو المحاسب أو أمين المستودع أو المدير المالي."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"2d8de290-2e10-59ea-a4a5-baa9810cd7c1","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"742d7269-43f8-5ade-acac-5e55f7996177","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"مجموعات مختارة من الموظفين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"e98957d5-c7b1-5260-bc17-d9455e58f43f","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية فئات محددة من الموظفين الذين تشمل مهامهم التعامل مع الأموال أو المخزون أو المدفوعات أو الحسابات أو غيرها من أصول الشركة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"17426d02-b6c7-5b68-80ec-c17acf5489f3","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"7dc61e5f-6097-54df-b910-d37a3abf44ea","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تغطية شاملة للموظفين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"5e8be50a-a315-5134-ab44-8e4c73a75ecb","type":"text","content":{"text":"تغطية أوسع لجميع العاملين دون إدراج كل موظف على حدة، وفق الحدود والشروط المتفق عليها مع شركة التأمين."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"e39d5308-2b2a-5bc0-9130-d09a75138838","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"help":"نقارن بين شركات التأمين وهياكل التغطية بحسب الموظف أو المنصب والحدود ومبالغ التحمل وفترات اكتشاف الخسارة والتوسعات والاستثناءات، ونرتّب التغطية المناسبة لأعمالك، ونتولى المطالبات مع شركة التأمين من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية.","intro":"بحسب الوثيقة، يمكن أن يغطي تأمين خيانة الأمانة الخسائر المالية المباشرة الناجمة عن أعمال الاحتيال أو عدم الأمانة التي يرتكبها الموظفون، بما فيها السرقة أو الاختلاس أو الاستيلاء غير المشروع على الأموال أو البضائع أو غيرها من ممتلكات الشركة.","items":[{"text":"سرقة الموظفين وعدم أمانتهم"},{"text":"الاحتيال والاختلاس"},{"text":"الاستيلاء غير المشروع على الأموال"},{"text":"خسارة البضائع أو غيرها من ممتلكات الشركة"},{"text":"التزوير، حيث تشمله التغطية"},{"text":"الخسائر الناجمة عن تواطؤ الموظفين، حيث تشملها التغطية"}],"heading":"ماذا يمكن أن يغطي تأمين خيانة الأمانة؟","helpHeading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"coverage-details"}},{"id":"e9e7a296-389d-5a0a-92ed-75d05c6e19bc","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يعتمد اختيار وثيقة خيانة الأمانة المناسبة على أكثر من القسط. فالموظفون المشمولون والممتلكات المؤمّنة والحدود وشروط اكتشاف الخسارة وشروط الوثيقة يمكن أن تؤثر جميعها في كيفية استجابة التغطية.","items":[{"text":"سمعة شركة التأمين وخبرتها في خيانة الأمانة وسجلها في تسوية المطالبات"},{"text":"تغطية موظفين بأسمائهم أو بحسب المناصب أو مجموعات مختارة أو جميع الموظفين"},{"text":"تعريف الموظف والأدوار الوظيفية المؤمّنة"},{"text":"الحدود لكل موظف أو منصب والحد الإجمالي للوثيقة"},{"text":"مبالغ التحمل المطبّقة على الخسارة"},{"text":"الأموال والأوراق المالية والمخزون وغيرها من ممتلكات الشركة المشمولة"},{"text":"كيفية التعامل مع التواطؤ والتزوير وغيرها من أعمال عدم الأمانة"},{"text":"فترة اكتشاف الخسارة المؤمّنة"},{"text":"متطلبات المحاسبة والتدقيق والمطابقة بموجب الوثيقة"},{"text":"الاستثناءات والشروط الرئيسية التي تؤثر في مطالبات عدم أمانة الموظفين"}],"heading":"ما الذي ينبغي مقارنته قبل اختيار تأمين خيانة الأمانة؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"0dd86438-a6f7-5590-ae18-9c9256ab1858","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"نراجع المواضع التي قد تتسبب فيها خيانة أمانة الموظفين بخسارة مالية، ونقارن بين شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية وهياكل التغطية، ثم نرتّب التغطية وفق الأدوار والحدود التي تحتاجها منشأتك.","items":[{"body":"نراجع الموظفين الذين يتعاملون مع النقد أو المدفوعات أو المخزون أو الحسابات أو غيرها من أصول الشركة، إلى جانب الضوابط المعمول بها.","title":"مراجعة مخاطر الموظفين"},{"body":"نقارن بين هياكل التغطية والموظفين أو المناصب المؤمّنة والحدود ومبالغ التحمل وفترات اكتشاف الخسارة والشروط والاستثناءات والقسط.","title":"مقارنة شركات التأمين المناسبة"},{"body":"نرتّب إصدار الوثيقة المختارة، ونؤكد الموظفين أو المناصب المشمولة، ونتحقق من توافق الحدود والشروط المتفق عليها مع أعمالك.","title":"ترتيب التغطية المختارة"},{"body":"نتولى المطالبات والتعديلات والتجديدات مع تغير أدوار الموظفين أو مسؤولياتهم أو الحدود أو أنشطة المنشأة.","title":"إبقاء التغطية محدّثة"}],"layout":"grid","heading":"كيف نرتّب تأمين خيانة الأمانة؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"steps"}},{"id":"05ff196b-6c8b-5aa9-82cf-929ee1bc9739","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تواصل مع تريبل إتش فور اكتشاف اشتباه في احتيال أو سرقة أو عدم أمانة. نُبلغ شركة التأمين، ونساعدك في تنظيم الأدلة، وندير المطالبة خلال التقييم والتسوية.","items":[{"text":"نساعدك على جمع السجلات اللازمة لإثبات ما حدث وتحديد قيمة الخسارة، مثل السجلات المحاسبية وكشوف الحسابات المصرفية وسجلات المخزون وتاريخ المعاملات ونتائج التحقيق الداخلي."},{"text":"ننسّق مع شركة التأمين وأي خبير تسوية خسائر أو محقق تعيّنه، ونستجيب لطلبات المعلومات الإضافية، ونتابع تقييم الفعل غير الأمين والخسارة المالية الناتجة عنه."},{"text":"نراجع رد شركة التأمين وأي تسوية مقترحة وفق شروط الوثيقة وحدودها ومبلغ التحمل المطبّق، ونواصل متابعة المطالبة حتى انتهاء الإجراءات."}],"heading":"عندما تتسبب خيانة أمانة الموظفين بخسارة مالية"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"86fc0809-845d-5ee6-9064-5d4c682394d2","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عملية عن عدم أمانة الموظفين والسرقة والاحتيال والموظفين المؤمّنين وفترات اكتشاف الخسارة والحدود وما يجب فعله عند الاشتباه بخسارة.","items":[{"answer":"يغطي تأمين خيانة الأمانة الخسائر المالية الناجمة عن أعمال عدم الأمانة أو الاحتيال التي يرتكبها الموظفون. أما تأمين الأموال فيغطي عادةً الأموال ضد مخاطر مثل السطو أو السرقة بالكسر والخلع أو الفقد أثناء النقل، بحسب الوثيقة.","question":"س1 – ما الفرق بين تأمين خيانة الأمانة وتأمين الأموال؟"},{"answer":"يمكن ترتيب التغطية لموظفين بأسمائهم أو مناصب وظيفية معينة أو مجموعات مختارة من الموظفين أو نطاق أوسع من العاملين، بحسب شركة التأمين وهيكل الوثيقة.","question":"س2 – من هم الموظفون الذين يمكن تغطيتهم؟"},{"answer":"يمكن أن تغطي الوثيقة الخسائر المالية المباشرة الناجمة عن أعمال مثل السرقة أو الاحتيال أو الاختلاس أو الاستيلاء غير المشروع على الأموال أو ممتلكات الشركة. وتتحدد الأعمال المؤمّنة بدقة وفق نص الوثيقة.","question":"س3 – ما أنواع عدم أمانة الموظفين التي يمكن تغطيتها؟"},{"answer":"قد تشمل تغطية خيانة الأمانة خسائر المخزون أو غيره من ممتلكات الشركة، بحسب شركة التأمين ونص الوثيقة. قبل ترتيب الوثيقة، نوضح بدقة الأصول المشمولة والحدود المطبّقة وما إذا كانت هناك حاجة إلى تغطية إضافية.","question":"س4 – ماذا لو سرق موظف مخزوناً أو غيره من ممتلكات الشركة؟"},{"answer":"يمكن أن يغطي تأمين خيانة الأمانة التواطؤ بين الموظفين. قبل ترتيب إصدار الوثيقة، نوضح كيفية تعامل شركة التأمين مع التواطؤ والحدود المطبّقة وكيفية تغطية خسارة يشارك فيها عدة موظفين.","question":"س5 – ماذا لو شارك أكثر من موظف في الاحتيال؟"},{"answer":"قد تبقى المطالبة مشمولة إذا وقع الفعل غير الأمين واكتُشف ضمن الشروط وفترة اكتشاف الخسارة المطبّقة في الوثيقة. نتحقق من ذلك بعناية عند مقارنة الوثائق.","question":"س6 – ماذا لو اكتُشفت الخسارة بعد مغادرة الموظف الشركة؟"},{"answer":"يعتمد ذلك على نص الوثيقة. فقد تشترط بعض الوثائق تحديد الموظف المسؤول، بينما قد تتاح تغطية خسائر تسبب بها موظفون مجهولو الهوية وفق شروط محددة. قبل إصدار الوثيقة، نوضح كيفية التعامل مع ذلك والأدلة المطلوبة.","question":"س7 – هل يجب على المنشأة تحديد الموظف المسؤول؟"},{"answer":"ليس عادةً. فتأمين خيانة الأمانة مصمم أساساً لأعمال عدم الأمانة التي يرتكبها الموظفون. أما الاحتيال الخارجي أو الخسائر السيبرانية فقد تتطلب تأمين الجرائم أو التأمين السيبراني أو وثيقة أخرى مناسبة.","question":"س8 – هل يغطي تأمين خيانة الأمانة الاحتيال الذي يرتكبه العملاء أو الموردون أو المخترقون؟"},{"answer":"ليس تلقائياً. عادةً يجب دعم الخسارة بأدلة تُظهر أنها نتجت عن فعل احتيالي أو غير أمين مشمول بالتأمين، وليس عن فرق عادي في المحاسبة أو المخزون.","question":"س9 – هل يُعدّ النقص غير المبرر في النقد أو المخزون تلقائياً مطالبة خيانة أمانة؟"},{"answer":"يعتمد الحد المناسب على حجم الأموال أو الممتلكات التي يمكن للموظفين الوصول إليها، ومسؤولياتهم، وقيم المعاملات، والخسارة المالية المحتملة من فعل غير أمين. نراجع هذه المخاطر قبل مقارنة الحدود.","question":"س10 – ما مقدار تغطية خيانة الأمانة الذي تحتاجه منشأتنا؟"},{"answer":"احتفظ بالسجلات ذات الصلة وتواصل مع تريبل إتش سريعاً. نُبلغ شركة التأمين، ونؤكد المعلومات المطلوبة، ونتولى المطالبة نيابةً عنك من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية.","question":"س11 – ماذا نفعل إذا اشتبهنا باحتيال أو سرقة من موظف؟"},{"answer":"نحتاج عادةً إلى نشاط منشأتك وعدد الموظفين والأدوار المطلوب تغطيتها والأموال أو الممتلكات التي يتعاملون معها والحدود المطلوبة وتفاصيل الضوابط المالية وإجراءات التحقق المعمول بها.","question":"س12 – ما المعلومات المطلوبة للحصول على عرض تأمين خيانة الأمانة؟"}],"heading":"الأسئلة الشائعة حول تأمين خيانة الأمانة","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"9abb9b7d-d2e3-5517-8901-7cd85bddd834","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"استكشف تغطيات أخرى لحماية أعمالك من الحوادث السيبرانية وخسائر الأصول المادية والمسؤولية تجاه الغير، إلى جانب تأمين خيانة الأمانة.","heading":"تأمينات أخرى للأعمال","buttonHref":"/ar/solutions/business","buttonLabel":"استكشف تأمين الأعمال"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"callout"}},{"id":"0706bf2d-53ff-5c7a-8ff4-4c7ec8d7440b","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"b07fe554-71d7-58a9-bca9-0eb93d3a8fc2","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"4b5a9221-0cd9-51f8-9c47-9e15ad5528e3","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"احصل على عرض تأمين خيانة الأمانة","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"19a105a9-1d1b-5bab-82b0-f8232efe4bdf","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا عن منشأتك وأدوار الموظفين التي تريد تغطيتها والأموال أو الممتلكات التي يتعاملون معها والحدود التي تحتاجها. سنقارن بين شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقدم لك خيارات مكتوبة وواضحة."},"visible":true},{"id":"0e941399-064b-5993-9b09-8847ba70633e","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"7168c182-a3f8-58ec-9267-73fa15517a91","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('02d5ab3a-fc71-5f97-baa3-05e5e5209eb1', 'أدلة وموارد التأمين في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/resources', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"أدلة وموارد التأمين في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"أدلة وموارد التأمين في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"إرشادات تأمينية واضحة وعملية للأفراد والعائلات والشركات في لبنان، من اختيار التغطية ومقارنة الوثائق إلى التجديدات والمطالبات."},"Description":"أدلة عملية للتأمين في لبنان. افهم التغطية وقارن الوثائق واستعد للتجديد والمطالبات وتعرّف على دور تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين.","CanonicalUrl":"https://www.triplehbroker.com/ar/resources"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', '74bfdfd0-278f-4ee1-b8af-8da459e0dd89', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"1e43e58f-f631-550c-b21a-b1b78c7ef480","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"أدلة عملية وقوائم تحقق وشروحات واضحة من تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين لمساعدة الأفراد والعائلات والشركات في لبنان على فهم التغطية ومقارنة الوثائق والاستعداد للتجديد ومعرفة ما يجب فعله عند حدوث مطالبة.","items":[],"eyebrow":"موارد التأمين","heading":"أدلة وموارد التأمين في لبنان","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"/uploads/20260925141503-6650def5fa2b4d60b263cf6d6b198c0a.webp","desktopImageUrl":"/uploads/20260925141205-77e105c9aaba4cebb473afddc12587d6.webp"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"28235e20-cbaa-510a-ad72-329b8bae553b","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"af11ff9c-6a32-51ae-a3ee-f59bf7e64fbd","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"18d5b610-41dd-52ae-8f9a-1082d3b20d19","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ابدأ بما تحتاج إليه","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"d3cc005a-acde-50f6-a1f5-d5b9f666d6ef","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"اختر نقطة البداية، سواء كنت تستكشف التأمين أو تتعامل مع مطالبة أو تبحث عن تغطية لأعمالك."},"visible":true},{"id":"9f933a28-6dd0-5bdf-a605-cce73fb5119c","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"bced66c1-f6a5-5848-8e7a-55f2d6f494df","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"e08793e9-316f-50e6-adf0-0f8c600c7916","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"استكشف حلول التأمين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"e5478fcb-d2c4-5fdb-a7ab-a227782998ba","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تصفّح حلول التأمين الشخصية والعائلية والتجارية والمتخصصة المتاحة عبر تريبل إتش."},"visible":true},{"id":"bf89c00d-aabb-5f09-9cd5-cad09c267a06","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/solutions","label":"استكشف حلول التأمين","variant":"primary"},"visible":true}]},{"id":"235935b1-32e2-5119-afd2-8b45f37121d9","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"374c2a23-b004-5fc2-8082-c9cd68c7fe79","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"دعم المطالبات","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"c9e831f8-7552-5699-9740-9617ee725788","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تعرّف على ما يجب فعله عند وقوع خسارة والمتطلبات المحتملة وكيف تتولى تريبل إتش المطالبات مع شركة التأمين."},"visible":true},{"id":"f8c691b5-5844-5e24-9a00-4233c416ca38","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/claims","label":"اطّلع على دعم المطالبات","variant":"primary"},"visible":true}]},{"id":"6f8a690e-b4c6-5037-8441-e4486501f4f5","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f550c83a-38e5-539f-8318-6572e71516a1","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"التأمين بحسب القطاع","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"307cee97-8e6a-5019-9242-c1e1e65822f9","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"استكشف اختلاف احتياجات التأمين بين القطاعات وأنواع التغطية التي تُدرس عادةً لمختلف الأعمال."},"visible":true},{"id":"b573971e-6932-5936-8bfa-df12cf72897b","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/industries","label":"استكشف القطاعات","variant":"primary"},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"392bf24d-b657-53b7-9d8a-4affa41fd8c1","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"قد تبدو وثيقتا تأمين متشابهتين مع أنهما توفران حماية مختلفة جداً. فالقسط والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط ونص الوثيقة يمكن أن تؤثر جميعها فيما يحدث عندما تحتاج فعلياً إلى التغطية.","items":[{"text":"ابدأ بما تحتاج إلى حمايته. للأفراد والعائلات، قد يشمل ذلك التأمين الصحي أو السيارات أو المنزل أو الحياة أو السفر. وللشركات، قد يشمل الممتلكات والموظفين والمركبات والمسؤولية والبضائع والمخاطر السيبرانية وغيرها من المخاطر المتخصصة."},{"text":"الخيار الأقل تكلفة ليس دائماً الأنسب. فقد تختلف شركات التأمين في ما تغطيه والحدود التي توفرها ومبالغ التحمل التي تطبقها والاستثناءات والشروط وكيفية التعامل مع مخاطر معينة."},{"text":"هنا يأتي دور تريبل إتش. نقيّم احتياجاتك، ونقارن بين شركات التأمين المناسبة، ونوضح الفروق المهمة قبل أن تختار. بعد إصدار الوثيقة، نتولى التعديلات والتجديدات. وعند حدوث مطالبة، نُبلغ شركة التأمين، ونؤكد المعلومات المطلوبة، ونتولى المطالبة نيابةً عنك من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية."}],"heading":"التأمين في لبنان: ما الذي تقارنه قبل اختيار التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"37940676-ef00-50f3-b5b7-60192f1801ce","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"ac015ac1-3f0c-5f9c-b33d-3d044204622a","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"81857884-ce89-533f-9186-669e6f364888","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"أدلة التأمين","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"087b03ea-fa96-5f20-a8eb-7d83ef28bb39","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أدلة عملية لمساعدتك على فهم التأمين في لبنان ومقارنة التغطيات بعناية أكبر واتخاذ قرارات مدروسة قبل الشراء وعند التجديد وعند حدوث مطالبة."},"visible":true},{"id":"aac290db-5ffa-5a32-a977-38aabdb0776d","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"253b78a8-c16e-5494-b707-d04299cca535","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"d5ad265d-fdbb-507d-a63f-12d1eb50598f","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"وسيط التأمين وشركة التأمين: ما الفرق؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"a67380d3-58f4-5cf1-9195-b1223a73b072","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"افهم الفرق بين الشراء مباشرةً من شركة التأمين والعمل مع وسيط يقيّم احتياجاتك ويقارن الخيارات المناسبة ويمثّلك طوال دورة حياة الوثيقة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"f9e1043f-1f9d-5001-b13e-4c7617ae90ed","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"6ca0ba8f-b002-5f30-9948-e8b70c12f54c","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف تقرأ وثيقة التأمين؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"e410af9c-cc19-5e24-bf21-caa5c8ea0174","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تعلّم فهم التغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات وشروط الوثيقة، وما يجب التحقق منه قبل قبولها."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"c016f4c5-dd56-5a4b-8a8e-dba348394c71","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"dd0e2f59-af66-5c87-8d4c-c5f6245dbff1","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف تقارن عروض التأمين بشكل صحيح؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"5172b4b1-3329-5cc5-b331-e111f534c764","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تعلّم مقارنة عروض التأمين بما يتجاوز السعر، بما يشمل التغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط وشروط شركة التأمين والفروق التي قد تهم عند المطالبة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"d4d06fef-25f3-5d09-8a5a-a4166c08b7f3","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"e275033c-b4a4-5191-9a14-38aadb7c9039","type":"heading","content":{"text":"شرح حدود التأمين ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"552c86bc-8bb8-5de5-8322-41847da7e47a","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم الأجزاء الأساسية في وثيقة التأمين التي تحدد ما يُغطّى والمبلغ الذي قد يُدفع والمتطلبات أو القيود المطبّقة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"b3fc2a3c-0aa1-5629-9bd3-5187e46218ad","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"5d95667a-d95f-5b3d-ad8f-ce537c5bc1dd","type":"heading","content":{"text":"ما هو نقص التأمين وكيف يؤثر في المطالبة؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"99dfd763-92d5-5ef3-88c5-6b65b1044c88","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم معنى نقص التأمين وأهمية القيم المؤمّنة وكيف يؤثر تأمين الممتلكات أو الأصول بقيمة أقل من المناسبة في المطالبة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"832bce64-1b71-5523-b14b-58ac82d6f035","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"41fac960-e84d-59a4-8ae3-9f29c967a6e9","type":"heading","content":{"text":"ما الذي قد يؤثر في مطالبة التأمين؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"d47183a2-a67f-5879-a94c-cc7b3414bcea","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم كيف تؤثر التغطية والاستثناءات والمعلومات غير الدقيقة أو الناقصة ومتطلبات الإبلاغ والمستندات ومبالغ التحمل والحدود وشروط الوثيقة في المطالبة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"542b8930-891b-5dde-abac-54065364db6f","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1709fec1-4477-5ed5-894a-463a0dcae3e4","type":"heading","content":{"text":"التأمين الصحي في لبنان: دليل الشراء","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"bbf2a585-98f5-5165-b8ae-03f4b8d4ebbe","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم شبكات المستشفيات ودرجات الاستشفاء وتغطية العلاج داخل المستشفى وخارجه وفترات الانتظار والحالات السابقة للتأمين والحدود وغيرها من نقاط المقارنة عند اختيار التأمين الصحي في لبنان."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"a98a1a5a-1238-5da7-be29-f95e7cd7767e","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"39f099a9-3004-5fee-97a4-17fbd14aa14f","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تأمين السيارات في لبنان: ضد الغير أم شامل؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"f589868f-ec9b-5ef6-9a25-53fc409a6864","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم الفرق بين تأمين السيارات ضد الغير والتأمين الشامل، وما يحميه كل نوع، وما يجب مقارنته قبل اختيار تأمين السيارات في لبنان."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"4ab8918a-128c-5e99-b333-dfe09e7c2d59","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"eba20cae-3d4c-5d01-b88a-cb43e8b88851","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تأمين المنزل في لبنان: دليل الشراء","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"7e1df290-8580-5f6f-8ee6-79547ea82830","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم كيفية حماية منزلك ومبناه ومحتوياته ومقتنياتك وتحديد القيم المؤمّنة، وما يجب مقارنته بشأن الحريق وأضرار المياه والسرقة والأحداث الطبيعية والمسؤولية."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"7e3560a8-d724-581b-96ed-fa355f7d3e4f","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"6efa1cca-4e7b-5101-933e-3e6afe717cc2","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تأمين الحياة في لبنان: دليل الشراء","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"da7866b3-539c-59d2-b1af-0d547ba5753d","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم الأنواع الرئيسية لتأمين الحياة وحماية العائلة وكيفية تحديد مبالغ التغطية وما يجب مقارنته لحماية الدخل والديون والالتزامات المالية طويلة الأجل."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"f505b007-dbbe-5733-921c-fd7596f6b6fe","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c3fa90dd-5644-53f1-8850-bcd380471196","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تأمين السفر في لبنان: دليل الشراء","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"516e2c35-578a-5b17-b953-d57f6d4602e6","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم التغطية الطبية الطارئة والإجلاء والإعادة إلى الوطن وإلغاء الرحلة والأمتعة وحدود الوثيقة ومتطلبات التأشيرة عند مقارنة تأمين السفر في لبنان."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"b226f340-7607-5382-b236-a3daa2174c56","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"d2773194-7e77-55bf-b60d-97841e2647c6","type":"heading","content":{"text":"تأمين الأعمال في لبنان: ما الذي ينبغي للشركة دراسته؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"c93daf6e-a3f7-5e16-980b-c82e305a811c","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم المخاطر الرئيسية التي قد تحتاج منشأة إلى تأمينها، ومنها الممتلكات والموظفون والمسؤولية والمركبات والبضائع والمخاطر السيبرانية وغيرها بحسب طريقة عمل المنشأة."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"1cb6a0d6-2dde-53ad-9895-36ded0fbe133","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1fbb55bc-d885-5c25-8159-73377ce86f20","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"cd18ba49-8c89-5a80-ad5d-76e2c3d5021a","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"أدلة وقوائم تحقق عملية للتأمين","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"38f58834-d191-5ebe-b6f4-52d6eafd03d4","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"اعرف المعلومات التي يجب إعدادها وما يجب مراجعته. تتولى تريبل إتش المقارنة وترتيب إصدار الوثيقة والتعديلات والتجديدات والمطالبات مع شركة التأمين نيابةً عنك."},"visible":true},{"id":"827750a0-5cb6-50ff-800d-1a12b86da1e4","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"e84ad2db-a580-550d-8ea3-6ece48487c6b","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f47bd8a1-223c-5716-8432-bfa6ceb73d11","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الاستعداد للحصول على عرض تأمين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"05404f09-6f97-52ba-b1cb-e66c0d50487e","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تعرّف على المعلومات التي تساعدنا على فهم احتياجاتك قبل التواصل مع شركات التأمين في لبنان ومقارنة الخيارات المناسبة وشرح الفروق في التغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"89972754-cd8d-5da2-ba0f-4f3d26ecadf6","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"3c75ce0e-f709-5691-bb91-f2cf8015e389","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الاستعداد لتجديد تأمينك","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"fbf6cbe2-6519-5ba9-968f-27dc1c412685","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"راجع ما تغير منذ ترتيب وثيقتك، ثم دع تريبل إتش تعيد تقييم احتياجاتك وتتحقق من ملاءمة التغطية الحالية وتقارن شروط التجديد عند الاقتضاء."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"1b494099-c297-5737-8967-a2cc91c4b1d0","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c6859435-59d2-5a48-bd43-2e1e91e27eab","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ما الذي تُعدّه عند حدوث مطالبة؟","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"c5ffebd2-097c-5205-8197-f42bbd1d0af5","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تعرّف على المعلومات والمستندات التي قد تفيد بعد الخسارة. تواصل مع تريبل إتش سريعاً وسنُبلغ شركة التأمين ونؤكد المتطلبات ونتولى المطالبة نيابةً عنك خلال التقييم والتسوية."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"7331cd49-08b1-552e-95bf-66bb271e403b","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c11d35c5-60fa-54c7-9211-332d96c28dd0","type":"heading","content":{"text":"مراجعة مبالغ التأمين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"d8d55b73-1938-5c40-af5d-14dec281c093","type":"text","content":{"text":"افهم القيم التي قد تحتاج إلى مراجعة للمباني والمحتويات والمعدات والمخزون وغيرها من الأصول. تساعد تريبل إتش على تحديد ما يجب التصريح به وتشرح كيفية تطبيق شروط التقييم ونقص التأمين لدى شركة التأمين."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"28d8c53c-37ee-50a9-8864-ae2ad10fe73f","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تساعدك هذه الموارد على فهم التأمين. وتطبّق تريبل إتش هذه المعرفة على ظروفك الفعلية من خلال تقييم احتياجاتك ومقارنة شركات التأمين المناسبة وشرح الفروق قبل ترتيب التغطية.","items":[{"text":"لا تعتمد قرارات التأمين على معرفة اسم الوثيقة وحده. فالتغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والشروط المناسبة تعتمد على ما تحتاج إلى حمايته والمخاطر المعنية وكيفية استعداد شركات التأمين المختلفة لتغطيتها."},{"text":"قبل إصدار الوثيقة، تراجع تريبل إتش احتياجاتك وتتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة وتقارن الخيارات بما يتجاوز القسط. نوضح الفروق المهمة في التغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط ونص الوثيقة لتفهم اختيارك قبل الالتزام به."},{"text":"بعد إصدار الوثيقة، نتولى التعديلات والتجديدات. وعند حدوث مطالبة، نُبلغ شركة التأمين ونؤكد المعلومات المطلوبة ونتولى المطالبة نيابةً عنك من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية."}],"heading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش على تطبيق ما تعلّمته؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"0ef0a6f4-009b-55b1-b465-352a955204af","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات واضحة عن أسئلة التأمين الشائعة والمصطلحات التي قد تصادفها عند مقارنة التغطية أو مراجعة الوثيقة أو التعامل مع مطالبة.","items":[{"answer":"القسط هو المبلغ الذي تدفعه لقاء وثيقة التأمين. وقد يختلف بحسب نوع التغطية والخطر المؤمّن والحدود المختارة ومبالغ التحمل ومعلومات الاكتتاب وشروط شركة التأمين. تقارن تريبل إتش بين شركات التأمين المناسبة وتوضح الفروق قبل اختيارك.","question":"س1 – ما هو قسط التأمين؟"},{"answer":"مبلغ التحمل هو الجزء من الخسارة المغطاة الذي تتحمله قبل أن تدفع شركة التأمين المبلغ المتبقي، وفق شروط الوثيقة. وقد تختلف مبالغ التحمل بين الوثائق، لذا نشرحها عند مقارنة خياراتك.","question":"س2 – ما هو مبلغ التحمل؟"},{"answer":"حد الوثيقة هو أقصى مبلغ تدفعه شركة التأمين ضمن قسم معين من التغطية أو لنوع معين من المطالبات، وفق نص الوثيقة. وتتضمن بعض الوثائق أيضاً حدوداً فرعية لمنافع أو خسائر محددة.","question":"س3 – ما هو حد الوثيقة؟"},{"answer":"مبلغ التأمين هو القيمة أو المبلغ المحدد في الوثيقة للممتلكات المؤمّنة أو لمصلحة مؤمّنة أخرى. وقد يؤدي استخدام قيمة غير مناسبة إلى نقص التأمين، لذا يجب فهم أساس التقييم قبل ترتيب التغطية.","question":"س4 – ما هو مبلغ التأمين؟"},{"answer":"يحدد الاستثناء ظرفاً أو سبب خسارة أو نشاطاً أو نوع ضرر لا تغطيه الوثيقة. تختلف الاستثناءات بين الوثائق وشركات التأمين، لذلك تحدد تريبل إتش الفروق ذات الصلة وتشرحها قبل إصدار الوثيقة.","question":"س5 – ما هو الاستثناء؟"},{"answer":"الملحق هو تعديل مكتوب لوثيقة التأمين يضيف جزءاً من التغطية الأساسية أو نص الوثيقة أو يحذفه أو يغيره. وقد تؤثر الملاحق جوهرياً في استجابة الوثيقة، ويجب مراجعتها مع نصها الأساسي.","question":"س6 – ما هو ملحق الوثيقة؟"},{"answer":"الاكتتاب هو عملية تقييم شركة التأمين للخطر وتقرير قبوله والقسط والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والشروط المطبّقة عليه. تقدم تريبل إتش المعلومات المطلوبة إلى شركات التأمين المناسبة وتقارن الشروط التي تعرضها.","question":"س7 – ما هو الاكتتاب؟"},{"answer":"يشير التعويض عموماً إلى إعادة المؤمّن له مالياً إلى الوضع الذي كان عليه مباشرةً قبل الخسارة المغطاة، وفق أساس الوثيقة وحدودها ومبالغ التحمل وسائر شروطها. وقد تختلف طريقة حساب التعويض بحسب نوع التأمين.","question":"س8 – ماذا يعني التعويض في التأمين؟"},{"answer":"يحدث نقص التأمين عندما تكون القيمة المؤمّنة أو مستوى التغطية أقل من الخطر الفعلي أو القيمة التي كان ينبغي تأمينها. وبحسب الوثيقة، قد يُخفض ذلك المبلغ المستحق بعد الخسارة، بما في ذلك بعض حالات الخسارة الجزئية.","question":"س9 – ما هو نقص التأمين؟"},{"answer":"نص الوثيقة هو المستند التعاقدي الذي يحدد ما يغطيه التأمين وتعريفاته وحدوده واستثناءاته وشروطه وسائر أحكامه. تراجع تريبل إتش النصوص ذات الصلة وتشرح الفروق الجوهرية قبل اختيارك.","question":"س10 – ما هو نص وثيقة التأمين؟"},{"answer":"قارن ما يتجاوز القسط. انظر إلى شركة التأمين والتغطية والحدود ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات والشروط وسائر الأحكام التي قد تؤثر في استجابة الوثيقة. تقارن تريبل إتش الخيارات المناسبة وتشرح الفروق المهمة قبل اختيارك.","question":"س11 – ما الذي يجب مقارنته قبل اختيار التأمين في لبنان؟"},{"answer":"راجع تغطيتك عند التجديد وكلما حدث تغير مهم في ظروفك الشخصية أو العائلية أو التجارية. تراجع تريبل إتش هذه التغيرات وترتّب التعديلات اللازمة مع شركة التأمين.","question":"س12 – متى يجب مراجعة تغطيتي التأمينية؟"}],"heading":"شرح أسئلة ومصطلحات التأمين","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"187d52cb-735b-5b47-86cf-952bcbfb6603","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"b4de02d8-584f-5259-b4c5-1c2cff2ae6d7","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"6780f3fb-6953-5cc3-a8f3-739ab02ba75a","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"هل لديك سؤال عن تأمينك؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"59a4356a-ac33-5c29-803e-9e9d33d0a25d","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"سواء كنت تقارن الوثائق أو تراجع تغطية حالية أو تستعد للتجديد أو تتعامل مع مطالبة، تحدث مع تريبل إتش للحصول على إرشاد واضح بشأن ما يهم وما ينبغي فعله تالياً."},"visible":true},{"id":"c50f8140-f3b8-5126-90d2-4a439a7267c4","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"تواصل مع تريبل إتش","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"77916bab-8054-5c4a-8dc7-63d2e9dea49d","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/solutions","label":"استكشف حلول التأمين","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'حلول التأمين | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/solutions', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"حلول التأمين في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"تأمين للأفراد والعائلات والشركات | تريبل إتش","ImageUrl":"","Description":"استكشف حلول التأمين الشخصية والعائلية والتجارية والمتخصصة التي ترتّبها تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين وفق احتياجاتك."},"Description":"استكشف التأمين الصحي والحياة والسيارات والمنزل والأعمال والتأمين المتخصص في لبنان. تقارن تريبل إتش شركات التأمين المناسبة وترتّب التغطية وفق احتياجاتك.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions"}', '2026-08-08 09:43:37.801004+00', false, true, 'ar', 'fc15e60b-9973-38e9-7073-c12f7d01f4c2', 'solutions', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"d8ea0b47-d70b-598a-bf68-4a784d1b2ff8","type":"section","styles":{"size":"base","tone":"default","preset":"cinematic-tall","bordered":false},"content":{"intro":"من الحماية الشخصية والعائلية إلى مخاطر الأعمال والمخاطر المتخصصة، يتواصل فريقنا مع شركات التأمين المناسبة ويقارن العروض المتاحة ويشرح التغطية والحدود والشروط والاستثناءات والسعر بوضوح قبل ترتيب الوثيقة.","items":[],"eyebrow":"حلول التأمين","heading":"حلول تأمين للأفراد والعائلات والشركات في لبنان","imageAlt":"مستشار تأمين يجتمع مع عميل","mobileImageUrl":"/uploads/20260924211631-f077f335d69d4ff7b34918432416a6d4.webp","desktopImageUrl":"/uploads/20260924210420-23bddb5c34b34487b2acf157cfa46b5a.webp"},"visible":true,"position":0,"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"b030f524-4302-557d-bd1b-a77a7acc7e10","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تأمين لصحتك وعائلتك ومركبتك وسفرك واحتياجاتك الشخصية الأخرى، يُرتَّب وفق ظروفك والحماية التي تهمك.","items":[{"href":"/ar/solutions/health","title":"التأمين الصحي","summary":"تأمين طبي للأفراد والعائلات، يغطي العلاج في المستشفى والرعاية خارجه واحتياجات صحية أخرى وفق الوثيقة المختارة وشروط شركة التأمين.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925160942-71dafadce2b94c07b8c90a8ef32a794f.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف التأمين الصحي"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/life","title":"تأمين الحياة وحماية العائلة","summary":"تأمين حياة وحماية للعائلة في حالات الوفاة والأمراض الخطيرة والعجز والحوادث الشخصية، مع خطط مختارة تدعم أيضاً التعليم والتقاعد وغيرها من الاحتياجات المالية طويلة الأجل.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925162142-b76192ddfba5445ca80b6540d294e37d.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين الحياة وحماية العائلة"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/motor","title":"تأمين السيارات","summary":"تأمين للمركبات الخاصة، يشمل التأمين الإلزامي للأضرار الجسدية والمسؤولية تجاه الغير وتغطية جميع الأخطار والخسارة الكلية وغيرها بحسب الوثيقة المختارة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925163129-a8a2f1de39e34aaeae30aec96f1a196e.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين السيارات"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/home","title":"تأمين المنزل","summary":"تأمين للمنزل ومحتوياته ومقتنياتك الشخصية، بحماية قد تشمل الحريق وأضرار المياه والسرقة والمسؤولية وغيرها من المخاطر المنزلية المغطاة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925163459-aa3b773540174334acb8b806c141d4c7.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين المنزل"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/travel","title":"تأمين السفر","summary":"تأمين للرحلات القصيرة أو الطويلة أو المتكررة، يشمل الرعاية الطبية الطارئة وإلغاء الرحلة أو انقطاعها ومخاطر الأمتعة وتأخر السفر وغيرها من الحماية أثناء السفر.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925164107-c4c19666ac8e47158fd19af72390c823.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين السفر"},{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"تأمين الحيوانات الأليفة","summary":"تأمين للحيوانات الأليفة بحماية قد تشمل العلاج البيطري والرعاية المرتبطة بالحوادث ونفقات الأمراض وغيرها من تكاليف الرعاية الصحية المؤهلة، بحسب الوثيقة المختارة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925164419-5dfe2dfce4c34fddbe89443c960cc3a5.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"}],"heading":"التأمين الشخصي والعائلي"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solutions-catalog"}},{"id":"796084ad-e802-54ec-850e-2efd4fc3db9b","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تأمين للشركات والموظفين والمركبات والممتلكات والمخاطر التشغيلية، يُرتَّب وفق طريقة عمل مؤسستك وما تحتاج إلى حمايته.","items":[{"href":"/ar/solutions/commercial-property","title":"تأمين الممتلكات التجارية","summary":"تأمين للمباني والمكاتب والمحتويات والمخزون والمعدات، بحماية من الحريق والسرقة بالكسر والخلع والأضرار العرضية وغيرها من مخاطر الممتلكات المغطاة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925165803-0f82427f23034b749b9863e756fe641f.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين الممتلكات"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/group-health","title":"التأمين الصحي الجماعي","summary":"تأمين صحي للموظفين وعائلاتهم، بتغطية قد تشمل العلاج في المستشفى والرعاية خارجه وغيرها من المنافع الطبية بحسب الخطة المختارة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925170216-9bff3b762e9740faab6bd11deda187cb.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف التأمين الصحي الجماعي"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/group-life","title":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي","summary":"تأمين حياة جماعي يوفر حماية مالية لعائلات الموظفين في حالة الوفاة، مع منافع تأمينية إضافية متاحة بحسب الوثيقة الجماعية المختارة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925192620-b216d9f2341c47d9907ae20b43529fa8.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين الحياة الجماعي"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/commercial-motor-fleet","title":"تأمين المركبات التجارية والأساطيل","summary":"تأمين لمركبات الشركة وأساطيلها، بحماية قد تشمل جميع الأخطار والمسؤولية تجاه الغير والخسارة الكلية وغيرها من مخاطر المركبات التجارية.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925193430-6299faa660334686aca8480a8ce28a36.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين المركبات التجارية والأساطيل"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/commercial-liability-insurance","title":"تأمين المسؤولية","summary":"تأمين مسؤولية يحمي الشركات من المطالبات المغطاة عن الإصابات وأضرار الممتلكات وغيرها من المسؤوليات تجاه الغير الناشئة عن أنشطتها.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925194949-b0a71896953c4c93b05bfc686fc0d146.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين المسؤولية"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/workmen-compensation","title":"تأمين طوارئ العمل","summary":"تأمين لإصابات العمل والحوادث المهنية، يساعد على حماية الموظفين والشركات من النفقات الطبية والتعويضات وغيرها من مسؤوليات صاحب العمل المشمولة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925200127-02b747cba35e4c1d8231cb1720a79655.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين طوارئ العمل"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/marine-insurance","title":"التأمين البحري","summary":"تأمين للسفن وغيرها من المخاطر البحرية، بحماية قد تشمل أضرار الهيكل والآلات والمسؤولية تجاه الغير وغيرها من المخاطر البحرية المغطاة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925201227-97b80d95c4be45bd9692b31eaea793fb.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف التأمين البحري"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/cargo-insurance","title":"تأمين البضائع","summary":"تأمين يحمي البضائع أثناء النقل بحراً أو جواً أو براً من الخسائر أو الأضرار المغطاة، بما يشمل مخاطر أخرى مرتبطة بالنقل بحسب الوثيقة المختارة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925202036-22647f5fee8843cfa1cfb572dbdca107.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين البضائع"},{"href":"/ar/solutions/fidelity-guarantee-insurance","title":"تأمين خيانة الأمانة","summary":"تأمين يحمي الشركات من الخسائر المالية المغطاة الناجمة عن احتيال الموظفين أو سرقتهم أو عدم أمانتهم، بحسب شروط الوثيقة المختارة وحدودها.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925202626-1b0e5a6646e149ca839398a50a4d4a0a.webp","linkLabel":"استكشف تأمين خيانة الأمانة"}],"heading":"تأمين الأعمال والموظفين"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solutions-catalog"}},{"id":"0f1e03d6-6ddf-5baa-916e-c552f706810e","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تأمين للمخاطر المهنية والإدارية والسيبرانية والمرتبطة بالعاملين، يُرتَّب وفق المسؤوليات والأنشطة والمخاطر المعنية.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"تأمين الأخطاء الطبية","summary":"تأمين مسؤولية مهنية للأطباء وغيرهم من العاملين في الرعاية الصحية، يحمي من المطالبات المغطاة المرتبطة بالأخطاء أو الإغفال في عملهم المهني.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925205300-1ddec19da0464362a31c579526512594.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"},{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"تأمين التعويض المهني","summary":"تأمين مسؤولية مهنية للمستشارين والمحامين والمهندسين والمحاسبين والمتخصصين في تقنية المعلومات وغيرهم، يحمي من المطالبات المغطاة المرتبطة بالأخطاء أو الإغفال في خدماتهم المهنية.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260926185850-be92ca735278412ca827f46c64da7d75.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"},{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"التأمين السيبراني","summary":"تأمين للشركات التي تواجه مخاطر رقمية ومتعلقة بالبيانات، بحماية قد تشمل الحوادث السيبرانية واختراق البيانات والمسؤولية وغيرها من الخسائر التقنية المغطاة.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260926193428-1b60cfe9ca11495c895cc47822383797.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"},{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"تأمين المديرين والمسؤولين","summary":"تأمين مسؤولية لمديري الشركات ومسؤوليها، يحمي من المطالبات المغطاة المرتبطة بالقرارات أو الأفعال أو المسؤوليات التي يؤدونها في أدوارهم الإدارية.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260926193458-644892ab1bb042fc96aac73cde8403bd.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"},{"href":"/ar/contact","title":"تأمين المغتربين والعمال الأجانب","summary":"تأمين للمغتربين والعمال الأجانب، بحماية قد تشمل نفقات المستشفى والعلاج بعد حادث عمل مغطى، ومنافع الوفاة أو العجز عند انطباقها.","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260926194305-c1ba6eed35f84c578bd9520938dc06f6.webp","linkLabel":"استفسر"}],"heading":"التأمين المهني والمتخصص"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solutions-catalog"}},{"id":"d32314a1-d614-5f60-9753-8c9e36eaba98","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تغطيات إضافية لمخاطر وأصول وأنشطة محددة، من احتياجات تأمين المركبات والمسؤولية المتخصصة إلى المقتنيات الثمينة والأموال والمعدات ومخاطر البناء.","items":[{"text":"تأمين مركبات التأجير"},{"text":"تأمين مسؤولية المدارس"},{"text":"حماية المجوهرات والمقتنيات الثمينة"},{"text":"تأمين النقد في الخزنة"},{"text":"تأمين النقد أثناء النقل"},{"text":"تأمين جميع أخطار المقاولين"},{"text":"تأمين جميع أخطار التركيب"},{"text":"تأمين معدات وآليات المقاولين"},{"text":"حماية المعدات الإلكترونية"},{"text":"البطاقة البرتقالية"},{"text":"تأمين الزجاج"}],"heading":"تغطيات تأمينية أخرى نرتّبها"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"8c68f8a8-7637-5ecf-9f98-41e162e3f0b1","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"d86068ae-fda0-5b87-b5a5-e611df466fc7","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"2cbc8763-b974-586c-be8d-1df114d406ce","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"رتّب تأمينك بثقة.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"48a904d8-9689-50b5-9c36-e72f53bcc375","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا بما تحتاج إلى حمايته، وسيقارن فريقنا الخيارات المناسبة ويوضح الفروق بوضوح ويرتّب التغطية التي تناسب احتياجاتك."},"visible":true},{"id":"fa1662bb-2cd9-5d29-a46c-374b2bc2599e","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/quote","label":"احصل على عرض سعر فوري","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"8bd13b04-f8cf-5ae1-a3b7-ef9964098953","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"solutions","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('7810ba77-59e1-531c-81af-b23de0882fec', 'التأمين الصحي الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش', 'ar/solutions/group-health', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"التأمين الصحي الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"التأمين الصحي الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"وفّر للموظفين ومعاليهم المؤهلين تأميناً صحياً جماعياً ترتّبه تريبل إتش وفق احتياجات شركتك من المنافع الطبية."},"Description":"تأمين صحي جماعي في لبنان للموظفين والمعالين، بمنافع المستشفى والعلاج خارجه ومنافع اختيارية. تقارن تريبل إتش شركات التأمين وترتّب التغطية.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions/group-health"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', 'ed2cc62b-2e0b-46ea-b35f-fec7f8c4ea18', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"7ad78cfb-8ef6-5344-afe1-ef10687ea8a1","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"وفّر لموظفيك ومعاليهم المؤهلين تأميناً طبياً يُنظَّم وفق العاملين لديك وشبكة المستشفيات والمنافع ومستوى التغطية.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"تأمين الأعمال والموظفين","heading":"التأمين الصحي الجماعي في لبنان","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"d1a8dc5f-6724-57d7-ac39-32709df1cda0","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يوفر التأمين الصحي الجماعي تغطية طبية للموظفين ومعاليهم المؤهلين ضمن خطة واحدة للشركة. نقيّم العاملين ونتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقارن المنافع وشبكات المستشفيات والشروط، ونرتّب الخطة وفق احتياجات الشركة.","eyebrow":"التأمين الصحي الجماعي","heading":"ما هو التأمين الصحي الجماعي؟","audience":"الشركات والمؤسسات الصغيرة والمتوسطة وغيرها من أصحاب العمل الذين يرغبون في توفير منافع طبية منظمة للموظفين وإدارة تأمينهم الصحي ضمن ترتيب جماعي واحد.","buttonHref":"/ar/contact","buttonLabel":"اطلب عرض سعر","audienceHeading":"لمن تُناسب هذه التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-introduction"}},{"id":"1e0c13ab-0c0d-59f8-b414-1799f5db8a6d","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c1a22116-3e3a-5603-8a7f-134b9827590c","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"9928e09f-06b8-5a91-b25f-d7841e633289","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف يمكن تنظيم خطة التأمين الصحي الجماعي؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"eebe3b10-79d0-5bee-b688-ffacee84155b","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن ترتيب الخطة وفق حجم العاملين والأشخاص المطلوب تغطيتهم ومستوى الحماية الطبية الذي ترغب الشركة في توفيره."},"visible":true},{"id":"308993f5-4603-59a5-b724-50c436d7f9e0","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"be6539cb-7472-5403-80a3-7344565d89e1","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c5d245e7-7af2-5596-be19-4a6b19fcd196","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الموظفون","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"f82c22a7-42cd-5412-82eb-93ae6e57a71b","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية طبية للموظفين المؤهلين ضمن وثيقة واحدة للشركة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"cd408c2d-d332-5f34-a418-ae1225c281ce","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"a16bdc02-5a41-5aa5-a88b-8b8642559ae9","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الموظفون والمعالون","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"2d3e4ae9-7562-5801-b3a5-a97b00fd38ac","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن أن تشمل التغطية أيضاً الأزواج والأطفال المؤهلين، بحسب متطلبات الشركة وشروط شركة التأمين."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"f0abbd00-3521-5a1f-9fdf-ebef5997944a","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"83f28cf4-d74b-52c5-a9bc-c7313f00f43f","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"فئات مختلفة من الموظفين","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"9a5ba4e3-b25d-509c-a1a4-0fe2acab2054","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن ترتيب مستويات منافع أو درجات استشفاء مختلفة لفئات محددة من الموظفين ضمن المجموعة نفسها."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"7bd7079c-92e6-5f58-b763-814b08772cde","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1d575b1a-bda5-5953-9c14-3e249963f88f","type":"heading","content":{"text":"المنافع الأساسية والاختيارية","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"6a7899b0-38e0-5168-905f-6ec58ea443a0","type":"text","content":{"text":"يمكن للشركة الجمع بين الحماية الطبية الأساسية والمنافع الإضافية وفق ميزانيتها واحتياجات موظفيها."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"1076960e-e285-51a6-b9f8-b2a446cb449c","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"help":"نحدد المنافع التي يحتاجها العاملون ونقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونرتّب الخطة وفق شبكة المستشفيات والحدود والمنافع الاختيارية والشروط التي تهم الشركة.","intro":"يمكن أن تجمع الخطة الصحية الجماعية بين الحماية الطبية الأساسية ومنافع إضافية وفق احتياجات الشركة والعاملين ومستوى التغطية المختار.","items":[{"text":"الدخول إلى المستشفى والجراحة"},{"text":"العلاج الطبي الطارئ"},{"text":"الفحوص التشخيصية والتصوير والتحاليل المخبرية"},{"text":"استشارات الأطباء وزيارات الاختصاصيين"},{"text":"الأدوية الموصوفة"},{"text":"العلاج الفيزيائي والعلاج خارج المستشفى"},{"text":"منافع الأمومة والولادة"},{"text":"العناية بالأسنان"},{"text":"العناية بالنظر والبصر"},{"text":"علاج الحالات الطبية المزمنة والمستمرة، وفق شروط الخطة"}],"heading":"ماذا يمكن أن يغطي التأمين الصحي الجماعي؟","helpHeading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"coverage-details"}},{"id":"af9fad48-78f4-59ad-8f00-196f47464e4d","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يعتمد اختيار الخطة المناسبة على أكثر من السعر. فشركة التأمين وشبكة المستشفيات والمنافع والحدود والإدارة وشروط الوثيقة تؤثر جميعها في الحماية التي يتلقاها الموظفون.","items":[{"text":"سمعة شركة التأمين وقوتها المالية وموثوقيتها"},{"text":"شبكة المستشفيات والنطاق الجغرافي للتغطية"},{"text":"خدمة شركة إدارة المطالبات الطبية وسرعة الموافقات"},{"text":"درجة الاستشفاء والحدود السنوية وحدود المنافع"},{"text":"الرعاية خارج المستشفى والأدوية الموصوفة ومنافع الأسنان والنظر"},{"text":"شروط الحالات السابقة للتأمين والأمومة والأمراض المزمنة"},{"text":"التنسيق مع الصندوق الوطني للضمان الاجتماعي وأساس التغطية الطبية"},{"text":"شروط أهلية الموظفين والمعالين"},{"text":"متطلبات الاكتتاب الطبي والانتساب"},{"text":"القسط ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات وسائر شروط الوثيقة"}],"heading":"ما الذي ينبغي مقارنته قبل اختيار خطة صحية جماعية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"5c72bc5b-603b-56f9-b59e-a3bb08ff3f6b","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"نقيّم العاملين لديك وننظّم المنافع ونقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في لبنان قبل ترتيب الخطة المختارة.","items":[{"body":"نراجع عدد الموظفين والمعالين المؤهلين وتوزيع الأعمار ومستوى الحماية الطبية الذي ترغب الشركة في توفيره.","title":"مراجعة خصائص المجموعة"},{"body":"نحدد درجة الاستشفاء والحدود الطبية ومنافع العلاج خارج المستشفى وأي حماية إضافية مطلوبة للمجموعة.","title":"تنظيم المنافع"},{"body":"نتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقارن منافعها وشبكات مستشفياتها وشروط الاكتتاب والاستثناءات والسمعة والسعر.","title":"مقارنة شركات التأمين المناسبة"},{"body":"نوضح الفروق ونتفاوض مع شركات التأمين عند الاقتضاء ونرتّب الخطة الصحية الجماعية المختارة للشركة.","title":"ترتيب الخطة"}],"layout":"grid","eyebrow":"","heading":"كيف نرتّب تأمينك الصحي الجماعي؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"steps"}},{"id":"537d137f-1404-5efe-94c5-577891c85bf0","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"عندما يحتاج موظف مؤمّن أو أحد معاليه إلى دعم لاستخدام الخطة، تواصل معنا لننسّق الترتيبات والموافقات المطلوبة.","items":[{"text":"للدخول إلى المستشفى أو الفحوص أو التصوير أو العلاج الفيزيائي أو غيرها من الخدمات التي تتطلب موافقة، ننسّق مع مقدم الرعاية الطبية وشركة إدارة المطالبات وشركة التأمين للحصول على الموافقة المسبقة المطلوبة."},{"text":"إذا نشأت مشكلة، نتولى التواصل والمتابعة نيابةً عن الشركة والعضو المؤمّن، بما يساعد على استمرار العلاج دون تأخير غير ضروري."},{"text":"لمطالبات استرداد النفقات، نرشدك إلى المستندات المطلوبة ونقدم المطالبة عند الاقتضاء ونتابعها حتى التسوية وفق شروط الوثيقة."}],"heading":"ما الذي تفعله عندما يحتاج موظف إلى علاج؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"80c6d50f-6056-526a-aa1f-2e7e4ba6e0da","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عن أسئلة شائعة حول ترتيب التأمين الطبي للموظفين وإدارته.","items":[{"answer":"نعم. نتولى إضافة الموظفين وحذفهم وترتيب تحديثات الوثيقة المطلوبة مع شركة التأمين.","question":"س1 – هل يمكن إضافة موظفين أو حذفهم خلال سنة الوثيقة؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكن تنظيم المساهمة وفق سياسة منافع الموظفين لدى الشركة والترتيب الجماعي المختار.","question":"س2 – هل يمكن للشركة دفع القسط كاملاً أو جزئياً؟"},{"answer":"يمكن ترتيب الخطة بالتنسيق مع الصندوق الوطني للضمان الاجتماعي أو على أساس آخر، بحسب الشركة والموظفين وشروط شركة التأمين. نقارن أثر كل خيار في التغطية والتكلفة.","question":"س3 – كيف يؤثر الضمان الاجتماعي في التأمين الصحي الجماعي؟"},{"answer":"تعتمد التغطية على شركة التأمين وخصائص المجموعة وشروط الوثيقة. نقارن الشروط المتاحة ونوضح القيود قبل ترتيب الخطة.","question":"س4 – هل يمكن تغطية الحالات السابقة للتأمين أو الأمراض المزمنة؟"},{"answer":"ليس دائماً. تختلف المتطلبات بحسب شركة التأمين وحجم المجموعة وخصائص الموظفين، وقد توفر بعض الترتيبات الجماعية انتساباً أو اكتتاباً مبسّطاً.","question":"س5 – هل يُطلب اكتتاب طبي لكل موظف؟"},{"answer":"نحتاج عادةً إلى عدد الموظفين والمعالين وأعمارهم والمنافع المطلوبة ودرجة الاستشفاء وتفاصيل التأمين الحالي وسجل المطالبات إن توفر.","question":"س6 – ما المعلومات المطلوبة للحصول على عرض سعر؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكننا مراجعة المنافع الحالية والشبكة والحدود والاستثناءات وشروط الاكتتاب والقسط، ثم مقارنة البدائل المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية.","question":"س7 – هل يمكنكم مراجعة خطة صحية جماعية حالية؟"},{"answer":"نعم. بحسب الخطة، يمكن ترتيب تغطية طبية للبنان فقط أو مناطق إقليمية أو العالم كله. نقارن الخيارات الجغرافية المتاحة وفق الأماكن التي يسافر إليها الموظفون ويعملون فيها.","question":"س8 – هل يمكن تغطية الموظفين أثناء السفر خارج لبنان؟"},{"answer":"نعم، بحسب البلد ومكان الموظف ومتطلبات شركة التأمين. للشركات التي لديها موظفون أو فروع في الخارج، يمكننا تنسيق ترتيبات تأمين طبي إقليمية أو دولية تناسب العاملين.","question":"س9 – هل يمكن تغطية الموظفين المقيمين خارج لبنان؟"},{"answer":"تختلف متطلبات الحد الأدنى للمجموعة بحسب شركة التأمين والخطة. نراجع حجم الشركة وخصائص الموظفين ونحدد الخيارات الجماعية المناسبة المتاحة.","question":"س10 – هل يوجد حد أدنى لعدد الموظفين في التأمين الصحي الجماعي؟"}],"heading":"الأسئلة الشائعة حول التأمين الصحي الجماعي","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"acf45418-921a-5ca6-bb22-b7859b5e3d06","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"احمِ موظفيك وممتلكاتك ومركباتك وبضائعك ومسؤولياتك وغيرها من مخاطر الأعمال بتأمين يُرتَّب وفق أنشطتك.","heading":"استكشف المزيد من تأمين الأعمال","buttonHref":"/ar/solutions/business","buttonLabel":"استكشف تأمين الأعمال"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"callout"}},{"id":"247fe9f4-022b-5f6c-9234-fcee29548cb5","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"3acbc173-cbf0-57ab-81a1-17853df68de6","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"861761ef-a5c4-5c75-be88-bc4894d8ccda","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"وفّر لموظفيك التغطية الطبية المناسبة.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"e9297231-f5a7-588c-b289-a88b986b0933","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا عن العاملين لديك والمنافع التي تريد توفيرها. سنقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونرتّب الخطة الصحية الجماعية التي تناسب شركتك."},"visible":true},{"id":"e0f91b21-71b3-595f-9dec-6d92b71125e3","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"409ae1a3-ff37-54c1-9bd6-efd5c4fdaa34","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('3ac051c4-4e36-5bd2-b193-57ca8a1b024e', 'تأمين الحياة الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش', 'ar/solutions/group-life', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"وفّر للموظفين منافع الحياة والعجز والمنافع المالية طويلة الأجل عبر تأمين حياة جماعي ترتّبه تريبل إتش وفق احتياجات شركتك."},"Description":"تأمين حياة جماعي في لبنان لمنافع حياة الموظفين والعجز والأمراض الخطيرة والمنافع طويلة الأجل. تقارن تريبل إتش شركات التأمين وترتّب الخطط المناسبة.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions/group-life"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', '7e6b60ec-5bc5-44ff-92dc-7f00610044e1', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"fb8cb482-bc63-551b-ac8c-b83992f6a222","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"وفّر للموظفين حماية الحياة ومنافع مالية طويلة الأجل، بتغطية تُنظَّم وفق العاملين لديك والمنافع التي تريد شركتك توفيرها.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"تأمين الأعمال والموظفين","heading":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي في لبنان","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"177f5ee8-ecad-5a7e-b359-688cb98b3a18","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يوفر تأمين الحياة الجماعي حماية مالية للموظفين والمستفيدين من خلال منافع الحياة والعجز وغيرها من المنافع المختارة. وقد يشمل أيضاً الادخار أو التقاعد أو منافع مالية أخرى طويلة الأجل بحسب الخطة. نقيّم العاملين ونقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونرتّب المنافع وفق احتياجات الشركة.","eyebrow":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي","heading":"ما هو تأمين الحياة الجماعي؟","audience":"الشركات والمؤسسات الصغيرة والمتوسطة وغيرها من أصحاب العمل الذين يريدون توفير حماية الحياة والعجز للموظفين ضمن حزمة منافعهم.","buttonHref":"/ar/contact","buttonLabel":"اطلب عرض سعر","audienceHeading":"لمن تُناسب هذه التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-introduction"}},{"id":"3e15bdf0-2dae-54c5-83ab-9d573b2e9244","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"63716f94-819a-5c9e-9452-edaca96b4071","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f4a0a72c-9fc0-52b7-8f01-ef12e4509595","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف يمكن تنظيم منافع الحياة للموظفين؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"26735312-f94e-5242-8121-35eeaf11f661","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن للشركة الجمع بين الحماية والمنافع المالية طويلة الأجل وفق العاملين لديها وأهدافها وميزانيتها."},"visible":true},{"id":"ad64bab4-683e-5d65-b132-98e733b86fbd","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"232a11c3-3cb7-5f03-a71d-ae2c68ac7735","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"ddb0f8e0-a760-5aeb-950b-d85f65a9b152","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"حماية الحياة والعجز","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"370d670a-0bb6-563c-b98c-a888bfe7a1ca","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"حماية مالية للموظفين والمستفيدين في حالات الوفاة أو العجز أو غيرها من الأحداث المغطاة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"34f70b84-656c-527f-879d-21fa50b3dc33","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"919bbfd8-4f19-5280-82ba-ef0f00d2c38d","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الادخار والاستثمار","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"f4a9f17e-0ef0-51ed-afe4-e8a23725f12f","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن ترتيب منافع ادخار أو استثمار طويلة الأجل لمساعدة الموظفين على بناء قيمة مالية مع الحفاظ على حماية الحياة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"9af6b362-f33c-5829-8d40-deb2ccf4122f","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"7de124ba-6796-5c5c-b343-bab433105f08","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"التقاعد والمعاشات","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"a3f55de0-8110-580e-a9a4-d1d8b0ec4732","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن أن تساعد منافع التقاعد المنظمة الموظفين على تكوين أموال للمراحل اللاحقة من الحياة، مع تعزيز حزمة منافع الموظفين لدى الشركة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"eccb8cb2-5e27-5172-97be-fe888e0ea96c","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"452329be-a1dc-5f56-809f-38f39aeda8bf","type":"heading","content":{"text":"حماية التعليم","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"c7431952-8ce7-5ebc-9629-ccc407dc9691","type":"text","content":{"text":"يمكن أن تساعد المنافع المخصصة للتعليم على تكوين أموال لتكاليف المدرسة أو الجامعة، مع حماية إضافية متاحة عند الوفاة أو العجز أو المرض الخطير."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"216872af-c8f6-5fa9-91a9-477b3c5c572f","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"53ed8d5b-71df-56a5-98d3-9bfaa2660136","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"cf79b690-31ac-5025-ba84-212efc695db1","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحياة الجماعي وخطط الحماية المالية","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"10b31962-00e9-5a72-bba4-fca0c455e2d3","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"اختر من حلول الحماية والادخار والتخطيط طويل الأجل المصممة للاحتياجات المالية المختلفة لموظفيك ومراحل حياتهم."},"visible":true},{"id":"0e8d0e90-c004-5378-a572-e6f5b67e91bd","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"a1878811-b694-5fd8-bc65-93fea56962d9","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"e15fb6a1-cc01-55ea-985f-212f6bbedfea","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحوادث الشخصية","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"fa181561-c908-5d21-b4a3-5fddafb8ca71","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر تعويضاً مالياً بعد حادث، يشمل منافع الوفاة العرضية والعجز الدائم الكلي أو الجزئي ودعم الدخل الأسبوعي خلال العجز المؤقت الكلي، مع منافع أخرى متاحة بحسب الخطة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"a0d9bef1-ab52-5226-aa8c-336cd8180339","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"9082cb3b-34ff-5a30-bbb0-60eaffe29208","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الأمراض الخطيرة","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"f80c2e57-768c-5d61-83f8-b23ff6eb3093","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر تعويضاً مالياً عند تشخيص مرض خطير مغطى، للمساعدة على تغطية فقدان الدخل والنفقات غير المتوقعة خلال العلاج والتعافي، وفق منافع الخطة المختارة وشروطها."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"85fc631d-39ce-569d-bc80-1f630238d4a5","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"5b02b06d-bdce-5394-8217-2e5dc41fbfa8","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحياة مع استرداد الأقساط","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"b9974536-43a5-59e1-a2f6-f135f5826eb6","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر حماية الحياة خلال مدة الوثيقة ومنافع مالية في حالة الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي، مع إمكانية استرداد الأقساط المدفوعة عند الاستحقاق إذا بقي المؤمّن له حياً حتى نهاية المدة، وفق الخطة المختارة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"b0a6715d-1db6-585f-bf6d-8b6c6bf0d5b4","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"91b10210-aa8c-5cd6-b8c0-80eda5f5e1fb","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطة التعليم","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"974edde0-2923-5235-b4b0-09e1108a3d25","type":"text","content":{"text":"تكوّن أموالاً لتعليم أبناء موظفيك مستقبلاً من خلال الادخار والاستثمار طويل الأجل، مع خصائص حماية قد تساعد على استمرار الخطة إذا أصابت الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي أو مرض خطير مغطى الشخص الذي يمولها، وهو عادةً أحد الوالدين."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"3f899fa5-c615-57e9-bbc5-3d7ee5013607","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"922cfabb-d750-56cd-9689-04e198c4c6b1","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطة التقاعد","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"fe571b42-55b8-5745-9975-c4b66a5987ac","type":"text","content":{"text":"تكوّن أموالاً مخصصة للتقاعد عبر مساهمات طويلة الأجل، مع خيار الحصول على القيمة المتراكمة كرأسمال أو دخل تقاعدي، بينما قد تساعد منافع الحماية على استمرار الخطة عند الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"35d39830-4f94-58eb-8a7b-115d3d46dbca","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1b8b82a0-077e-5ffd-8b19-9b6b0938984e","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطط الاستثمار","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"469df4ef-b932-5a5c-95f2-76525f26c0db","type":"text","content":{"text":"تتيح لموظفيك الوصول طويل الأجل إلى صناديق استثمار عالمية مختارة عبر خطة تأمينية لبناء المدخرات وتنويعها وفق أهدافهم ومستوى المخاطر المناسب لهم. قد ترتفع قيم الاستثمارات أو تنخفض بحسب أداء الصناديق."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"b04bb217-95fd-580b-9727-bab78c52b54c","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"help":"ننظّم المنافع ومبالغ التأمين وفق العاملين لدى الشركة وأهدافها، ثم نقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية من حيث التغطية والتعريفات والحدود والاستثناءات والاكتتاب والسعر قبل ترتيب الخطة المختارة.","intro":"يمكن لتأمين الحياة الجماعي حماية الموظفين وعائلاتهم من الأثر المالي للوفاة والعجز والمرض الخطير. وبحسب الخطة، قد تحمي المنافع الإضافية أيضاً التزامات الادخار أو التقاعد أو التعليم المستمرة.","items":[{"text":"الوفاة لأسباب طبيعية أو عرضية"},{"text":"منفعة إضافية للوفاة العرضية"},{"text":"العجز الدائم الكلي"},{"text":"العجز الدائم الجزئي"},{"text":"منفعة بمبلغ مقطوع للمرض الخطير"},{"text":"منفعة المرض في مرحلته النهائية"},{"text":"الإعفاء من الأقساط المستقبلية بعد أحداث معينة مغطاة"},{"text":"استمرار مساهمات الادخار أو التقاعد أو التعليم المخطط لها بعد أحداث معينة مغطاة"},{"text":"منافع التعليم أو الدراسة بعد الوفاة أو العجز أو المرض الخطير"},{"text":"منافع حياة وعجز أخرى متاحة ضمن الخطة المختارة"}],"heading":"ماذا يمكن أن يغطي تأمين الحياة الجماعي؟","helpHeading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"coverage-details"}},{"id":"5ca59834-2f86-5263-9e14-bfa9b911fd8e","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تعتمد الخطة المناسبة على الحماية المقدمة وكيفية احتساب المنافع وخصائص الادخار أو الاستثمار أو التقاعد المشمولة.","items":[{"text":"سمعة شركة التأمين وقوتها المالية وموثوقيتها"},{"text":"منافع ثابتة ومضاعفات الراتب ومستويات المنافع بحسب فئة الموظفين"},{"text":"تعريفات الوفاة والعجز والأمراض الخطيرة وحدودها"},{"text":"أهلية الموظفين وحدود العمر ومتطلبات الاكتتاب"},{"text":"التغطية العالمية والشروط الجغرافية"},{"text":"منافع الادخار والاستثمار والاستحقاق"},{"text":"منافع التقاعد وهيكل المساهمات"},{"text":"خيارات الاستثمار والرسوم وما إذا كانت العوائد مضمونة أو مرتبطة بالسوق"},{"text":"التعليم وغيرها من منافع الموظفين الإضافية"},{"text":"مستويات الأقساط وكيف قد ترتفع المساهمات بمرور الوقت"},{"text":"الاستثناءات وسائر شروط الوثيقة وأحكامها"}],"heading":"ما الذي ينبغي مقارنته قبل اختيار خطة حياة جماعية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"3d2c5afa-7118-573d-a4ea-eeb0975e1e7d","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"نحدد الحماية والمنافع طويلة الأجل التي تريد شركتك توفيرها، ونقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في لبنان، ونرتّب الخطة المختارة.","items":[{"body":"نراجع عدد الموظفين وتوزيع الأعمار وفئات الموظفين والمنافع التي تريد الشركة توفيرها.","title":"مراجعة خصائص المجموعة"},{"body":"نحدد منافع الحياة والعجز والأمراض الخطيرة وأي منافع ادخار أو تقاعد أو تعليم مطلوبة للمجموعة.","title":"تنظيم المنافع"},{"body":"نتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقارن التغطية وهياكل المنافع والاكتتاب والاستثناءات وشروط الاستثمار والسعر.","title":"مقارنة شركات التأمين المناسبة"},{"body":"نوضح الفروق ونتفاوض مع شركات التأمين عند الاقتضاء ونرتّب خطة الحياة الجماعية المختارة للشركة.","title":"ترتيب الخطة"}],"layout":"grid","eyebrow":"","heading":"كيف نرتّب تأمين الحياة الجماعي؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"steps"}},{"id":"b906e0cf-1ade-5c96-8b13-75d3e1f474be","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تواصل معنا بأسرع وقت ممكن. ننسّق المطالبة والمستندات المطلوبة والتواصل مع شركة التأمين نيابةً عن الشركة أو الموظف أو المستفيد.","items":[{"text":"لمطالبات الوفاة أو العجز أو المرض الخطير، نوضح المستندات المطلوبة ونساعد على إعداد المعلومات الطبية والوظيفية والداعمة التي تحتاجها شركة التأمين."},{"text":"نقدم المطالبة ونتابعها ونتولى استفسارات شركة التأمين ونعمل على تحصيل المنفعة المغطاة المستحقة بموجب الوثيقة."},{"text":"نبقى مشاركين حتى انتهاء المطالبة ونُطلع الشركة والمستفيد على المستجدات طوال الإجراءات."}],"heading":"ما الذي تفعله عند حدوث مطالبة حياة أو عجز؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"6404d3b5-acfc-5fa3-8b1e-29271fe651d2","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عن أسئلة شائعة بشأن ترتيب منافع الحياة والعجز والمنافع طويلة الأجل للموظفين وإدارتها.","items":[{"answer":"نعم. نرتّب إضافة الموظفين وحذفهم ونحدّث الخطة مع شركة التأمين مع تغير العاملين.","question":"س1 – هل يمكن إضافة موظفين أو حذفهم خلال سنة الوثيقة؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكن تنظيم المنافع بحسب فئة الموظف أو منصبه أو مستوى راتبه أو أساس آخر متفق عليه.","question":"س2 – هل يمكن أن تختلف مستويات المنافع بين فئات الموظفين؟"},{"answer":"يمكن أن يكون مبلغ التأمين منفعة ثابتة أو مضاعفاً للراتب أو هيكلاً آخر تتفق عليه الشركة وشركة التأمين.","question":"س3 – كيف تُحسب منفعة تأمين الحياة؟"},{"answer":"قبل إصدار الوثيقة، يعيّن كل موظف مؤمّن مستفيداً واحداً أو أكثر. عند حدوث وفاة مغطاة، تُدفع المنفعة للمستفيد أو المستفيدين المحددين وفق شروط الوثيقة.","question":"س4 – من يتلقى منفعة تأمين الحياة؟"},{"answer":"ليس دائماً. تعتمد متطلبات الاكتتاب على شركة التأمين وحجم المجموعة ومبلغ المنفعة وخصائص الموظفين وهيكل الخطة.","question":"س5 – هل يُطلب اكتتاب طبي لكل موظف؟"},{"answer":"نعم، بحسب البلدان المعنية وشروط شركة التأمين. نقارن التغطية الجغرافية والدولية المتاحة للمجموعة.","question":"س6 – هل يمكن تغطية الموظفين الذين يعملون أو يسافرون خارج لبنان؟"},{"answer":"نعم. بحسب الخطة، يمكن للشركة ترتيب منافع ادخار أو استثمار أو تقاعد إلى جانب حماية الحياة والعجز.","question":"س7 – هل يمكن إدراج منافع الادخار أو التقاعد؟"},{"answer":"بحسب الخطة، قد تشمل المنافع عناصر مضمونة أو عوائد مرتبطة بالسوق أو مزيجاً منهما. نوضح هيكل الاستثمار والرسوم والقيم المتوقعة والضمانات قبل ترتيب الخطة.","question":"س8 – كيف تعمل عوائد الاستثمار؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكننا مراجعة المنافع الحالية ومبالغ التأمين والاكتتاب والاستثناءات وخصائص الاستثمار والتكلفة، ثم مقارنة البدائل المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية.","question":"س9 – هل يمكنكم مراجعة خطة حياة جماعية حالية؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكن إضافة تغطية مخاطر الحرب دون مشاركة فعلية كمنفعة إضافية حيث تتاح، لحماية حالات وفاة أو عجز محددة مرتبطة بالحرب، وفق شركة التأمين وشروط الوثيقة.","question":"س10 – هل يمكن إضافة حماية من مخاطر الحرب؟"},{"answer":"نعم، بحسب البلد ومكان الموظف ومتطلبات شركة التأمين. يمكننا تنسيق ترتيبات جماعية إقليمية أو دولية للشركات التي لديها موظفون أو أنشطة خارج لبنان.","question":"س11 – هل يمكن تغطية الموظفين المقيمين خارج لبنان؟"}],"eyebrow":"","heading":"الأسئلة الشائعة حول تأمين الحياة الجماعي","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"56bf411d-20ef-50b3-b01d-53f300314a20","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"احمِ موظفيك وممتلكاتك ومركباتك وبضائعك ومسؤولياتك وغيرها من مخاطر الأعمال بتأمين يُرتَّب وفق أنشطتك.","heading":"استكشف المزيد من تأمين الأعمال","buttonHref":"/ar/solutions/business","buttonLabel":"استكشف تأمين الأعمال"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"callout"}},{"id":"bc55110b-f03e-515a-a55f-165c8b781183","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"5df5ef2e-5bfd-5392-bf19-5b8e557bbb50","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"393b2be6-356d-5ca5-a23c-1b93edd4b3f8","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ابنِ حماية مالية أقوى لموظفيك.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"0117ea7b-28a1-5305-a928-ad8fc890e954","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا عن العاملين لديك والمنافع التي تريد توفيرها. سنقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونرتّب خطة الحياة الجماعية التي تناسب شركتك."},"visible":true},{"id":"743a0ff7-b8d1-58f3-b94c-eb71dfab38bf","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"a1e85bd7-9263-571c-b75c-dcf6b0066403","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('a2b2f69d-488d-55d9-8130-3950d5695291', 'التأمين البحري | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/solutions/marine-insurance', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"التأمين البحري في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"التأمين البحري في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"احمِ يختك أو قاربك أو سفينتك التجارية بتأمين بحري ترتّبه تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين في لبنان."},"Description":"تأمين بحري في لبنان لليخوت والقوارب والسفن التجارية. قارن تغطية الهيكل والآلات والمسؤولية مع تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين.","CanonicalUrl":"https://www.triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions/marine-insurance"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', 'ae3fca24-d65f-40f2-b899-3d8914670a71', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"9bf278c4-c800-5bb8-849a-8204ae324a99","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"احمِ يختك أو قاربك أو سفينتك التجارية من الأضرار المادية والمسؤولية البحرية، بتغطية تُرتَّب وفق السفينة واستخدامها ومنطقة ملاحتها.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"تأمين الأعمال والموظفين","heading":"التأمين البحري","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"83e6c369-b128-5a57-8a69-c56f81b80c2b","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يمكن للتأمين البحري حماية اليخوت والقوارب والسفن التجارية من الأضرار المادية للهيكل والآلات، إلى جانب المسؤوليات البحرية الناشئة عن ملكيتها أو تشغيلها. تقارن تريبل إتش شركات التأمين المناسبة وترتّب التغطية وفق السفينة وقيمتها واستخدامها ومنطقة ملاحتها.","eyebrow":"التأمين البحري","heading":"ما هو التأمين البحري؟","audience":"مالكو السفن ومشغلوها ومالكو اليخوت وقوارب النزهة وسفن الصيد والشركات التي تواجه مخاطر مسؤولية بحرية.","buttonHref":"/ar/contact","buttonLabel":"اطلب عرض سعر","audienceHeading":"لمن تُناسب هذه التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-introduction"}},{"id":"4323516a-1ea8-55c7-875f-38ca4a607544","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"0802bebf-e5a2-53a4-ba1c-d77ab8f64e22","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"4202c6a2-b8fe-5f2f-9ad3-117c887ee0bb","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"كيف يمكن تنظيم التغطية البحرية؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"6f504938-0da0-5140-b68d-0ef30334f2a8","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن ترتيب التغطية البحرية وفق السفينة نفسها والمسؤوليات المطلوب الحماية منها ومكان تشغيلها وكيفيته وأي توسعات إضافية مطلوبة."},"visible":true},{"id":"06d8d310-9f1d-5f14-ac67-407b513753b9","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1f90789b-52a1-51dc-9c07-dc9c474a7405","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"8550ca24-0794-5fe0-920d-d6a7f45ab110","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية الهيكل والآلات","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"ea4b7d29-ad3e-5743-bf62-ce26895f44dd","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن أن تحمي التغطية هيكل السفينة وآلاتها ومعداتها المؤمّنة من الفقد أو الضرر المادي العرضي، وفق شروط الوثيقة ومستوى الحماية المختار."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"2963bb95-1e55-52c4-8544-131b25595dfb","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f58ba2c0-1e75-5cec-8baf-dbe71224c08f","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تغطية المسؤولية البحرية","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"73726c38-3dcc-5c9a-986d-68ec7d29100d","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن ترتيب حماية المسؤولية للمطالبات التي تشمل أطرافاً ثالثة أو ركاباً أو سفناً أخرى، بحدود ونطاق يُختاران وفق السفينة واستخدامها."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"b6e73946-bb0c-54d8-b653-1d6324356632","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"535d43af-a00b-559f-a433-7f1c0471db4f","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"الملاحة واستخدام السفينة","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"62b46d32-e83a-5a7e-b98c-ead09090b173","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يمكن تنظيم الوثيقة وفق الاستخدام المصرّح به للسفينة ومنطقة الملاحة المتفق عليها، سواء استُخدمت لأغراض خاصة أو تجارية أو للصيد أو لغرض آخر مؤمّن."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"6d34e8fa-9c99-5c48-af7c-dd549951ecf7","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"952ea796-4d83-5709-abbf-3ce47eb78683","type":"heading","content":{"text":"توسعات إضافية","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"cb0783b2-4c1a-59aa-a07d-622d16377675","type":"text","content":{"text":"قد تُضاف حماية لمخاطر مثل الأمتعة الشخصية أو الحرب والإضرابات أو غيرها من المخاطر البحرية عند توافرها والحاجة إليها."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"189ab793-d36c-5233-bc83-4f5d7ccc18cd","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"help":"نقارن شركات التأمين في لبنان والقيم المؤمّنة وحدود المسؤولية وشروط الملاحة ومبالغ التحمل والاستثناءات، ونرتّب تغطية مناسبة لسفينتك، ونتولى المطالبات من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية.","intro":"بحسب السفينة والوثيقة المختارة، يمكن أن يغطي التأمين البحري الفقد أو الضرر المادي للسفينة والخسارة الكلية والمسؤوليات البحرية وتكاليف إضافية معينة ناشئة عن حادث مؤمّن.","items":[{"text":"الهيكل والآلات"},{"text":"الخسارة الكلية الفعلية أو الحكمية"},{"text":"مسؤولية التصادم"},{"text":"المسؤولية تجاه الغير"},{"text":"المسؤولية تجاه الركاب، حيث تشملها التغطية"},{"text":"نفقات الإنقاذ والخسارة البحرية المشتركة"},{"text":"الأمتعة الشخصية والمعدات على متن السفينة، حيث تشملها التغطية"}],"heading":"ماذا يمكن أن يغطي التأمين البحري؟","helpHeading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"coverage-details"}},{"id":"a06d2dcf-7a36-5275-8a41-5c32adf85b83","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تعتمد الوثيقة المناسبة على أكثر من القسط. فالقيم المؤمّنة ومبالغ التحمل وحدود المسؤولية وشروط الملاحة واستخدام السفينة والاستثناءات يمكن أن تحدث فرقاً كبيراً في الحماية المقدمة.","items":[{"text":"سمعة شركة التأمين وشروط تسوية المطالبات البحرية"},{"text":"تغطية الهيكل والآلات وأساس القيمة المؤمّنة"},{"text":"مبالغ التحمل المطبّقة على كل خسارة"},{"text":"شروط تسوية الضرر الجزئي والخسارة الكلية"},{"text":"حدود المسؤولية تجاه الغير والركاب"},{"text":"حدود الملاحة والتوسعات الجغرافية المتاحة"},{"text":"الاستخدام المسموح للسفينة وشروط التشغيل"},{"text":"شروط الرسو والتخزين والتوقف عن التشغيل"},{"text":"نفقات الإنقاذ والخسارة البحرية المشتركة والتكاليف المؤمّنة ذات الصلة"},{"text":"شروط الحرب والإضرابات والقرصنة وغيرها من المخاطر الخاصة"},{"text":"شروط الوثيقة وأحكامها واستثناءاتها"}],"heading":"ما الذي ينبغي مقارنته قبل اختيار التأمين البحري؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"a24ecbf5-00dd-5388-b251-93b5b88a6b7c","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"نراجع سفينتك واستخدامها ونقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية وشروط الوثائق، ثم نرتّب التغطية المختارة ونحافظ عليها مع تغير احتياجاتك.","items":[{"body":"نراجع نوع السفينة وقيمتها ومعداتها واستخدامها المقصود ومنطقة ملاحتها وترتيبات الرسو أو التخزين المعتادة.","title":"مراجعة السفينة واستخدامها"},{"body":"نقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة في لبنان من حيث التغطية والقيم المؤمّنة وحدود المسؤولية ومبالغ التحمل وشروط الملاحة والاستثناءات والقسط.","title":"مقارنة شركات التأمين المناسبة"},{"body":"نرتّب إصدار الوثيقة المختارة ونؤكد السفينة المؤمّنة والشروط المتفق عليها ونتحقق من أن مستندات الوثيقة وجداولها تعكس التغطية المرتبة.","title":"ترتيب التغطية المختارة"},{"body":"نتولى المطالبات والتعديلات ذات الصلة والتجديدات عند تغير السفينة أو قيمتها أو استخدامها أو منطقة ملاحتها أو غيرها من التفاصيل المؤمّنة.","title":"إبقاء تغطيتك محدّثة"}],"layout":"grid","heading":"كيف نرتّب التأمين البحري؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"steps"}},{"id":"3e27d386-4345-58a3-a743-7400eeb5dccf","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تواصل مع تريبل إتش بأسرع وقت بعد اتخاذ الخطوات اللازمة لحماية الأشخاص ومنع المزيد من الضرر. نتولى المطالبة من الإبلاغ مروراً بالتقييم وصولاً إلى التسوية ونتعامل مع شركة التأمين نيابةً عنك.","items":[{"text":"نُبلغ شركة التأمين ونؤكد المستندات المطلوبة ونساعدك على تقديم تفاصيل الحادث والصور والتقارير وتقديرات الإصلاح وغيرها من المعلومات الداعمة."},{"text":"ننسّق مع شركة التأمين وخبير المعاينة والأطراف ذات الصلة ونتابع تقييم الضرر أو المسؤولية ونواصل إجراءات المطالبة أثناء تقييم الخسارة."},{"text":"نراجع التسوية التي تقترحها شركة التأمين وفق شروط الوثيقة ونتابع المطالبة خلال التسوية، ونثير أي نقاط تحتاج إلى توضيح أو مراجعة إضافية."}],"heading":"ما الذي تفعله عند تضرر سفينتك أو تعرضها لحادث؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"0ef2dbfc-b58d-5f62-8004-9abd326c6108","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عملية عن تغطية السفن وحدود الملاحة والقيم المؤمّنة والمسؤوليات البحرية وتوسعات الوثيقة والمطالبات والمعلومات اللازمة لترتيب التأمين البحري.","items":[{"answer":"يغطي التأمين البحري السفينة نفسها والمسؤوليات البحرية المرتبطة بها. أما تأمين البضائع فيغطي السلع المنقولة بحراً أو جواً أو براً ويُرتَّب بشكل منفصل.","question":"س1 – ما الفرق بين التأمين البحري وتأمين البضائع؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكن ترتيب تغطية بحرية لليخوت وقوارب النزهة تشمل السفينة والآلات والمعدات، مع المسؤولية وغيرها من الحماية بحسب الوثيقة المختارة.","question":"س2 – هل يمكن تأمين اليخوت وقوارب النزهة؟"},{"answer":"تحدد حدود الملاحة المنطقة الجغرافية التي يُسمح للسفينة بالعمل فيها وهي مؤمّنة. إذا أردت الإبحار خارج المنطقة المتفق عليها، تواصل مع تريبل إتش مسبقاً لتأكيد التوسعة المطلوبة أو ترتيبها.","question":"س3 – ما هي حدود الملاحة؟"},{"answer":"يُتفق على القيمة المؤمّنة عند ترتيب الوثيقة باستخدام تفاصيل السفينة ومعلومات التقييم الداعمة التي تطلبها شركة التأمين. من المهم أن تعكس القيمة المصرّح بها السفينة المؤمّنة بصورة صحيحة.","question":"س4 – كيف تُؤمَّن قيمة السفينة؟"},{"answer":"يمكن ذلك. بحسب الوثيقة، قد تشمل تغطية المسؤولية مطالبات تخص أطرافاً ثالثة أو ركاباً أو سفناً أخرى، وفق الحدود والشروط المتفق عليها.","question":"س5 – هل يشمل التأمين البحري المسؤولية تجاه الغير؟"},{"answer":"ليس بالضرورة. قد تخضع هذه المخاطر لشروط أو استثناءات أو توسعات منفصلة، لذا ينبغي التحقق منها تحديداً عند ترتيب الوثيقة.","question":"س6 – هل تشمل التغطية تلقائياً الحرب أو الإضرابات أو القرصنة؟"},{"answer":"تواصل مع تريبل إتش قبل أي تغير جوهري في استخدام السفينة أو منطقة ملاحتها أو ملكيتها أو غيرها من التفاصيل المؤمّنة لنتأكد مما إذا كان تعديل الوثيقة مطلوباً.","question":"س7 – ماذا لو غيّرنا كيفية استخدام السفينة أو مكانه؟"},{"answer":"قد تُطلب معاينة بحسب عمر السفينة ونوعها وقيمتها وحالتها ومتطلبات الاكتتاب لدى شركة التأمين. نؤكد المتطلبات قبل إصدار الوثيقة.","question":"س8 – هل ستطلب شركة التأمين معاينة السفينة؟"},{"answer":"قد يعتمد القسط على نوع السفينة وعمرها وقيمتها واستخدامها ومنطقة ملاحتها وحدود المسؤولية ومبالغ التحمل والتوسعات المختارة وتقييم شركة التأمين للخطر.","question":"س9 – ما الذي يؤثر في تكلفة التأمين البحري؟"},{"answer":"اتخذ الخطوات اللازمة لحماية الأشخاص ومنع المزيد من الخسارة، ووثّق الحادث إن أمكن، وتواصل مع تريبل إتش سريعاً. نُبلغ شركة التأمين وندير المطالبة خلال التقييم والتسوية.","question":"س10 – ماذا نفعل إذا تضررت السفينة أو تعرضت لحادث؟"},{"answer":"بحسب الحادث، قد تطلب شركة التأمين صوراً وتقارير عن الحادث أو من السلطات ومستندات السفينة وتقديرات الإصلاح والفواتير وتقارير المعاينة وغيرها من الأدلة الداعمة. نؤكد المستندات المطلوبة وننسّقها.","question":"س11 – ما المستندات التي قد تُطلب لمطالبة بحرية؟"},{"answer":"نحتاج عادةً إلى نوع السفينة وعمرها وقيمتها ومواصفاتها واستخدامها المقصود ومنطقة ملاحتها وترتيبات الرسو أو التخزين وسجل المطالبات وحدود المسؤولية المطلوبة وأي تغطية إضافية تريد دراستها.","question":"س12 – ما المعلومات المطلوبة للحصول على عرض تأمين بحري؟"}],"heading":"الأسئلة الشائعة حول التأمين البحري","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"314f264a-8b40-5580-86cd-c4df46fe9278","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"استكشف تغطيات أخرى لحماية ممتلكاتك وموظفيك ونطاق أعمالك الأوسع إلى جانب التأمين البحري.","heading":"تأمينات أخرى للأعمال","buttonHref":"/ar/solutions/business","buttonLabel":"استكشف تأمين الأعمال"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"callout"}},{"id":"5a4a66a1-325f-57cf-b206-ac47df0dee90","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"fa411551-ebde-5814-8ddb-82ae753d72a7","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"db165677-5258-558b-aa77-35a918e43961","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"احصل على عرض تأمين بحري","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"2bdd64dd-c86f-586a-ad1c-4ff16adc8d16","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أرسل لنا تفاصيل سفينتك وقيمتها المؤمّنة واستخدامها المقصود ومنطقة ملاحتها. ستقارن تريبل إتش شركات التأمين المناسبة في لبنان وتقدم خيارات مكتوبة وواضحة لسفينتك."},"visible":true},{"id":"ab07e818-c378-52fd-927b-80462152045a","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"a9745b73-ea79-5fe5-9b31-1b284e05caae","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('75e47587-839e-52bd-afa9-967556d6d26f', 'الدعم الدولي | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/international-insurance-support', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"دعم التأمين الدولي | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"دعم التأمين الدولي | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":null,"Description":"دعم تأميني دولي وعالمي في لبنان والخليج والأسواق الدولية الأوسع."},"Description":"رتّب تغطية تأمينية دولية وعالمية مع تريبل إتش في لبنان والخليج والأسواق الدولية الأوسع للاحتياجات الشخصية والتجارية.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/international-insurance-support"}', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', false, false, 'ar', '47b124b2-7fc8-4f42-95fc-51fbe27fd09d', 'builder', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"b6644b44-6ead-5e7c-ad88-c6ef5019f83f","type":"section","styles":{"preset":"cinematic-tall"},"content":{"intro":"تتيح شركة تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين للأفراد والعائلات والشركات نقطة تواصل واحدة لاحتياجات التأمين في لبنان والخليج والأسواق الدولية، للمساعدة على تنسيق تغطية مناسبة أينما امتدت احتياجاتهم.","items":[{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اتصل بنا","variant":"inverse"}],"eyebrow":"الدعم الدولي","heading":"دعم تأميني خارج لبنان","imageAlt":"","mobileImageUrl":"/uploads/20260927161718-3824cbcdceb1418ea88bf03e87d7054f.webp","desktopImageUrl":"/uploads/20260927161429-ddf2bca2f03c4da499884358b5dbd934.webp"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"2b00ac7a-3107-5bd8-810e-b4ffad33560d","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م. شركة مرخّصة في لبنان. صُمم دعمنا الدولي للأفراد والعائلات والشركات التي تتجاوز احتياجاتها التأمينية بلداً أو سوقاً واحداً.","items":[{"text":"يشمل ذلك عملاء في لبنان يبحثون عن تغطية دولية أو عالمية، وعملاء لديهم أصول أو موظفون أو أنشطة في الخارج، وعملاء يبحثون عن تأمين لمخاطر تقع بالكامل خارج لبنان."},{"text":"يمتد دعمنا إلى دول مجلس التعاون الخليجي، ومنها الإمارات وقطر والسعودية والكويت والبحرين وعُمان، وإلى الشرق الأوسط وأوروبا وأفريقيا وغيرها من الأسواق الدولية. يعتمد الترتيب المناسب على البلد ونوع الخطر والنطاق الجغرافي المطلوب وشروط شركات التأمين المتاحة."}],"heading":"كيف تدعم تريبل إتش احتياجات التأمين الدولي؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"editorial-story"}},{"id":"a60ba25d-a62e-5d07-9677-d1fab1e555b4","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"6a4d80f7-381f-5e7a-af31-0ce54de5da28","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"91783078-57c8-5143-ab46-f7c2cc19bfc6","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ما الذي يهم عندما يعبر التأمين الحدود؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"16078bd4-f1f3-5edb-be37-7b71ef0dd447","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يتطلب التأمين الدولي والتغطية العالمية أكثر من اختيار بلد أو منطقة تغطية. يجب أن تعكس الوثيقة مكان وجود الخطر والأماكن التي تُطلب فيها الحماية وكيفية استجابة شركة التأمين عبر المناطق المعنية."},"visible":true},{"id":"383510e0-ccab-5acb-b0f4-9fb75bbbfdcd","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"3bb89597-7562-54a8-ad41-4279333920d2","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"c6c501f2-c4d4-5048-99d6-d61db34dfdd6","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"النطاق الجغرافي","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"5dbc09ef-09d0-5f4f-9fad-545d9b7fd34b","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"نرتّب تغطية بنطاق جغرافي يشمل البلدان والمناطق التي تهمك وتهم عائلتك أو منشأتك، بما فيها الموظفون والأصول والأنشطة، لتعكس الوثيقة الأماكن التي تحتاج فيها فعلياً إلى الحماية."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"7e57bba2-39d9-5672-8dc9-9045b6b8bff5","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"56a4852a-b77d-507e-bd63-155ce77cc3a7","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"متطلبات كل بلد","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"3f94f787-2f7f-56b5-9174-d3bbdac7bb8c","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"نرتّب التأمين لتلبية متطلبات البلد الذي تُطلب فيه التغطية، مع مراعاة نوع التأمين وموقع الخطر وأي قواعد محلية مطبّقة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"1084e593-4b3e-5163-8a86-379a9fdf6810","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"afe2eb7e-4f69-594d-846f-8ddc2a16ea0f","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"شروط الوثيقة عبر المناطق","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"24111ba4-493e-5f42-adde-67cbed42c1e1","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"نتفاوض بشأن حدود الوثيقة وشروطها واستثناءاتها ونرتّبها لتناسب الحماية المطلوبة عبر البلدان والمناطق المعنية. وعند التجديد، نعيد تقييم احتياجاتك ونعدّل التغطية عند الحاجة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"519a84c4-206d-52b3-87bf-1e129caecb6a","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"a41b857f-1916-5af9-a48d-a675ac21a96f","type":"heading","content":{"text":"المطالبات والخدمة في الخارج","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"24d46f15-da91-5c01-ba9b-89f9adc98b9f","type":"text","content":{"text":"عند حدوث مطالبة في الخارج، نتولاها مع شركة التأمين نيابةً عنك وندير التواصل والمتابعة المطلوبين ونبقى مشاركين حتى تسويتها."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"927ab1d7-990b-5684-9360-7a4a930b72e3","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"استكشف حلول تأمين تدعم الاحتياجات الشخصية والعائلية والتجارية عبر الحدود.","items":[{"href":"/ar/solutions/health","title":"الصحة","summary":"","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925160942-71dafadce2b94c07b8c90a8ef32a794f.webp","linkLabel":""},{"href":"/ar/solutions/travel","title":"السفر","summary":"","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925164107-c4c19666ac8e47158fd19af72390c823.webp","linkLabel":""},{"href":"/ar/solutions/business","title":"الأعمال والمسؤولية","summary":"","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260816205841-8a0aae16892a4b3db63cec353a511883.webp","linkLabel":""},{"href":"/ar/solutions/life","title":"الحياة وحماية العائلة","summary":"","imageAlt":"","imageUrl":"/uploads/20260925162142-b76192ddfba5445ca80b6540d294e37d.webp","linkLabel":""}],"heading":"حلول تأمين للاحتياجات الدولية"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"solutions-catalog"}},{"id":"3148453d-2bd8-5255-a344-a0a9cc337263","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عملية عن أسئلة شائعة بشأن ترتيب التأمين عبر البلدان والأسواق الدولية.","items":[{"answer":"ليس دائماً. بحسب نوع التأمين والبلدان المعنية والمتطلبات المحلية، قد تغطي وثيقة واحدة عدة مناطق، بينما قد تتطلب بعض الحالات ترتيبات منفصلة. تحدد تريبل إتش الهيكل الأنسب للبلدان والمخاطر المعنية.","question":"س1 – هل أحتاج إلى وثيقة تأمين منفصلة لكل بلد؟"},{"answer":"أحياناً. نراجع النطاق الجغرافي الحالي للوثيقة وشروطها لمعرفة إمكانية توسعتها. وإذا تعذر ذلك، نرتّب تغطية إضافية أو منفصلة لتلبية الحماية الدولية المطلوبة.","question":"س2 – هل يمكن توسيع وثيقتي الحالية دولياً؟"},{"answer":"نحتاج إلى فهم البلدان المعنية ومن أو ما يحتاج إلى الحماية ونوع الخطر وموقعه والأنشطة المعنية والنطاق الجغرافي المطلوب. يتيح لنا ذلك التواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة وترتيب شروط ملائمة.","question":"س3 – ما المعلومات المطلوبة لترتيب تغطية دولية؟"},{"answer":"لا. قد تنطبق التغطية الدولية على بلدان مختارة أو منطقة محددة أو العالم كله، بحسب الحاجة التأمينية وشروط شركة التأمين. نرتّب النطاق الجغرافي ليتوافق مع الأماكن التي تُطلب فيها الحماية.","question":"س4 – هل يعني التأمين الدولي دائماً تغطية عالمية؟"},{"answer":"أبلغ تريبل إتش فور حدوث تغير. نقيّم الوضع الجديد وننسّق التعديلات المطلوبة للوثيقة مع شركة التأمين ونتحقق من أن التغطية تظل متوافقة مع الخطر المحدّث.","question":"س5 – ماذا يحدث إذا تغيرت البلدان أو الأنشطة أو الاحتياجات التأمينية خلال مدة الوثيقة؟"},{"answer":"نعم. يمكننا مراجعة وثيقتك الحالية ونطاقها الجغرافي وحدودها وشروطها واستثناءاتها، وتقديم المشورة بشأن ملاءمتها لاحتياجاتك الدولية الحالية. وعند الحاجة، نرتّب التعديلات المناسبة أو التغطية الإضافية.","question":"س6 – هل يمكن لتريبل إتش مراجعة تغطية دولية لديّ بالفعل؟"}],"heading":"التأمين الدولي: أسئلة شائعة","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"5137fc09-6921-5b86-be7b-0ad4c921864c","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"e3b41c19-5738-533a-99ba-f6c82ea1e6c9","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"dd30f307-902a-5d39-8c53-173f16447669","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ناقش احتياجاتك التأمينية الدولية.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"e043408f-cf5b-5a21-9fd7-a5980dbb5953","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا بما تحتاج إلى حمايته وأين، وسنرتّب تغطية دولية مناسبة لاحتياجاتك."},"visible":true},{"id":"36799c33-3773-5b3f-8929-432472e87b15","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اتصل بنا","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"builder","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('d532f76b-5a74-44a6-a90c-16d970df64c4', 'تأمين الحياة | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/solutions/life', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"تأمين الحياة للأفراد والعائلات في لبنان | تريبل إتش","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"تأمين الحياة للأفراد والعائلات | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين","ImageUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816201838-4fbe63135df049ca920ae57f625d6d04.webp","Description":"استكشف خطط الحياة والحوادث الشخصية والأمراض الخطيرة والتعليم والتقاعد والاستثمار المرتبة وفق احتياجاتك وأهدافك."},"Description":"قارن تأمين الحياة للأفراد والعائلات في لبنان. ترتّب تريبل إتش خطط الحماية والحوادث والأمراض الخطيرة والتعليم والتقاعد والاستثمار.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/solutions/life"}', '2026-08-19 12:29:08.13403+00', false, false, 'ar', 'ad6c6fe7-c78f-4a82-b835-38ba02079c21', 'solution-detail', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"9c2a948d-2798-5bc7-abd8-205f9f9efa96","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"يمكن لتأمين الحياة توفير حماية مالية بعد الوفاة أو العجز، بينما تدعم خطط أخرى الأمراض الخطيرة والحوادث والتعليم والتقاعد والادخار وأهداف الاستثمار طويلة الأجل. نقارن الخيارات المناسبة ونشرح المنافع والشروط بوضوح ونرتّب الخطة وفق احتياجاتك.","eyebrow":"التأمين الشخصي والعائلي","heading":"تأمين الحياة للأفراد والعائلات","audience":"الأفراد والعائلات الذين يرغبون في حماية المسؤوليات المالية واحتياجات الدخل المستقبلية والمدخرات وأهداف الاستثمار طويلة الأجل.","buttonHref":"/ar/contact","buttonLabel":"اطلب عرض سعر","audienceHeading":"لمن تُناسب هذه التغطية؟"},"visible":true,"settings":{"sectionType":"solution-introduction"}},{"id":"14aab5e2-7cee-51e0-a908-94e245cf8d78","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"29d56337-bcee-5f33-aa73-98e9214df808","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f2909923-9d33-5295-8b5e-d0a7501459f2","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحياة وخطط الحماية المالية","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"6592390d-2112-54d9-8726-4a0bb35729c0","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"اختر من حلول الحماية والادخار والتخطيط طويل الأجل المصممة لمختلف الاحتياجات المالية ومراحل الحياة."},"visible":true},{"id":"813fd4a7-0115-51b1-9019-815dde2fd33a","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"2b298296-c16d-5dea-9afe-8c1cbc1d03bf","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"599e3f40-40f9-5dee-9a97-5839f8497bbb","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927151949-bf72d0d6bb7448658b214b91615d1657.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"3c4b5b68-9b89-5be8-89fa-0a91660dda40","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحوادث الشخصية","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"f5f8c913-158c-5314-a825-c048534b2a67","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر تعويضاً مالياً بعد حادث، يشمل منافع الوفاة العرضية والعجز الدائم الكلي أو الجزئي ودعم الدخل الأسبوعي خلال العجز المؤقت الكلي، مع منافع أخرى متاحة بحسب الخطة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"88e8317a-15c1-59a3-a552-6027f145f07d","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"3e833189-c9f9-559a-a96c-e66b47135871","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927152326-322cf02db9e049758fa97fb859af5ddc.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"e016e3d2-b27d-5a3e-82ac-19edacea5562","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الأمراض الخطيرة","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"b3e5a9c1-35c9-5c88-9f48-7225144d02ac","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر تعويضاً مالياً عند تشخيص مرض خطير مغطى، للمساعدة على تغطية فقدان الدخل والنفقات غير المتوقعة خلال العلاج والتعافي، وفق منافع الخطة المختارة وشروطها."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"b30c92b3-9aac-536f-aea4-e907073dfc6b","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"3b9d85f2-9b99-53e8-ac13-6355e9fe5614","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927153543-a2cf31f6511e48b6b414c45fb2e51e65.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"3bfe12b0-2760-5f62-957c-3c7fdf8e6716","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"تأمين الحياة مع استرداد الأقساط","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"3ec4704b-efe6-54d5-97e7-dffcb41060c3","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"يوفر حماية الحياة خلال مدة الوثيقة ومنافع مالية في حالة الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي، مع إمكانية استرداد الأقساط المدفوعة عند الاستحقاق إذا بقي المؤمّن له حياً حتى نهاية المدة، وفق الخطة المختارة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"f9113cd5-78a7-5e79-951c-ca1bfeb18628","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"d7971e4a-6a29-5de9-aa88-d7891c14fd32","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927153548-3908556372584934847752ce5db4eee4.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"f78a7c69-e18b-5f14-acfe-65d03fc86ea8","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطة التعليم","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"cb8b64d8-c8f3-5438-b065-ec2f3f0e474e","type":"text","content":{"text":"تكوّن أموالاً لتعليم طفلك مستقبلاً عبر الادخار والاستثمار طويل الأجل، مع خصائص حماية قد تساعد على استمرار الخطة إذا أصابت الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي أو مرض خطير مغطى الشخص الذي يمولها، وهو عادةً أحد الوالدين."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"ff18f62e-e250-5faa-a2ec-def63cca2da4","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f802222e-a964-5841-b2d6-cc05e0e1273d","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927153552-7cbccbfc4cc649ceacbf0fb5ef0bc9e4.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"218953f4-40de-5a15-a211-4a5894fece7d","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطة التقاعد","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"d39dbf97-7dad-5093-b387-edeaa18ecf95","type":"text","content":{"text":"تكوّن أموالاً مخصصة للتقاعد عبر مساهمات طويلة الأجل، مع خيار الحصول على القيمة المتراكمة كرأسمال أو دخل تقاعدي، بينما قد تساعد منافع الحماية على استمرار الخطة عند الوفاة أو العجز الدائم الكلي."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"52c2317c-3f35-53a8-b63d-d4088557f521","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"845ef8c0-c319-5b1f-aa40-231b23bb4eb7","type":"image","styles":{"desktop":{"aspectRatio":"4 / 3"}},"content":{"alt":"","url":"/uploads/20260927154752-c77a5588c4924d8fab1ce887d8b9b0b1.webp","caption":""},"visible":true},{"id":"fae280ac-efee-5fdb-a1cd-fc11016cf6a6","type":"heading","content":{"text":"خطط الاستثمار","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"abdcfe2e-3167-51b1-a907-b8bd92789812","type":"text","content":{"text":"تتيح الوصول طويل الأجل إلى صناديق استثمار عالمية مختارة عبر خطة تأمينية لبناء المدخرات وتنويعها وفق أهدافك ومستوى المخاطر المناسب لك. قد ترتفع قيم الاستثمارات أو تنخفض بحسب أداء الصناديق."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"b05cc974-4bbf-5f58-ab1d-2a2f5b8875d1","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"help":"نقارن الخطط المناسبة والمنافع وشروط الوثائق والأقساط والمدد وخصائص الادخار وخيارات الاستثمار، ونوضح الفروق بوضوح، ونرتّب الخطة التي تناسب احتياجاتك.","intro":"يمكن لتأمين الحياة الجمع بين الحماية المالية والادخار والتخطيط طويل الأجل، بحسب الخطة المختارة وشركة التأمين.","items":[{"text":"منافع مالية للمستفيدين في حالة الوفاة"},{"text":"منافع مالية للعجز الدائم الكلي أو الجزئي"},{"text":"دعم مؤقت للدخل بعد حادث"},{"text":"منافع مالية بعد مرض خطير مغطى"},{"text":"منافع تمويل التعليم وحمايته"},{"text":"مدخرات التقاعد ومنافع الاستحقاق"},{"text":"فرص استثمار طويلة الأجل في الأسواق العالمية"},{"text":"استمرار الوثيقة مع الإعفاء من الأقساط بعد أحداث مغطاة"},{"text":"منافع مخاطر الحرب للوفاة أو العجز المرتبطين بالحرب"}],"heading":"ما الذي يشمله؟","helpHeading":"كيف تساعدك تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"settings":{"sectionType":"coverage-details"}},{"id":"ddbfe8e0-3b3f-5c08-bd81-f784aa2e5422","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"تعتمد الخطة المناسبة على مستوى الحماية الذي تحتاجه والمدة التي تريدها للخطة وكيفية عمل خصائصها المالية بمرور الوقت.","items":[{"text":"مقدار الحماية المالية"},{"text":"مدة الوثيقة وفترة دفع الأقساط"},{"text":"منافع الوفاة والعجز والأمراض الخطيرة"},{"text":"الاكتتاب الطبي والأهلية"},{"text":"شروط الاستحقاق واسترداد الأقساط وتصفية الوثيقة"},{"text":"خيارات الادخار والاستثمار"},{"text":"الرسوم وإمكانية الوصول إلى الأموال المتراكمة"},{"text":"القيم المضمونة والمرتبطة بالسوق"}],"heading":"ما الذي تقارنه؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"666b01aa-ea50-51f7-99d5-9745c06336d3","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"ندير الإجراءات من فهم احتياجاتك وأهدافك إلى مقارنة الخطط المناسبة وترتيب التغطية ودعمك طوال مدة الوثيقة.","items":[{"body":"نفهم ما تريد تحقيقه من الخطة والحماية والمدة والميزانية التي تناسبك.","title":"فهم احتياجاتك"},{"body":"نتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقارن الخطط المتاحة باحتياجاتك وأهدافك.","title":"مقارنة الخطط المناسبة"},{"body":"نوضح الفروق بوضوح ونساعدك على اختيار الخيار الأنسب لاحتياجاتك ونرتّب الخطة لك.","title":"الشرح والترتيب"},{"body":"نتولى التواصل مع شركة التأمين ونبقى مشاركين خلال تعديلات الوثيقة والتجديدات والمطالبات واستحقاق الخطة.","title":"المتابعة المستمرة"}],"layout":"grid","heading":"كيف نرتّب تأمين الحياة؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"steps"}},{"id":"25348ebe-1d58-5a1b-a0b4-0cdcdcfa3609","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"إجابات عن أسئلة شائعة حول تأمين الحياة والحماية المالية والادخار والتخطيط طويل الأجل.","items":[{"answer":"قد يختلف القسط بحسب العمر والصحة ومقدار الحماية ومدة الوثيقة والمنافع المختارة والاكتتاب. يؤثر نوع الخطة أيضاً في التكلفة، لذا نقارن الشروط إلى جانب القسط.","question":"س1 – ما الذي يؤثر في تكلفة تأمين الحياة؟"},{"answer":"يعتمد المبلغ المناسب على دخلك ومسؤولياتك المالية ومعاليك وديونك المستحقة وأهدافك المستقبلية. نقيّم ما يحتاج إلى حماية مالية ونساعدك على مقارنة مستويات تغطية مناسبة.","question":"س2 – ما مقدار تغطية الحياة الذي ينبغي اختياره؟"},{"answer":"عموماً، تُطلب معلومات صحية وشخصية أساسية فقط. وقد تُطلب معلومات طبية إضافية في حالات محددة، منها الحالات الطبية السابقة للتأمين أو مبالغ التغطية الأكبر.","question":"س3 – هل سأحتاج إلى اكتتاب طبي لتأمين الحياة؟"},{"answer":"يوفر النوعان حماية الحياة خلال مدة الوثيقة، لكن خطة استرداد الأقساط قد تعيد أيضاً الأقساط المدفوعة عند الاستحقاق إذا استوفيت شروطها. وعادةً تكون أقساطها أعلى من حماية مماثلة دون استرداد.","question":"س4 – كيف يختلف تأمين الحياة مع استرداد الأقساط عن التأمين المعتاد؟"},{"answer":"صُمم التأمين الصحي لتغطية النفقات الطبية المؤهلة، بينما يوفر تأمين الأمراض الخطيرة منفعة مالية عند تشخيص مرض خطير مغطى. وقد تساعد المنفعة في احتياجات الدخل أو النفقات الشخصية أو الالتزامات المالية الأخرى.","question":"س5 – كيف يختلف تأمين الأمراض الخطيرة عن التأمين الصحي؟"},{"answer":"قد يكون مفيداً خصوصاً عندما يعتمد دخلك على قدرتك على العمل. فإذا تسبب حادث بوفاة أو عجز دائم أو منعك مؤقتاً من العمل، قد توفر الوثيقة تعويضاً مالياً يشمل دعماً أسبوعياً للدخل بحسب التغطية المختارة. وقد يساعد ذلك على حماية دخل لا يعوضه التأمين الطبي أو الضمان الاجتماعي.","question":"س6 – لماذا ندرس تأمين الحوادث الشخصية إلى جانب تأمين الحياة؟"},{"answer":"بحسب الخطة، قد تساعد منافع الحماية على الحفاظ على الهدف المالي بتغطية الأقساط المستقبلية أو توفير منافع مالية أو مواصلة تمويل التعليم أو التقاعد بعد وفاة أو عجز مغطى.","question":"س7 – ماذا يحدث لخطة التعليم أو التقاعد عند الوفاة أو العجز؟"},{"answer":"تعتمد قيمة الاستثمار على الاستراتيجية المختارة وأداء السوق، لذا قد ترتفع أو تنخفض بمرور الوقت. وقد تتضمن الخطة أيضاً منافع تأمينية محددة، مثل حماية الحياة أو العجز، منفصلة عن قيمة الاستثمار. نوضح قبل اختيارك الأجزاء الثابتة والأجزاء التي تعتمد على أداء السوق.","question":"س8 – هل خطط الاستثمار مضمونة؟"},{"answer":"يعتمد ذلك على الخطة. قد يتاح السحب المبكر أو تصفية الوثيقة، لكن المبلغ المستلم قد يختلف عن القيمة المتراكمة ويتأثر بالتوقيت وشروط الوثيقة.","question":"س9 – هل يمكن الوصول إلى مدخراتي قبل استحقاق الخطة؟"},{"answer":"نعم، يمكن إدراج حماية مخاطر الحرب ضمن خطط معينة للوفاة أو العجز المغطيين الناتجين عن أحداث مرتبطة بالحرب. يعتمد النطاق والحدود والشروط على الخطة المختارة وشركة التأمين.","question":"س10 – هل يمكن لتأمين الحياة أن يشمل مخاطر الحرب؟"}],"heading":"الأسئلة الشائعة حول تأمين الحياة","showArrows":true,"smoothMotion":true},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"faq"}},{"id":"09661933-de99-5cb3-a0f9-788f18f3d10c","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"استكشف حلول تأمين أخرى نرتّبها للأفراد والعائلات والشركات.","heading":"حلول تأمين أخرى"},"visible":true,"settings":{"sectionType":"related-links"}},{"id":"95a687c9-f5c1-5fc6-b96a-019e00fdf6f9","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"03a00dcd-3840-56ba-8301-7155e05abd54","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"02714472-46a6-58bc-8097-2016c2e9474a","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"اعثر على خطة تأمين الحياة التي تناسب احتياجاتك وأهدافك.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"ed13de0e-9456-591a-ae21-52667c899d7e","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"احصل على عرض سعر وفق الحماية والمدة والأهداف المالية التي تهمك."},"visible":true},{"id":"6a33a271-4405-5034-a36f-3c77dfcccce3","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اطلب عرض سعر","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true},{"id":"98c33a31-e3c9-5dca-8ded-8af443f1accc","type":"button","content":{"href":"https://wa.me/96181891959","label":"استفسر عبر واتساب","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"solid","footerVisible":true,"catalogPosition":1},"template":"solution-detail","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'من نحن | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين', 'ar/about', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"عن تريبل إتش | وسيط تأمين مرخّص في لبنان","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"عن تريبل إتش | وسيط تأمين مرخّص في لبنان","ImageUrl":"","Description":"اكتشف نهج تريبل إتش المستقل في التأمين ومقارناتها الواضحة ودعمها طويل الأمد للعملاء في لبنان."},"Description":"تعرّف على تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م. ونهجنا المستقل وترخيصنا في لبنان وكيفية تقديم المشورة والدعم لعملائنا.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar/about"}', '2026-08-08 09:41:34.118919+00', false, true, 'ar', '5c4f303a-5ac5-43b5-c61d-2e862610054f', 'about', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"812faae5-9f96-59e2-a2e3-05e817a0123d","type":"section","styles":{"size":"base","tone":"default","preset":"cinematic-tall","bordered":false},"content":{"intro":"تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م. وسيط تأمين مرخّص في لبنان، يقدم المشورة للأفراد والعائلات والشركات بشأن التغطية المناسبة. نقارن شركات التأمين ونوضح الفروق بوضوح ونرتّب الوثيقة ونواصل المتابعة خلال التجديدات والتعديلات والمطالبات.","items":[],"eyebrow":"عن تريبل إتش","heading":"مشورة مستقلة. دعم طويل الأمد.","imageAlt":"مكتب تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين في بيروت","mobileImageUrl":"/uploads/20260925154550-dc1c9bffce9145f1bdf9663db1d0f549.webp","desktopImageUrl":"/uploads/20260925153836-85fe144796ce48c6aeb2926068d65add.webp"},"visible":true,"position":0,"settings":{"sectionType":"hero-banner"}},{"id":"c4b453fc-3cef-5c00-939c-0b51a5122bca","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"b7f215b3-ebef-51a4-9772-d91771e16191","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"1e0dc0d2-7e5a-580f-be41-d80d8f1e0d5d","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"دورنا يتجاوز ترتيب وثيقة.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"b8c0fd32-7304-5f22-a1a9-e028f803e308","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"تظهر أهمية التأمين عندما تحتاج إلى الاعتماد عليه. لذلك لا ينتهي عملنا بإصدار الوثيقة. نفهم أولاً ما تحتاج إلى حمايته، ثم نتواصل مع شركات التأمين المناسبة في السوق اللبنانية ونقارن الشروط المهمة فعلاً: التغطية والحدود والاستثناءات والسعر وكيفية استجابة الوثيقة عند حدوث مشكلة. نوضح الفروق بوضوح ونتفاوض ونتواصل مع شركات التأمين نيابةً عنك ونواصل المتابعة خلال التعديلات والتجديدات والمطالبات."},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"text"}},{"id":"a32ffc67-b516-5697-9611-26ad30085742","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"content":{"intro":"مشورة واضحة ومقارنات شفافة وشركة وساطة تواصل المتابعة بعد ترتيب تغطيتك.","items":[{"text":"نشرح الأجزاء المهمة من الوثيقة بلغة واضحة، بما فيها ما يُغطّى وما يخضع لحدود وما يُستثنى، لتعرف بدقة ما تختاره."},{"text":"نقارن شركات التأمين المناسبة وخياراتها بما يتجاوز السعر لتتمكن من رؤية الفروق التي قد تهم عند استخدام الوثيقة."},{"text":"قد تتغير احتياجاتك بمرور الوقت. نراجع تغطيتك عند التجديد وعند الحاجة لتظل متوافقة مع ظروفك الشخصية أو العائلية أو التجارية."},{"text":"نبقى متاحين للتعديلات والتجديدات والأسئلة والمطالبات، ونتواصل مع شركات التأمين نيابةً عنك عند الحاجة."}],"heading":"ما الذي يمكنك توقعه من تريبل إتش؟"},"visible":true,"children":[],"settings":{"sectionType":"feature-list"}},{"id":"5d5d842b-b5fe-55d9-9d09-3b53d46f0750","type":"section","styles":{"size":"base","tone":"default","preset":"numbered-grid","bordered":true},"content":{"intro":"تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م. وسيط تأمين مرخّص في لبنان يعمل تحت إشراف وزارة الاقتصاد والتجارة.","items":[{"label":"الاسم القانوني","value":"تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م."},{"label":"ترخيص وسيط التأمين","value":"رقم 581"},{"label":"السجل التجاري","value":"رقم 2077214"},{"label":"دعم التغطية من تريبل إتش","value":"لبنان والخليج والعالم"}],"layout":"minimal","heading":"مرخّص ومسجّل وخاضع للمساءلة"},"visible":true,"position":2,"settings":{"sectionType":"statistics"}},{"id":"e05253a4-74c0-597c-b9a8-85525c4b5aef","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"36acf289-8c47-5c4e-a6fe-36646117deed","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"8bc4bd90-c866-5650-a486-2a010d49784c","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"ما الذي يدفعنا؟","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"87ed2012-819e-57cf-9f78-bb77b734fbf9","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"المبادئ التي توجه مشورتنا وتمثيلنا ودعمنا لعملائنا."},"visible":true},{"id":"2a845f86-79dd-5d73-ab88-adefb1e77849","type":"grid","styles":{"mobile":{"gridTemplateColumns":"1fr"},"desktop":{"gap":"24px","gridTemplateColumns":"repeat(3, 1fr)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"0dc67c01-bd7b-5cad-b7a6-7db8bb878643","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"4a835448-45a7-5fbe-9e54-30a30759c249","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"رسالتنا","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"b24fc3fe-bc15-57a0-b345-ee87d8633030","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"جعل التأمين في لبنان واضحاً ومختاراً بعناية ومفيداً فعلاً، ليفهم عملاؤنا ما يشترونه ويتمكنوا من الاعتماد على الدعم الذي يقف وراءه."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"696687fa-1ae1-5800-9a34-5ea28e905677","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"ff9ab6bb-5110-598e-829a-ca8db10e4348","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"رؤيتنا","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"ccabef8e-2d16-51f6-a00c-83eb924cc2b4","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أن نكون شركة الوساطة التي تثق بها العائلات والشركات اللبنانية وتوصي بها بعضها لبعض، والمعروفة بالشروحات الواضحة والوقوف إلى جانب العملاء وقت المطالبة."},"visible":true}]},{"id":"d905338e-e650-5a3b-b881-c1f995a682db","type":"stack","styles":{"desktop":{"gap":"12px","border":"1px solid var(--border)","padding":"28px"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"0e788167-55b2-5d29-a41d-1a56addb4a59","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"قيمنا","level":3},"visible":true},{"id":"af6bf604-0b93-56fd-b619-1f1a697f17d3","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"الاستقلالية والشفافية واللغة الواضحة والدفاع المهني عن مصالح العملاء، من اختيار التغطية إلى التجديدات والمطالبات."},"visible":true}]}]}]}],"settings":{"sectionType":"cards"}},{"id":"0629c6b4-310c-5c42-bb5b-03846994e227","type":"section","styles":{"mobile":{"paddingTop":"48px","paddingBottom":"48px"},"desktop":{"paddingTop":"80px","paddingBottom":"80px","backgroundColor":"var(--inverse)"}},"visible":true,"children":[{"id":"f47d9977-d8b4-5d8f-9af0-1a711d54968d","type":"container","visible":true,"children":[{"id":"971cb5e5-b13f-5ad2-b63d-d4c41305c824","type":"heading","styles":{"mobile":{"fontSize":"32px"},"desktop":{"fontSize":"44px"}},"content":{"text":"لنتحدث عن احتياجاتك التأمينية.","level":2},"visible":true},{"id":"3ce13a9e-b88d-54e0-bb06-b948715148b3","type":"text","styles":{"desktop":{"fontSize":"17px","maxWidth":"62ch","lineHeight":"1.7"}},"content":{"text":"أخبرنا بما تحتاج إلى حمايته وسنساعدك على فهم الخيارات."},"visible":true},{"id":"1edce135-51b3-5d65-a86d-a936a8561041","type":"button","content":{"href":"/ar/contact","label":"اتصل بنا","variant":"inverse"},"visible":true}]}],"settings":{"imageAlt":"","sectionType":"call-to-action","mobileImageUrl":"","desktopImageUrl":""}}],"settings":{"headerMode":"media-overlay","footerVisible":true},"template":"about","schemaVersion":1}');
INSERT INTO public.pages ("Id", "Title", "Slug", "UpdatedAt", "seo_data", "CreatedAt", "IsHomepage", "IsSystemPage", "Locale", "PageGroupId", "Template", "BuilderDocument") VALUES ('20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م.', 'ar', '2026-10-12 11:00:07+00', '{"Title":"وسيط تأمين في لبنان | تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م.","Robots":{"Index":true,"Follow":true},"OpenGraph":{"Title":"تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين ش.م.م. | حلول التأمين في لبنان","ImageUrl":"/uploads/20260816154116-cd5b8e9d00d84ddd97e1d44f87b9575f.webp","Description":"حلول تأمين شاملة للأفراد والعائلات والشركات في لبنان، مدعومة بمشورة مستقلة وعروض فورية ومشورة مستقلة ودعم مخصص على مدار الساعة طوال الأسبوع."},"Description":"تريبل إتش وسيط تأمين مرخّص في لبنان يقدم حلولاً شاملة للتأمين الصحي والسيارات والحياة والممتلكات والسفر والأعمال وغيرها من التأمينات الشخصية والتجارية، مع عروض فورية ودعم متخصص على مدار الساعة طوال الأسبوع.","CanonicalUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/ar"}', '2026-08-16 16:04:55.34904+00', true, true, 'ar', '8f839205-470a-bf04-8c4a-48d74ee3351d', 'home', '{"type":"page","children":[{"id":"a0f04ce1-09b0-5edf-b7e7-afebc8957d54","type":"section","styles":{"size":"base","tone":"default","preset":"cinematic-full","bordered":false},"content":{"intro":"تغطية صحية وتأمين سيارات وحماية شخصية وتجارية بشفافية، من شركة وساطة مستقلة تقارن السوق وتبقى إلى جانبك وقت المطالبة.","items":[{"href":"/ar/quote","label":"احصل على عرض سعر فوري","variant":"inverse"},{"href":"/ar/solutions","label":"استكشف حلول التأمين","variant":"inverseOutline"}],"eyebrow":"شركة وساطة تأمين مستقلة مرخّصة · لبنان","heading":"حماية متميزة مصممة لك.","imageAlt":"الرئيس التنفيذي لشركة تريبل إتش وسيط التأمين يراجع خيارات التغطية مع عميل.","mobileImageUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816180816-465a5e840970446ba130c10fdd56e365.webp","desktopImageUrl":"https://triplehbroker.com/uploads/20260816154116-cd5b8e9d00d84ddd97e1d44f87b9575f.webp"},"visible":true,"position":0,"settings":{"layoutGroup":"","section